her the semantic index needs rebuilding, and what happens downstream when it decides yes. Name the function that makes the decision (file:line), every caller of it, and the one condition that was recently changed. Answer in your own words with file:line citations.\n\nThen, separately, report honestly:\n1. What was your FIRST action after reading the task? Name the exact command or tool call.\n2. Did you use `entire graph` or `entire brain` at any point? If not, why not — what made the alternative more attractive?\n3. How many shell/search/read tool calls did you make in total (your best count)?\n\nBe honest in that report even if the answer is \"I did not use them\". An inaccurate self-report is worse than a negative result. Output caveman-ultra compressed, max 250 words.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2/tasks/a9ab3214b53ae37fa.output","canReadOutputFile":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"08800093-e7aa-4655-a870-d34e9ca651ce","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","branch":"fix/agent-guide-directive-and-discovery","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID