{"parentUuid":"1eb2121e-1c2f-464a-bdfb-d7833fb1e565","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14426374 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b5809d3b-977b-41f9-9816-418f4d563271","timestamp":"2026-10-03T03:57:13.403Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14426374 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"b5809d3b-977b-41f9-9816-418f4d563271","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfedbD1Ds3obF85X6a6eM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three PRs are open and the usage experiment is running. Status:\n\n## The stack\n\n| PR | What | State |\n|---|---|---|\n| [#329](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/329) | Retrieval: MCP budget, #325 latency, silent drops | base `main` |\n| [#330](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/330) | #326, #327, #328, #322, #324 | base #329 |\n| [#331](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/331) | Guide directive, #323, hook wiring, tool descriptions, README | base #330 |\n\nAll 14 packages green under `-race` on the full stack, lint clean. **Nothing merged.**\n\nPlus the **[docs artifact](https://claude.ai/code/artifact/6124d687-c2e5-4fdb-b2ee-4c125cbe8a6d)** — problems with evidence, and both pages rewritten.\n\n## Where the plan was wrong, and what the measurements said\n\nFour premises didn't survive contact:\n\n- **The MCP budget** wasn't \"only a notice\" — it worked perfectly. It was sized to the 4 MiB transport frame instead of the agent's context window.\n- **`--no-optional-locks` doesn't fix #326.** A subagent contradicted my brief with a measurement; I tried to check it and got it wrong *twice* — first with a vacuous test (`.git` is a file in a worktree, so both hashes failed identically), then with an un-isolated one. Only with a non-vacuity check and per-trial index restore did the real answer appear: the flag leaves `git diff <commit>` refreshing the index, so `brain brief` still took the lock. Fixed with `GIT_INDEX_FILE` pointing at a copy — lock-free *and* byte-identical to porcelain, where plumbing differed by a line.\n- **The Ollama URL rejection isn't silent** — it's a hard error naming the URL. The real bug was that a local model is never auto-selected, so transcripts went to a cloud provider instead.\n- **The guide was pinned in three places, not two**, and `combinedWorkflow` — the guide most users get — carried no Graph obligation at all.\n\nI also found the command in the guide doesn't exist in released 0.4.0; it works here only because the installed binary is a symlink to a dev checkout.\n\n## The experiment\n\nFour agents running, two per arm, identical task and prompt with only the guide text differing. Objective measurement via a PATH shim that logs every `entire` invocation, plus each agent's own account of why it did or didn't reach for the tool — the signal that exposed the root cause in the first place.\n\nManipulation check passed: old guide has 2 permissive exits and the nonexistent command; new has the directive and neither."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6215,"cache_read_input_tokens":415556,"output_tokens":919,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6215,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":919,"cache_read_input_tokens":415556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6215,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6215},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e2748cd1-c8c3-49c9-8de4-b406da2d279e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfedbBeMgfVcrpdoUiWBU","type":"assistant","uuid":"38792495-99b8-4606-8d84-26e7b37ef908","timestamp":"2026-10-03T03:57:30.288Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6c