{"type":"last-prompt","lastPrompt":"now investiage and sysnthiese what is taken care of and not; for the not things spilit it out to mutiple subangets and fix all and any problems and then you re test that by repoducing all fo these thi…","leafUuid":"e4291b8f-0b0c-476a-bd5e-eca9b1e987ae","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2"}
