{"parentUuid":"c00ad2d1-c187-4e14-8e39-483c3a86e790","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfeeJ3bKbGqZCBFbL9zGq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q5jUmCL88cQJJn1GXPmVEs","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory\ngrep -q \"verification-harness-false-pass\" MEMORY.md || cat >> MEMORY.md <<'EOF'\n- [My verification harness false-passes](verification-harness-false-pass.md) — 3x in one session: `timeout` absent on macOS, `.git` is a file in worktrees, un-isolated trials; a false pass is silent and ends the search\n- [--no-optional-locks is not enough](git-no-optional-locks-insufficient.md) — it stops `git status` but NOT `git diff <commit>`; plumbing changes the answer, GIT_INDEX_FILE=copy keeps both\nEOF\ntail -3 MEMORY.md\ncd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide\necho \"=== CI poll ===\"\nfor i in 1 2 3 4 5 6; do\n  p=$(gh pr view 329 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json statusCheckRollup --jq '[.statusCheckRollup[]?|select(.conclusion==null)]|length' 2>/dev/null)\n  f=$(gh pr view 329 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json statusCheckRollup --jq '[.statusCheckRollup[]?|select(.conclusion==\"FAILURE\")]|length' 2>/dev/null)\n  echo \"  #329 pending=$p failures=$f\"\n  [ \"$p\" = \"0\" ] && break\n  python3 -c \"import time;time.sleep(115)\"\ndone","description":"Index the memories and poll CI","timeout":1500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":837,"cache_read_input_tokens":446619,"output_tokens":629,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":837,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":629,"cache_read_