e.\n\nCaveat on the usage half, stated plainly: the guide text was injected into each agent's\nPROMPT, not read from `.entire/agent-guide.md`. So this measures whether the wording works\nonce in context, not whether the file gets read. It cannot reproduce the 0.34% baseline and\nshould not be quoted as if it did. n=2 per arm.\nEOF\necho \"appended; still untracked:\"; git status --short GRAPH-FEEDBACK.md","description":"Record the experiment finding for graph","timeout":600000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b84cbccc-998a-41f4-8ea5-ee4be0e6b3fe","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfehGu8Q5hCGrHL8oR8ep","type":"assistant","uuid":"873dd5de-aad6-4d3c-9fef-c0122d9c588d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T04:45:51.093Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
