{"parentUuid":"59e5a48d-bfc3-4e65-80bb-5b3d235e0744","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14354469 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f6c45f3f-c95d-484b-a114-a39bdfa812be","timestamp":"2026-10-03T04:47:07.166Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14354469 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-safety","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"f6c45f3f-c95d-484b-a114-a39bdfa812be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfehPtfotfW6BPMTHd8iC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Monitor armed for the final two. Here's the complete state of the work.\n\n## Three PRs, stacked, nothing merged\n\n| PR | Scope | CI |\n|---|---|---|\n| [#329](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/329) | MCP budget, #325 latency, four silent-failure sites, Windows path fix | **Checks ✅ Findings ✅ Up-to-date ✅** — only Approvals red |\n| [#330](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/330) | #326, #327, #328, #322, #324, scratch-index mtime fix | 27 green, no failures, settling |\n| [#331](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/331) | Guide directive, #323, hook wiring, 23 tool descriptions, README | 27 green, no failures, settling |\n\n#329's gate breakdown is the one I wanted to see: the **agent review found no blocking issues**, and the only failure is *\"No reviewers have approved this trail\"* — waiting on you, as instructed.\n\nAlso delivered: the **[docs artifact](https://claude.ai/code/artifact/6124d687-c2e5-4fdb-b2ee-4c125cbe8a6d)** (problems + corrected pages), and the usage experiment written into the uncommitted `GRAPH-FEEDBACK.md`.\n\n## What I'd flag for your attention\n\n**Five of the plan's premises were wrong**, and the measurements were worth more than the plan: the MCP budget was sized to the transport frame not the agent; `--no-optional-locks` doesn't fix #326; the Ollama URL rejection was never silent; the guide was pinned in three places; and the guide most users get carried no Graph obligation at all.\n\n**CI caught two bugs my local suite structurally could not** — a Unix-only path check, and a scratch index that silently dropped worktree edits by breaking git's racily-clean detection. Both were real product bugs, not test artifacts.\n\n**The experiment's negative result is the more useful half.** The guide change does move the first action to `graph search`. But in three of four runs the agent complied, got a decoy — `brainBriefSemanticNeedsCurrentBoundary` ranking first for \"decide whether the index needs rebuilding\", which isn't that decision — and fell back to grep, which found the answer every time. Winning the first call is the easy half; an agent that complies once and gets nothing won't comply twice. I'd put the next effort into ranking on intent-phrased queries rather than further wording changes.\n\nAnd I should be straight about the experiment's limit: I injected the guide into each agent's prompt rather than having it read `.entire/agent-guide.md`, so it tests the wording, not the file path. It can't reproduce the 0.34% baseline and shouldn't be quoted as if it did. n=2 per arm."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_read_input_tokens":491361,"output_tokens":943,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":943,"cache_read_input_tokens":491361,"cache_creation_input_tokens":678,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":678},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e141867c-5b0c-4bbd-b03a-3f88f37dda5b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfehPsKhwykhgaCR8f7hm","type":"assistant","uuid":"cf26bf95-27b4-41a4-8859-27166b9a5198","timestamp":"2026-10-03T04:47:25.313Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd