{"parentUuid":"6dad9349-93c6-4852-83a0-6ba9553d1225","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14350401 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ef5497d2-1a21-4724-a7bd-9a5c7d43965e","timestamp":"2026-10-03T04:52:25.275Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14350401 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"ef5497d2-1a21-4724-a7bd-9a5c7d43965e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfehoLC7sFMb2KWw9cDrJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done and verified. All three PRs settled identically: **30 checks passing, zero failures**, with the only red being the gate that's yours to clear.\n\n| PR | Checks | Findings | Up to date | Approvals |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| [#329](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/329) → `main` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ awaiting you |\n| [#330](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/330) → #329 | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ awaiting you |\n| [#331](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/331) → #330 | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ awaiting you |\n\nAgent review found no blocking issues on any of them. Trails [#242](https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/242), [#246](https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/246), [#247](https://entire.io/gh/entireio/entire-brain/trails/247). **Nothing merged.**\n\n## What shipped\n\nAll 14 filed issues and reported problems are addressed across the stack, every fix with a regression test verified by weakening — the guard patched compile-clean, the test shown red, the assertion recorded. Plus the **[docs artifact](https://claude.ai/code/artifact/6124d687-c2e5-4fdb-b2ee-4c125cbe8a6d)** with both tabs.\n\nMeasured, not estimated: `status` **24.19s → 2.42s** on the real 961-fact brain; the MCP budget cut from ~52k to ~13k tokens of JSON against a client that refused at ~25k; `FilterWarnings` was discarding **every** index warning in this repo while reporting a clean index.\n\n## Two things to carry forward\n\n**The plan was wrong in five places, and the measurements were worth more than the plan.** The MCP trimming was never broken — it was sized to the transport frame. `--no-optional-locks` doesn't fix #326. The Ollama rejection was never silent. The guide was pinned in three places, and the guide most users get had no Graph obligation at all.\n\n**CI found two bugs my local suite structurally could not** — a Unix-only path check, and a scratch index that silently dropped worktree edits by breaking git's racily-clean detection. I also wrote a test, proved it didn't fire, and deleted it rather than ship protection that doesn't protect.\n\n## What I'd look at next\n\nThe experiment's negative result. The guide fix does move the first action to `graph search` — but in three of four runs the agent complied, got a decoy, and grep found the answer instead. Winning the first call is the easy half. I'd spend the next effort on ranking for intent-phrased queries, not more wording. That's written up in the uncommitted `GRAPH-FEEDBACK.md`, with the experiment's own limitation stated plainly: the guide went into the prompt, not the file, so it can't be quoted against the 0.34% baseline."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":779,"cache_read_input_tokens":495649,"output_tokens":1010,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":779,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1010,"cache_read_input_tokens":495649,"cache_creation_input_tokens":779,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":779},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ddcbbd3f-bb27-4940-8ab9-4a1529b73c30","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfehoJoXQKdCgoeo3VHPi","type":"assistant","uuid":"4aca3fd8-9954-43de-b757-c7aeffe7bcb1","timestamp":"2026-10-03T04:52:42.300Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2",