{"parentUuid":"3e8a5480-910b-48b1-ade1-d51e9acb0142","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1f631488-98e1-4a43-9fbe-9c37ea106c75","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013it6SgNdNimjR11zXGC1KG","type":"tool_result","content":"entire-brain is an external-command plugin for the Entire CLI.\n\nIt builds a local, inspectable repository brain from retained sessions, seed\ncontext, docs, history, semantic records, and durable facts, then exposes\nretrieval, verification, evaluation, and MCP surfaces for agents.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain [flags]\n  entire-brain [command]\n\nSet up the brain & agents:\n  setup          Build the brain and start background updates\n  add            Clone a repository, fetch its Entire history, and build its brain\n  init-agents    Install coordinated agent instructions\n  agent-guide    Preview repository-specific agent instructions\n  mcp            Serve local brain tools over MCP (stdio by default, or HTTP with --http)\n  webhook        Notify another service when this brain changes\n  config         Inspect or initialize plugin configuration\n\nSearch & explore the brain:\n  overview       Summarize the project, its structure, and decisions\n  brief          Gather relevant context for a task\n  query          Search the brain (hybrid by default)\n  get            Fetch a brain item by ID\n  multi-get      Fetch multiple brain items by ID\n  dash           Browse the brain in an interactive dashboard\n\nDurable facts & patterns:\n  recall         Retrieve durable facts matching a query for the current branch\n  remember       Record a durable fact about this repository\n  distill        Extract durable facts from sessions (requires an agent)\n  facts          Review, promote, and garbage-collect durable facts\n  verify         Verify durable fact anchors against local retained sources\n  patterns       Inspect and rebuild recurring patterns from sessions\n\nSessions & conversation memory:\n  memory         Manage conversation indexing and background jobs\n  privacy        Control which captured sessions the brain retains\n\nCode & semantic index:\n  inspect        Explore code, dependencies, and change history\n  show           Show one semantic brain record\n  entities       Find checkpoints and sessions that changed a symbol\n  viz            Explore the brain as a graph in your browser\n  repair         Rebuild derived semantic indexes","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9caea351-b281-446a-941c-ece100f9767d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T13:15:25.341Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"entire-brain is an external-command plugin for the Entire CLI.\n\nIt builds a local, inspectable repository brain from retained sessions, seed\ncontext, docs, history, semantic records, and durable facts, then exposes\nretrieval, verification, evaluation, and MCP surfaces for agents.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain [flags]\n  entire-brain [command]\n\nSet up the brain & agents:\n  setup          Build the brain and start background updates\n  add            Clone a repository, fetch its Entire history, and build its brain\n  init-agents    Install coordinated agent instructions\n  agent-guide    Preview repository-specific agent instructions\n  mcp            Serve local brain tools over MCP (stdio by default, or HTTP with --http)\n  webhook        Notify another service when this brain changes\n  config         Inspect or initialize plugin configuration\n\nSearch & explore the brain:\n  overview       Summarize the project, its structure, and decisions\n  brief          Gather relevant context for a task\n  query          Search the brain (hybrid by default)\n  get            Fetch a brain item by ID\n  multi-get      Fetch multiple brain items by ID\n  dash           Browse the brain in an interactive dashboard\n\nDurable facts & patterns:\n  recall         Retrieve durable facts matching a query for the current branch\n  remember       Record a durable fact about this repository\n  distill        Extract durable facts from sessions (requires an agent)\n  facts          Review, promote, and garbage-collect durable facts\n  verify         Verify durable fact anchors against local retained sources\n  patterns       Inspect and rebuild recurring patterns from sessions\n\nSessions & conversation memory:\n  memory         Manage conversation indexing and background jobs\n  privacy        Control which captured sessions the brain retains\n\nCode & semantic index:\n  inspect        Explore code, dependencies, and change history\n  show           Show one semantic brain record\n  entities       Find checkpoints and sessions that changed a symbol\n  viz            Explore the brain as a graph in your browser\n  repair         Rebuild derived semantic indexes","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8e9a0a48-b496-450e-b6b0-d62356e56179","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","branch":"fix/agent-guide-directive-and-discovery","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3e8a5480-910b-48b1-ade1-d51e9acb0142","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"b