{"parentUuid":"252740e6-200e-43d7-aaa8-ffc79b0f40dd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"1f631488-98e1-4a43-9fbe-9c37ea106c75","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019DUkGYHyWbq1aPG2KcSrNM","type":"tool_result","content":"  repair         Rebuild derived semantic indexes\n\nBrain state & maintenance:\n  status         Show brain coverage, freshness, and workspace state\n  stats          Show brain record counts and breakdowns\n  docs           Inspect how non-code documents are read into the brain\n  refresh        Create or refresh the repository brain\n  watch          Keep the brain up to date automatically\n  gc             Prune old local semantic overlays and snapshots\n  reset          Remove local generated brain data\n\nWorkspaces & sharing:\n  workspace      Manage local multi-repo brain workspaces\n  bundle         Import or export local brain bundles\n  publish        Publish the local brain to hosted Entire (opt-in)\n\nMiscellaneous:\n  path           Print the persistent brain path for a repo path or URL\n  repo-identity  Find and resolve conflicting brain stores\n  capabilities   List supported features and retrieval sources\n  doctor         Diagnose environment and brain pipeline problems\n  bench          Benchmark semantic indexing performance\n  version        Print plugin version\n  help           Help about any command\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help      help for entire-brain\n  -v, --version   version for entire-brain\n\nUse \"entire-brain [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bccf8b0e-1014-4cb6-890f-18dc14f91a8a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T13:15:30.259Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  repair         Rebuild derived semantic indexes\n\nBrain state & maintenance:\n  status         Show brain coverage, freshness, and workspace state\n  stats          Show brain record counts and breakdowns\n  docs           Inspect how non-code documents are read into the brain\n  refresh        