{"parentUuid":"285ac097-3a0d-4ab3-8e17-3dc8330037a3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"302b6238-0da7-4498-8b98-1f041940a406","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L4pvaKX2GcYj9LwkJ2R8WM","type":"tool_result","content":"13:It came from benchmark arm-fairness doctrine, which forbids giving one arm an instruction the other lacks. Correct for an A/B cell; fatal for shipped text — in a user's repo there is no second arm, only an agent deciding whether to bother. Measured afterwards: **332 graph calls against 96,987 exploration calls (0.34%)**, graph-first rate **0** in every session sampled.\n25:**#323 — the guide named a command that does not exist.** `entire graph query` is absent from the released v0.4.0 dispatch. The binary installed here is a symlink to a dev checkout where it *does* exist, which is how this survived review. `search` is the only verb correct against every graph a user may have: the sole verb in 0.4.0, still an alias on 0.4.1+. Verified against the running build.\n41:## Verification\n43:`TestNormalGuideStaysDirective` pins the absence of every exit **by its exact words** and the presence of the directive. `TestGuidesNameOnlyCommandsGraphExposes` pins #323. Both verified by weakening, along with the four hook-merge guards.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"a8f960f5-6ffb-4512-a4df-a7c6ca7adf9d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T13:44:17.659Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"13:It came from benchmark arm-fairness doctrine, which forbids giving one arm an instruction the other lacks. Correct for an A/B cell; fatal for shipped text — in a user's repo there is no second arm, only an agent deciding whether to bother. Measured afterwards: **332 graph calls against 96,987 exploration calls (0.34%)**, graph-first rate **0** in every session sampled.\n25:**#323 — the guide named a command that does not exist.** `entire graph query` is absent from the released v0.4.0 dispatch. The binary installed here is a symlink to a dev checkout where it *does* exist, which is how this survived review. `search` is the only verb correct against every graph a user may have: the sole verb in 0.4.0, still an alias on 0.4.1+. Verified against the running build.\n41:## Verification\n43:`TestNormalGuideStaysDirective` pins the absence of every exit **by its exact words** and the presence of the directive. `TestGuidesNameOnlyCommandsGraphExposes` pins #323. Both verified by weakening, along with the four hook-merge guards.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"4dd28085-4ee0-40f4-9e98-0822f1ff9a0f","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","branch":"fix/agent-guide-directive-and-discovery","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"entireio","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"285ac097-3a0d-4ab3-8e17-3dc8330037a3","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
