batim feedback, including anything that contradicts the result.\n5. If the bar is not cleared, that is reported as the finding, with what remains unfixed. A result\n   that says \"usage did not improve\" is a successful execution of this plan.\n\nNothing merges without your approval; PRs #329–#331 stay unmerged and this work stacks on #331.\n","isAgent":false,"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/dynamic-petting-globe.md"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"247f1fc5-dbff-44ba-8c9f-5a8a073b6eee","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
