{"parentUuid":"8178ffe1-7951-46b5-bb25-b521b72aa1e3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14883841 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f7f8f273-a587-44d5-801b-edacd5ffb6e2","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:15:00.524Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14883841 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"f7f8f273-a587-44d5-801b-edacd5ffb6e2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffShayhcTZ5Q6RLknNxz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The loop is now actually running. Status:\n\n## Fixed this round (all three blockers)\n\n**1. The hook was installed and inert — my bug.** `--file \"$CLAUDE_FILE_PATH\"` named a variable Claude Code doesn't define. I captured the real payload rather than guessing: the path arrives as `tool_input.file_path` in **stdin JSON**. Now parsed, with `notebook_path` too since the matcher includes NotebookEdit.\n\nI also caught a flaw in my own fix (exiting 1 on unparseable stdin = an error on every edit), and found that my tests didn't guard the thing that broke — neutering the call site left every helper test green. The replacement drives the real command over a real brain with a real fact, delivered only via stdin, and fails on that mutation.\n\n**2. Brain's documented install never delivered the Graph directive.** `entire brain init-agents` alone yields `enabled:[\"brain\"]` and zero Graph instructions, because activation is *recorded in the guide*, not probed from installed plugins. The README now names both commands.\n\n**3. Last writer wins.** Each product rewrites the shared guide from its own copy, so graph's `init-agents` was overwriting brain's fixed text with graph's — reintroducing the `query` verb #323 fixed. The README now specifies brain **last**, and the arm build confirms it works: `graph-directive=1` in A1/A2.\n\nAlso removed a README sentence that was provably false — it claimed the guide covers Graph \"when Graph is installed\", which isn't true unless graph's `init-agents` ran.\n\n## Arms running\n\nThree clean `graphmark` clones, pinned binaries, 10 identical intent-phrased tasks each, prompts that never mention a tool (naming one would be asymmetric help):\n\n| arm | guide | Graph directive | hook |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| A0 | no | 0 | no |\n| A1 | yes | 1 | no |\n| A2 | yes | 1 | yes |\n\nFirst tool calls are already separating in the predicted direction: **A1 and A2 open with `graph search` on both tasks; A0 makes none.** A0's only calls are `checkpoint explain`, which is Entire's capture machinery rather than a locate action — I'll exclude it from the metric and say so.\n\n30 sessions underway. I'll score from the shim log and transcripts, then collect per-session feedback on what went wrong, then loop on whatever that exposes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1054,"cache_read_input_tokens":637021,"output_tokens":808,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1054,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":808,"cache_read_input_tokens":637021,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1054,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1054},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0b5d4e2b-c2e8-4eea-b3d7-a2f213ce00c5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffShZZ8U4iBwFDqTJ6W3","type":"assistant","uuid":"510c59f5-fa76-4a25-b2cd-b658004666d2","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:15:12.833Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
