{"parentUuid":"1d28565e-7717-4b1b-9ded-7d48d6e4ce53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffSomxRMZAfDTB95g7mA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixes committed. 7/30 sessions done, and the separation is holding:\n\n| arm | used a tool | tool-first |\n|---|---|---|\n| **A0** no guide | **0/3** | **0/3** |\n| **A1** guide | **3/3** | **3/3** |\n| **A2** guide + hook | **2/2** | **2/2** |\n\nThat's the measurement the earlier invalid run couldn't produce: the control arm is at **zero**, so there's real headroom, and the guide arrives as a **file** rather than injected into the prompt.\n\nOne early sign of the thing I can't fix: A1 shows **1/3 used-then-abandoned** — the agent called the tool, then went back to grep. That's the graph recall problem surfacing exactly as predicted.\n\nI'll report the full table with bootstrap CIs when all 30 land, then collect each session's account of what went wrong and loop on it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2510,"cache_read_input_tokens":643662,"output_tokens":295,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2510,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":295,"cache_read_input_tokens":643662,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2510,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2510},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"abeabce5-3030-4536-899b-9384138034cf","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffSokT8tJTnhroJdLapi","type":"assistant","uuid":"64615625-89fe-470c-bc08-4900c37f76b3","timestamp":"2026-10-03T