{"parentUuid":"1690dc89-b9ad-49f4-babd-3053672a42c1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffT1yM7CA5XBo1mFUQfh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Graph findings are recorded and handed off: **[entireio/entire-graph#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319)**, with both repros held out as evaluation-only, plus the `symbol_name` schema gap and the exact-corpus question. The graph session has the summary.\n\nTwo things worth flagging from this stretch:\n\n**The recall failure isn't repo-specific.** I'd only measured it on entire-brain (Go). A session on graphmark (Python), instructed to search first, reported unprompted that the top hits were *\"`load_validated_success_gates`, `score` and `screen`, none of them relevant\"* — then succeeded with grep. Same shape: the right answer isn't in the returned set at all.\n\n**Their prompt-symmetry warning paid off immediately.** I had nearly put *\"did you use the tools?\"* into the task prompt — which names a tool to an arm that has no guide, i.e. pure asymmetric help, the exact trap that killed their past A/Bs. Feedback now runs as a separate `--resume` turn after the scored one, so task text stays byte-identical across arms.\n\nArms at 10/30, standing at A0 **0/3** on both metrics vs A1 **3/3** and A2 **2/2**. Round 2 will fix the competing-directives defect I introduced and re-run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1323,"cache_read_input_tokens":655379,"output_tokens":439,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1323,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":439,"cache_read_input_tokens":655379,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1323,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1323},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"77429522-8f4b-4631-88a7-2433f72cd85c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffT1vdebxc9RJnv86dQY","type":"assistant","uuid":"deddb631-1516-4b3b-bba5-fbfeeb9a015d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:19:16.957Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
