ool, feedback as a SEPARATE --resume turn after the scored turn,\npaired symmetric gating, median + bootstrap CI beside every rate, and outcome\nmetrics (solved / turns / cost / tokens) reported beside usage.\n\n## Pre-registered, unchanged from round 1\n  sessions with >=1 Graph or Brain call   A1 >= 9/10\n  tool-first rate                        A1 >= 0.7\n  used-then-abandoned                    A1 <= 3/10   (reported, not optimised:\n                                         bounded by graph recall, see #319)\nNEW, and the one that matters for value:\n  solved on the RELATIONSHIP stratum     A1 > A0, or the tool is not pulling\n                                         its weight on the question class it\n                                         exists for.\nEOF\necho \"recorded\"\necho \"sessions: $(grep -c 'exit=' \"$E/logs/progress.txt\")/30  arms: $(grep -c DONE \"$E/logs/progress.txt\")/3\"","description":"Record the round-2 design and check progress","timeout":900000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ccf3e9d9-45bf-4775-93ca-bbfca16b6671","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CffTbu3qiER7d1U8ikYwA","type":"assistant","uuid":"263a539a-d3e7-45d7-ade7-34457294557a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:27:11.909Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
