{"parentUuid":"52fad786-9c84-436f-acf7-6a2aa3d023b7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14830424 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"571f068a-d06f-42e1-a6c3-e0262d4f258d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:42:51.279Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14830424 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"571f068a-d06f-42e1-a6c3-e0262d4f258d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffUppiNeaRybdiK9jkf1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Round 1 is complete and scored; round 2's arms are building. Here is the full round-1 result and what round 2 changes.\n\n## Round 1 — n=10 per arm, all 10 tasks paired\n\n**Usage: fixed, decisively.**\n\n| arm | used a tool | tool-first |\n|---|---|---|\n| A0 no guide | **0/10** | **0/10** |\n| A1 guide | **10/10** [1.00, 1.00] | **10/10** |\n| A2 guide + hook | **10/10** [1.00, 1.00] | **10/10** |\n\nFisher exact **p = 1.1 × 10⁻⁵**. Both usage bars cleared. A2 ≈ A1, so the **wording** did the work and the hook added nothing measurable here.\n\n**Outcome: no benefit, and the bar I said mattered most failed.**\n\nAll three arms solved 9/10 at indistinguishable turns, cost and tokens. And:\n\n> used-then-abandoned: A1 **6/10** — pre-registered pass was ≤3/10\n\nIn 6 of 10 sessions the agent complied exactly, got a non-answer, and went back to grep. That's [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319) measured rather than anecdotal.\n\n## Three defects fixed, each found a different way\n\n| how | defect |\n|---|---|\n| clean-env probe | hook named a nonexistent env var — **installed and inert** |\n| clean-env install | brain's documented setup shipped **no Graph directive at all** |\n| **agent self-report** | two competing \"first action\" absolutes → agent **silently dropped Brain** |\n\nNone was visible from source. The third only exists at execution time.\n\n## Two of my own design errors, now corrected\n\nRound 1 couldn't test *value*, and both reasons were mine: graphmark has **one** function with 3+ cross-file callers (nothing multi-hop to find), and ten single-file locate tasks are grep's home ground.\n\nRound 2: `cli` fixture (**10/40** density vs ~1), a 5-task relationship stratum on symbols verified to have 5–8 callers each, and the sequence fix in place.\n\nI also caught my round-2 ground truth being **wrong on 2 of 5** locate answers — the shadow branch is in `checkpoint/ephemeral.go`, not where my heuristic grep put it. Those are now accept-sets, since \"where is X\" legitimately has several right answers.\n\nArms building now; 30 sessions and a feedback turn each follow."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1409,"cache_read_input_tokens":690192,"output_tokens":832,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1409,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":832,"cache_read_input_tokens":690192,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1409,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1409},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1db47c8c-7339-4ffe-a576-f019ebf4d40e","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffUpjqvWFt85PMzzBqkj","type":"assistant","uuid":"f7c57420-041c-4972-bb78-f66592a4b3cb","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:43:04.717Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
