{"parentUuid":"aaaab756-738c-419a-86c7-549551728d01","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14795243 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a5be6674-2c5f-4ca8-ad50-b6d6826fe44d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:27:15.562Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14795243 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"a5be6674-2c5f-4ca8-ad50-b6d6826fe44d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CffYD9tWWSSip9ZqmTMeq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The replication is running and round 3 is designed around the fix for my recurring error.\n\n## The replication's early read\n\n**rep-B1 = 5 locate calls, rep-B2 = 5** — dead even, against round 2's 2 vs 9. That's what variance looks like, and it's the answer I expected given there's no mechanism by which an `Edit|Write` hook could affect read-only tasks.\n\n## Round 3 fixes the real blocker\n\nThree task sets in a row failed the same way, and I finally see the common cause: **I kept grading on whether the answer *named* the right thing — and naming is exactly what grep delivers.** Changing fixtures and task wording couldn't fix that, because the flaw was in the grading, not the tasks.\n\nSo round 3 grades on a **compile**:\n\n> *\"Add a parameter to `AsTextGenerator`, update every call site, and leave `go build ./...` passing.\"*\n\nThat can't be faked by text search. An incomplete caller set doesn't produce a weaker-sounding answer — it produces a **build failure**. And it removes me from the loop: `go build` is the ground truth, so there's no ground-truth derivation of mine to get wrong, which I did twice (2 of 5 locate answers, and a file-recall metric that scored the greppable half of the question).\n\nIt's also exactly what `entire graph impact` claims to answer. If the tool has value on relationships, it shows up there or nowhere.\n\nThe hardest targets are the interface-returning ones like `AsTextGenerator` (8 callers) — a caller can satisfy an interface without ever naming the function, so grep systematically under-counts and the build catches it.\n\nPre-registered before any session runs: **build-pass rate B1 > B0, or the tool doesn't help on the question class it exists for** — and that's the finding, not a cue to try a fourth task design."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1018,"cache_read_input_tokens":725569,"output_tokens":600,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1018,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":600,"cache_read_input_tokens":725569,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1018,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1018},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"cb179e01-4f57-42cb-a812-e446a9f9360a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffYD7pz7EwohK9apjsSc","type":"assistant","uuid":"72951ba9-4e36-447a-8a93-474986b1fe0c","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:27:25.394Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
