{"parentUuid":"cfb334c8-c235-4ae5-99cc-a0a8f9a3b750","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg1q3gbQgbXCGZoTiKZV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The baseline passes the stricter gate too, so the metric is sound before anything runs.\n\nThat catch matters: `go build` skips `_test.go`, so an agent could have passed by updating production call sites while leaving test call sites broken — and \"update every call site\" includes those. `go vet` compiles tests, so it's the honest gate. Verified the untouched tree still passes it, which means a later `FAIL-vet` is genuinely the agent's miss.\n\nPrep is at 2/6 and runs ~6 min per clone, dominated by `entire brain setup` indexing cli's 1390 Go files."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_read_input_tokens":741126,"output_tokens":646,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":646,"cache_read_input_tokens":741126,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6c4d54a8-f969-4301-bf38-c5093ad8adeb","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfg1q1xAbSR8adUnUrHsQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"9357c5f5-f4f6-4059-b3e6-5298a5035210","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:29:31.977Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv