{"parentUuid":"79b86593-3b1a-4fef-8917-6a1fefeb642c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14987674 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8356cf1e-fd98-4ed4-b741-5c2a421ad343","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:29:35.953Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14987674 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"8356cf1e-fd98-4ed4-b741-5c2a421ad343","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg1qjnbfb6ekXT6h3HqS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That monitor will auto-launch the sessions the moment prep completes, so there's no idle gap.\n\nHere's the state of the whole loop, which is now three rounds deep:\n\n## What's settled\n\n**Usage is fixed, and it replicated.** No-guide arms used the tools **0/9** and **0/10** across two fixtures and two task sets. Guide arms used them. Fisher exact p = 1.1 × 10⁻⁵ in round 1.\n\n**Three real defects fixed**, each surfaced by a different method, none visible from source — the hook was installed-and-inert, brain's documented install shipped no Graph directive, and two competing absolutes made an agent silently drop Brain. All committed on PR #331's branch, weakening-verified.\n\n**The round-2 anomaly was noise.** B1 2/9 vs B2 8/9 looked significant (p ≈ 0.015) with no mechanism behind it. The replication reversed the ordering — B1 19 calls, B2 11. Treating a p-value without a mechanism as a result would have been wrong.\n\n## What round 3 answers\n\nWhether usage *buys* anything. Rounds 1 and 2 couldn't tell, and the reason was consistent: **I graded on whether the answer named the right thing, and naming is what grep does.** Changing fixtures and wording never addressed that.\n\nRound 3 grades on `go build ./... && go vet ./...` after a real signature change. Four properties the earlier rounds lacked: grep can't fake it, I can't mis-derive the ground truth, tests are included in the gate, and it's precisely what `entire graph impact` claims to answer.\n\nBoth validity preconditions are checked — baseline passes the strict gate, and the no-guide arm genuinely has no entire instructions despite cli shipping a 1601-line `AGENTS.md`.\n\nPre-registered: **C1 > C0 on build-pass, or the tool doesn't help on its own question class.** If it comes back null, that's the answer, not a prompt for a fourth design."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":773,"cache_read_input_tokens":742360,"output_tokens":664,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":773,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":664,"cache_read_input_tokens":742360,"cache_creation_input_tokens":773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":773},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"009b8954-ae4e-4871-9e15-5e1b915782e9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfg1qgrECQezN3vQcTQ3j","type":"assistant","uuid":"c026ddeb-5113-4155-8718-61b4f2d415d2","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:29:47.497Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
