{"parentUuid":"c29ce46c-5147-4e62-bcb4-7afe2a86ac4c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14976888 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"424e1f89-e88a-4eb1-b253-63bdedbfa210","timestamp":"2026-10-03T21:57:12.430Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14976888 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"424e1f89-e88a-4eb1-b253-63bdedbfa210","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg3wqbjfh1QdEsE6cFRf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Prep is at 4/6 and advancing normally — C1-t1 has its guide installed, setup is running on C1-t2. Monitor will fire C1's sessions automatically at 6/6.\n\nWhile that finishes, the shape of the full answer is already clear enough to state:\n\n**The thing I was asked to fix is fixed.** Agents now use Brain and Graph: no-guide arms sat at 0/9 and 0/10 across two fixtures and two task sets; guide arms used them every time. That replicated, and three genuine defects fell out of the work — including my own inert hook, which only a clean-env probe could have caught.\n\n**The thing I can't fix is the reason it doesn't yet pay.** Three independent lines point the same way:\n\n- round 1: in **6/10** sessions the agent complied, got a non-answer, went back to grep\n- [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319): the real deciders were **absent from the returned set** on two repos and two languages — recall, not ranking\n- round 3: **`go build` is a better impact tool than any index** — complete, authoritative, free\n\nThe bottleneck is what the tool returns, not whether agents reach for it. And the ranking/recall half sits with Codex under the study-7 prereg, which is the right place for it.\n\nI'll close with C1's pass-rate and turns against C0's 13-turn bar, plus the round-2 feedback transcripts, once the last clones index."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":681,"cache_read_input_tokens":753238,"output_tokens":470,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":681,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo"