{"parentUuid":"c8585063-e3fa-453f-83fb-b39b4ad93eae","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14995878 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8d0b47d0-ffd8-40a9-92cf-84afc48c9c97","timestamp":"2026-10-03T22:47:09.824Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14995878 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"8d0b47d0-ffd8-40a9-92cf-84afc48c9c97","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg7knS9N8YxSvBGbDjhv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I used it, and the result answers your question better than a claim would.\n\n## I ran the exact sequence my own guide now mandates\n\n**`brain brief` → 0 facts, 0 code locations.** Empty. Because facts are **branch-scoped**: `recall \"distill\"` on my branch says *\"no facts\"*, and the identical query with `--branch main` returns `fact:d0bbbdae… [project.tooling.distill]`. I hit the trap I documented, on my own machine, on my own branch.\n\n**`graph search` → worked.** Ranks 1–2 were `defaultDistillAgentRunner` and `runDistill` at `distill_cmd.go:2295` and `:666`. The real answer, `defaultDistillTimeout = 10 * time.Minute`, is at `:37` and consumed at `:631` — so rank 2 put me ~35 lines from it, in the right file. Grep would have been faster for the literal name, but I didn't know the name.\n\nAnd your implied criticism is fair: **across this session I mostly grepped.** I used graph for the decoy investigation and brain for the docs verification, but not as a default. The guide I wrote now tells agents to do what I wasn't consistently doing.\n\n## What makes agents use it\n\nThree things, in the order they mattered:\n\n1. **The guide said they could skip** — \"Skip ceremonial queries\", \"Directly inspect source when the task already provides sufficient locations\" — and CI *enforced* that wording in both directions. Replaced with a directive; measured **0/9 → 10/10**, p = 1.1 × 10⁻⁵.\n2. **The directive never shipped.** `entire brain init-agents` alone writes `enabled:[\"brain\"]` with zero Graph instructions, because activation is recorded in the guide, not probed. The README never said to activate Graph.\n3. **Two competing absolutes made it drop Brain.** \"brief first\" and \"Graph search FIRST\" both claimed first place; the agent picked one. Found only by asking it — your tip, and nothing else would have surfaced it.\n\n## The PRs\n\n| PR | base | covers |\n|---|---|---|\n| **#321** | main | distill stall (configurable timeout) + **nested-repo trap** — Joseph's two biggest |\n| **#318** | main | names the branches holding facts when a query finds none — **the trap I just hit** |\n| #320 | main | `remember` returns the persisted merged fact |\n| #306 | main | import memory from another tool |\n| **#329** | main | MCP budget, #325 latency, silent drops, the `\"usabl…\"` typo |\n| **#330** | #329 | #326 lock, #327 dirty tree, #328 Ollama, #322 Windows, #324 fanout |\n| **#331** | #330 | the guide, hook wiring, tool descriptions, README table |\n\nSeven, two independent chains. #329→#330→#331 must merge in order.\n\n## Will brain then be \"fully solid and actually used\"?\n\n**Used: yes** — that's measured, replicated, and the strongest claim here.\n\n**Solid: no, not yet**, and I'd be overselling it to say otherwise. Three things remain that these PRs don't fix:\n\n- **Retrieval recall.** In 6/10 sessions agents complied and got a non-answer. [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319) shows the right answer *absent from the result set* on two repos. That's with Codex under the study-7 prereg.\n- **Branch-scoped facts.** I just demonstrated it. #318 makes the empty result *explain itself*; it doesn't make the facts reachable.\n- **`setup` doesn't index for Graph.** The brief returned nothing partly because this brain was never distilled on this branch.\n\nHonest summary: the usage problem is fixed and verified. The *value* problem is one fix deep — what the tool returns when an agent does reach for it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":970,"cache_read_input_tokens":778177,"output_tokens":1277,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":970,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1277,"cache_read_input_tokens":778177,"cache_creation_input_tokens":970,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":970},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e49e1b05-cabe-4c05-a960-8e4cbd5a4274","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfg7kkXodkKy6GCfwuEX8","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d415c65-24f2-49ba-b7fc-e06cb669c864","timestamp":"2026-10-03T22:47:30.531Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
