s facts, so there is nothing to point at; got: %s\", note)\n\t}\n}\n\n// A brain with no facts anywhere is a different problem with a different\n// remedy (distill), already covered by emptyResultBlindSpot. This note must\n// not fire there and claim a branch would help.\nfunc TestBriefStaysQuietWhenNoBranchHasFacts(t *testing.T) {\n\tt.Parallel()\n\n\tf := newVerifyFixture(t)\n\tif note := briefBranchBlindSpot(f.brainDir, \"main\"); note != \"\" {\n\t\tt.Fatalf(\"an empty brain is not a branch problem; got: %s\", note)\n\t}\n}\nEOF\ngofmt -w internal/cli/brief_branch_blindspot_test.go\ngo test ./internal/cli/ -run 'TestBriefExplainsAnEmptyBranch|TestBriefStaysQuiet' -count=1 -timeout 900s 2>&1|tail -4","description":"Test the brief branch blind spot","timeout":1200000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"b386e810-0695-4b69-b64d-0d10ba5d5119","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfg8Re2y24z2Cm7W5nxwX","type":"assistant","uuid":"093e6db3-a38e-4468-b682-2eac00d13e2a","timestamp":"2026-10-03T22:56:13.360Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
