{"parentUuid":"575369ee-3fe0-40c1-b2fa-2d4cfe560535","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14969129 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2bb17478-250e-4a06-becc-a86722df0820","timestamp":"2026-10-03T23:08:26.485Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14969129 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"2bb17478-250e-4a06-becc-a86722df0820","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfg9Nuk3x28nWShsLCett","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three commits are on the PR — the earlier `length: 1` was a stale read. Remote and local heads match at `ae9e2f0b`.\n\n## Two more \"solid\" gaps closed\n\n**`setup` never named the step that writes the agent files.** Joseph ran setup, it succeeded, no agent files appeared, and he concluded he'd used the wrong directory. He hadn't — the step just wasn't named where he was standing. `setup --help` and the README aren't where you are when this goes wrong. `init-agents` is now the **first** entry in setup's `Next` block.\n\n**`brief` reported 0 facts while 16 branches held facts.** Verified live on this repo. That's step 1 of the guide I wrote, so it's the first thing every agent sees, and silence reads as *\"this brain knows nothing about your project.\"* It now names the branches that do have facts and the flag that reaches them — and stays quiet in the two cases where the note would mislead: when you're already on the branch with facts, and when no branch has any (that's a distill problem with a different remedy).\n\nBoth weakening-verified. The second guard's **first version passed with the call site disabled** — the third time in this work a defect lived in the wiring between two correct functions. The replacement asserts the call site.\n\nFull suite green across 14 packages, lint clean.\n\n## Where \"fully solid\" now stands\n\n| | state |\n|---|---|\n| agents use the tools | **fixed, replicated** — 0/10 → 10/10, p = 1.1 × 10⁻⁵ |\n| the guide reaches them | **fixed** — delivery verified by a real session quoting it |\n| the hook actually fires | **fixed** — was inert, named a nonexistent env var |\n| Joseph's AGENTS.md | **fixed** — #321 names the nested trap, setup now names the step |\n| distill stall | **fixed** — #321 configurable timeout |\n| empty results explain themselves | **fixed** — brief now joins recall/query |\n| **retrieval recall** | **not fixed, not mine** — [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319), study 7, Codex |\n\nSeven PRs: #306, #318, #320, #321 on main; #329 → #330 → #331 stacked.\n\nThe one thing I can't close from the brain side is recall — and it's the one that decides whether the token savings are ~2.5% or ~17%. That's the next lever, and it isn't in this repo.\n\nWant me to design the prospective benchmark pilot now?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":913,"cache_read_input_tokens":814193,"output_tokens":818,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":913,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":818,"cache_read_input_tokens":814193,"cache_creation_input_tokens":913,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":913},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c4610c9c-cb36-4887-83a8-fe2bc54cef99","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfg9NrpwQ5AsUHv75Tugf","type":"assistant","uuid":"85e5b38e-2a5f-49ca-88b4-91f50ab19ee6","timestamp":"2026-10-03T23:08:41.210Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
