{"parentUuid":"c7599726-45ce-438d-9c57-022e28718ba8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14942152 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b117788a-d2e7-4f14-89d4-3d6efd1182e5","timestamp":"2026-10-03T23:17:22.688Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14942152 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"b117788a-d2e7-4f14-89d4-3d6efd1182e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgA4TGhvXzuXzCZnhoUs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed and bounded. The index holds `function`, `method`, `type`, `field`, `class` — **no `const` or `var` kind at all.** `defaultDistillTimeout` is genuinely absent, and so is every other Go constant.\n\nThat's a real coverage gap, but it belongs to **entire-graph** (the provider that produces the snapshot), not brain — brain faithfully indexes what it's given. So it goes to Codex via the issue, not into my PRs.\n\n## Correcting myself\n\nI reported brain's symbol search as \"entirely dead\" three messages ago. **That was wrong, and the error was mine** — I queried a JSON key that doesn't exist (`symbols` instead of `results`), read the resulting zeros as data, and built a schema-gate root-cause story on top of it. Brain's search is in fact good: exact rank-1 hits for `runDistill`, `brainBriefReport`, and `briefBranchBlindSpot` (a function I wrote an hour ago).\n\nThat's the fourth false-pass this session from a probe returning \"nothing\" instead of an error, and the most expensive. It's now in memory as a named pattern.\n\n## What this changes about \"fully solid\"\n\nIt's better news than my last summary. The thing I'd deferred as the unfixable gap — retrieval recall — splits cleanly:\n\n- **Brain's own retrieval: works.** Symbol search returns exact hits. I measured it rather than assuming.\n- **Graph's ranking on intent-phrased queries: the real gap**, already filed as [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319) with Codex under study 7.\n- **Constants not indexed: new, narrow, graph-side.** Worth adding to #319.\n\nSo on the brain side I'm not currently holding a known unfixed defect. Let me add the const gap to the issue and tell the graph session."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1102,"cache_read_input_tokens":840968,"output_tokens":611,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1102,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":611,"cache_read_input_tokens":840968,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1102,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1102},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6d807014-7c09-4f5f-ba38-0209e5f52e8b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfgA4PNKJwmPYAhYNrU9H","type":"assistant","uuid":"a2568250-a84d-4fa7-8b90-7288b72d51e6","timestamp":"2026-10-03T23:17:36.213Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
