{"parentUuid":"b95be8c1-db24-4a8f-aaf0-631905eeea6d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14921807 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3ce2ce93-7b3c-4f31-a488-9628164d0e5b","timestamp":"2026-10-03T23:27:44.914Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14921807 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"3ce2ce93-7b3c-4f31-a488-9628164d0e5b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgArHXrib8pi5Grn6ydd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pushed. Brain is as solid as I can make it from this side.\n\n## What I did this round rather than declare done\n\nI swept every retrieval surface for the defect class I kept finding — empty results that don't explain themselves. Five of six were already honest; **one wasn't**, and it was the one that had misled *me* an hour earlier.\n\n`inspect search-graph` printed the same bare line for four different situations. Its own comment named three and missed the fourth: *the index holds no symbols of that kind*. Go consts and vars aren't extracted at all, so a constant name looks identical to a typo. Now:\n\n> `note: the index holds 50561 symbols of kinds section, function, field, method, type, code_fence; Go consts and vars are not extracted, so a constant name finds nothing here`\n\nThe peer independently reproduced the coverage gap on a second repo — kong, 667 const/var declarations, none indexed — and sent it to Codex as extraction coverage. So that half is confirmed and owned.\n\nTwo of my own harness errors caught in the same stretch: a probe whose unquoted expansion made every command \"unknown\", and an `&& echo \"[compiles]\"` that chained off `head`'s exit rather than `go build`'s and falsely reported a weakening as valid. Both are the same shape as the four before them.\n\n## Standing state\n\n**Brain side: no known unfixed defect.** Ten fixed, all weakening-verified, 14 packages green, lint clean.\n\n**Graph side: two, both filed and owned** — intent-phrased recall and const/var extraction, in [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319), with Codex under study 7. I've stayed out of that repo as asked.\n\n**Seven PRs unmerged.** #306, #318, #320, #321 on `main`; #329 → #330 → #331 stacked and order-dependent, #331 now at `ae6df5b2`.\n\nI want to be plain about the last one rather than keep reporting around it: **brain cannot be solid in production until those merge, and merging is the one action you told me never to take without approval.** I'm not treating that as a blocker to work around — it's the correct stopping point. Everything else I can reach is done."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":976,"cache_read_input_tokens":861243,"output_tokens":713,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":976,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":713,"cache_read_input_tokens":861243,"cache_creation_input_tokens":976,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":976},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d06d573a-ed50-4bd2-9eb9-c5971d0321df","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfgArF2HztvQxVT384tZJ","type":"assistant","uuid":"dfea4b19-1bdb-4dff-83dc-f2ad1d53c65b","timestamp":"2026-10-03T23:28:03.387Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
