{"parentUuid":"1032e38f-3d99-4535-87a3-b85ea13d32ad","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14991617 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"a96540f5-259d-4316-96a9-347399b6db3b","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:18:07.006Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14991617 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"a96540f5-259d-4316-96a9-347399b6db3b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgUREAqgCG5shTAf2Pa1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Three of #306's findings are now fixed and pushed. Current state:\n\n## #306 — three fixed, pushed at `fe10b5ad`\n\n| severity | defect | fix |\n|---|---|---|\n| HIGH | imported text stored verbatim → ANSI/bidi/zero-width reached the terminal **and the agent's prompt** | routed through the existing `sanitizeDistilledFactText`, with stripping reported via the file's own `Unsupported` channel |\n| HIGH | `--path-prefix` bypassed the taxonomy → could mint facts GC calls orphaned while printing \"imported N of N\" | hard error, matching what `facts add --path` already enforces |\n| MED-HIGH | `imported` origin missing from status and the brief → `facts=400 distilled=0 authored=0` | forwarded to both; omitted at zero so it stays additive |\n\nThat last one mattered because the compact brief is the packet an agent actually reads — it has no second view to cross-check, so incoherent totals are all it gets.\n\nAll three weakening-verified. Two needed a second attempt because the first mutation didn't compile and therefore proved nothing — which is itself the lesson: a weakening that doesn't build is not a weakening.\n\n## Where brain stands\n\n**Thirteen defects fixed this session**, every one with a regression test shown to go red when the fix is removed. Suites green on all three branches I touched.\n\n**#306's remaining eight findings** are recorded on the PR — asymmetric refusal on bare-array exports, a discarded type error reported as \"not a mem0 export\", `verify` trusting a self-declared origin, a retracted-fact collision counted as imported, categories 2..n dropped, timestamps silently re-dated, a count mismatch between memories and facts, and three conditional `t.Skipf` guards. None is blocking; all are triageable rather than lost.\n\n**Graph side:** two, owned by Codex under study 7 — [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319).\n\n**Yours:** the merges. #306, #318, #320, #321 on `main`; #329 → #330 → #331 stacked in order. #306 and #318 both carry review fixes now and need fresh CI."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":655,"cache_read_input_tokens":922035,"output_tokens":728,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":655,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":728,"cache_read_input_tokens":922035,"cache_creation_input_tokens":655,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":655},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"53f0c823-aded-4d65-a517-6fefe0b732fd","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfgUR9AUFuQV1eU8eyyAS","type":"assistant","uuid":"541be31f-a127-4386-b5f6-5661f1e57ab3","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:18:19.912Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
