{"parentUuid":"01edebad-8537-4e1d-a640-daa2d3f0b4fb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14981542 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"7d216bbc-9f8b-429a-880f-fc2b7e937ad4","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:24:56.638Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14981542 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"7d216bbc-9f8b-429a-880f-fc2b7e937ad4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgUwNZTu4wAj6u8Tf3y1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Five of #306's findings are now fixed and pushed at `056ae115`.\n\n## This round\n\n**Finding 5 — the decoder's error was discarded and replaced with a false one.** `parseMem0` threw away both unmarshal errors and returned *\"not a mem0 export\"*. For `{\"results\":[{\"id\":1}]}` that's simply wrong — the file obviously *is* a mem0 export, and the decoder already knew `id` was the bad field. The user was told they had the wrong kind of file, with nothing to look for.\n\nMy first version of that fix was wrong and **the test caught it**: trying the bare-array shape first produces its own `UnmarshalTypeError` for any object (\"cannot unmarshal object into `[]mem0Memory`\"), which names no field. I was preferring that useless one. Now only a field-naming error beats the format message.\n\n**Finding 4 — an import that skipped every record reported success.** A bare JSON array parses as mem0, so a Letta or Zep export with no `memory` key came back as *\"imported 0 of N / N skipped\"* and exit 0. The file's own doctrine says a non-export \"is an error naming both, not a silent zero-record import\" — and a file where not one record has text is that same case, one layer later. Some records skipped stays a warning, since a real export can carry an empty memory.\n\nBoth weakening-verified, full `internal/cli` suite green.\n\n## Running state\n\n**Fifteen defects fixed this session**, each with a regression test shown to go red when the fix is removed.\n\n**#306: five fixed, eight recorded** on the PR for triage — none blocking. The two HIGH ones (unsanitised foreign text reaching the agent prompt, `--path-prefix` minting orphans) are closed.\n\n**Branches pushed:** #306 at `056ae115`, #318 at `74a65b53`, #331 at `ae6df5b2`.\n\n**Graph side:** two, with Codex under study 7 — [#319](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/issues/319).\n\nI'll keep working down #306's remaining findings — the next ones are `verify` trusting a self-declared origin, a retracted-fact collision counted as imported, and a manifest-refresh failure that aborts after the facts are already written."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":968,"cache_read_input_tokens":931795,"output_tokens":734,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":968,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":734,"cache_read_input_tokens":931795,"cache_creation_input_tokens":968,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":968},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"41d592e9-9320-4d8a-a413-02888899a387","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfgUwLatgiDedHCLqNFFu","type":"assistant","uuid":"8b53347f-508c-40ca-864d-dcd98c978639","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:25:07.810Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
