{"parentUuid":"0dc1555d-6a20-4fec-a8a3-b28b15c9c460","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14949027 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"449c7b83-182d-4015-b6a0-7ef6be520e2e","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:48:38.578Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14949027 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"449c7b83-182d-4015-b6a0-7ef6be520e2e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgWkDTTLm8QtosKYkHXD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nine of #306's findings fixed, pushed at `ee514662`.\n\n## This round: tests that couldn't fail\n\nTwo conditional skips turned a broken fixture into a passing test — the same defect class as everything else here, just pointed at the test suite instead of the product.\n\n`TestKeptActiveCountsEachFactOnce` exists to prove one id is counted once no matter how many memories map to it, and it needs two superseded copies to prove *anything*. It skipped when the fixture gave fewer. The fixture gives two today — so the skip bought nothing and only hid the day it stops, which is exactly the drift the guard was written to catch.\n\n`TestDryRunReportsTheSupersessionItWouldNotApply` skipped when `resolveFactsTarget` failed, but that test builds its own repo via `semanticTestEnv` — a target that won't resolve is a broken fixture, not a missing capability.\n\nBoth now `t.Fatalf`, verified by forcing each precondition false.\n\nI deliberately left the other two skips: creating a sparse file and creating a FIFO are real filesystem capabilities some environments lack, so skipping there is honest rather than a disguised pass. Converting those would have been cargo-culting the rule.\n\n## Tally\n\n**Nineteen defects fixed this session.** On #306: **nine fixed, four recorded** — categories 2..n dropped, timestamps silently re-dated, `Superseded` counting memories while `Imported` counts facts, and no branch named in the report. All low severity and documented on the PR.\n\n| branch | head |\n|---|---|\n| #306 `feat/facts-import` | `ee514662` |\n| #318 `fix/blind-spot-other-branches` | `74a65b53` |\n| #331 `fix/agent-guide-directive-and-discovery` | `ae6df5b2` |\n\nFull suites green on all three.\n\nI'll keep closing the remaining four. The timestamp one is next — facts silently re-dated to today when the source timestamp won't parse means every imported fact claims to be from the import date, which quietly corrupts recency ordering."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":871,"cache_read_input_tokens":964413,"output_tokens":686,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":871,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":686,"cache_read_input_tokens":964413,"cache_creation_input_tokens":871,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":871},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ae4693ec-ebc2-43f8-8889-af1b4a5f944c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfgWk9nSNfCwUR7apKb8A","type":"assistant","uuid":"45d75963-5182-45e0-8f22-37e920272716","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:48:50.854Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
