{"parentUuid":"1e907b24-aee3-4b81-a588-67e5b8adfb70","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14780194 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c51ca853-a445-482c-8f51-650159bc4d6a","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:55:09.671Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14780194 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"c51ca853-a445-482c-8f51-650159bc4d6a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgXEymk1ZceAhGe6xfXr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ten of #306's findings fixed, pushed at `efd59e36`.\n\n## The timestamp defect\n\n`parseImportTime` returned only a zero time, so \"the field was absent\" and \"the field was present and unreadable\" were indistinguishable — and the caller substitutes `now` for a zero.\n\nAn export with epoch-second timestamps, or `2024-07-01 12:00:00` with a space instead of a `T`, had **every fact stamped with the import date** while the report said \"imported 400 of 400\". Recency ordering is the entire purpose of those fields, and a date that's wrong but looks real is worse than no date, because nothing downstream can tell.\n\nTwo changes: the parse now accepts the shapes real exports actually use (no-zone ISO, python isoformat, space separators, epoch seconds and millis), and a genuinely unreadable value is reported per memory, naming the field and quoting it. Epoch detection requires 10+ digits so a bare year isn't read as a date — the test pins `\"2024\"` as unreadable rather than the year 2024.\n\nThree weakenings, each turning a test red: never reporting unreadable, dropping the per-memory note, dropping the epoch branch.\n\n## Tally\n\n**Twenty defects fixed this session.** On #306: **ten fixed, three recorded**.\n\nThe three left are cosmetic or structural rather than wrong-answer bugs: categories 2..n dropped (`MaxPaths=2` could hold a second), `Superseded` counting memories while `Imported` counts facts, and no branch named in the report. All documented on the PR.\n\n| branch | head | suite |\n|---|---|---|\n| #306 `feat/facts-import` | `efd59e36` | green |\n| #318 `fix/blind-spot-other-branches` | `74a65b53` | green |\n| #331 `fix/agent-guide-directive-and-discovery` | `ae6df5b2` | green |\n\nOn the attribution note that just arrived: your `CLAUDE.md` says no AI attribution footers in commits, and that takes precedence, so I've left the footers off.\n\nI'll keep going on the last three #306 items, then move to the #318 findings — `brain brief`, `recall --evidence`, and `get`/`multi-get` still bypass the blind-spot choke point, which is the one remaining item with real user-visible impact."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":166669,"output_tokens":763,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":944,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":763,"cache_read_input_tokens":166669,"cache_creation_input_tokens":944,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":944},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e682716a-4d60-41ef-aa45-e060506625e8","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfgXEyPAgwpSAdKdVSLxQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"a397ff3d-1e1f-49ed-91f9-1f6f17d85839","timestamp":"2026-10-04T03:55:19.884Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
