e result, got %q\", got.BlindSpot)\n\t}\n}\nEOF\npython3 -c \"\np='internal/cli/recall_evidence_branch_test.go';s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace('import (','import (\\n\\t\\\"bytes\\\"\\n\\t\\\"encoding/json\\\"',1)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\"\ngofmt -w internal/cli/recall_evidence_branch_test.go\ngo test ./internal/cli/ -run 'TestEvidenceRecallCommandEmitsTheBranchNote' -count=1 -timeout 900s 2>&1|tail -6","description":"Add the end-to-end call-site test","timeout":1200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1520,"cache_read_input_tokens":215396,"output_tokens":1319,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":217},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1520,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1319,"cache_read_input_tokens":215396,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1520,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1520},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01HEiNX6yH2A6SUtmTrdGQpJ":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/.claude/jobs/6ca2c8fb/tmp/pr318\ncat >> internal/cli/recall_evidence_branch_test.go <<'EOF'\n\n// END-TO-END. The three tests above call otherBranchSessionBlindSpot directly,\n// and all three stayed green when the CALL SITE was removed -- the defect class\n// where the bug lives in the wiring between two correct functions rather than\n// in either of them. Removing `out.BlindSpot = ...` left the helper perfect and\n// the surface silent, which is the exact bug being fixed.\n//\n// This drives the real command and asserts the note reaches the output.\nfunc TestEvidenceRecallCommandEmitsTheBranchNote(t *testing.T) {\n\tf