{"parentUuid":"6429beda-833e-44c9-adfd-e7bc53a209b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e7885167-dc2d-44de-bb8f-d1c797ad583a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TB16dBMeVYHdTzr5C3ej2Q","type":"tool_result","content":"01M42RPQ7C3GP7DRJ8QWDJ2K2H sev=medium None:310\nThis fact-level gate checks `importedAnchorClaimsThisRepo` across *all* anchors on the record and bails for the whole fact before the per-anchor loop (lines 348-352) runs. But `factmerge.Upsert` keys purely on content id (text+paths, independent of Origin) and keeps the *existing* record's Origin while unioning anchors — so a distilled/authored fact whose text+paths later collide with a previously-imported fact's id produces a record with `Origin == \"imported\"` holding both the original foreign anchor and a genuine new local anchor (real Commit/CheckpointID/Transcript). This gate then reports the whole record as an origin/anchor \"contradiction\" and never calls `verifyAnchor` on the real local anchor at all, so its commit/checkpoint/transcript is never actually checked — exactly the per-record-granularity bug the sibling `anchorNamesAForeignSource` check in `verifyAnchor` (same diff) was","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"89e4efc6-c6c5-48f7-aedc-53fb883531c7","timestamp":"2026-10-04T06:14:52.897Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"01M42RPQ7C3GP7DRJ8QWDJ2K2H sev=medium None:310\nThis fact-level gate checks `importedAnchorClaimsThisRepo` across *all* anchors on the record and bails for the whole fact before the per-anchor loop (lines 348-352) runs. But `factmerge.Upsert` keys purely on content id (text+paths, independent of Origin) and keeps the *existing* record's Origin while unioning anchors — so a distilled/authored fact whose text+paths later collide with a previously-imported fact's id produces a record with `Origin == \"imported\"` holding both the original foreign anchor and a genuine new local anchor (real Commit/CheckpointID/Transcript). This gate then reports the whole record as an origin/anchor \"contradiction\" and never calls `verifyAnchor` on the real local anchor at all, so its commit/checkpoint/transcript is never actually checked — exactly the per-record-granularity bug the sibling `anchorNamesAForeignSource` check in `verifyAnchor` (same diff) was","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"85534841-53a7-40db-8545-2c4aae48a672","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":242},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entiredb","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6429beda-833e-44c9-adfd-e7bc53a209b1","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
