{"parentUuid":"268f0900-32d6-4c9d-81bd-ec67126f8dc6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e7885167-dc2d-44de-bb8f-d1c797ad583a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VxqEqfXbBCcUkUqTXpSgm6","type":"tool_result","content":"839:func reasonForFactVerdict(verdict string) string {\n840-\tswitch verdict {\n841-\tcase verifyVerdictVerified:\n842-\t\treturn \"all locally checkable anchors resolved\"\n843-\tcase verifyVerdictStale:\n844-\t\treturn \"one or more anchors resolve to changed local source\"\n845-\tcase verifyVerdictOrphaned:\n846-\t\treturn \"one or more anchors are missing locally\"\n847-\tcase verifyVerdictUnverifiableHere:\n848-\t\treturn \"one or more anchors need finer local evidence\"\n849-\tdefault:\n850-\t\treturn \"unknown verification verdict\"\n851-\t}\n852-}\n853-\n\n\t// PER-ANCHOR, because the record-level origin gates above are not enough.\n\t//\n\t// factmerge.Upsert keys on the content-addressed id and keeps the EXISTING\n\t// record's Origin while unioning provenance. So an imported memory whose\n\t// text and paths normalise onto a pre-existing authored fact -- which\n\t// importing under an existing taxonomy prefix explicitly permits -- yields\n\t// a fact with Origin != \"imported\" that nonetheless carries a foreign\n\t// anchor. Neither origin gate fires, and this function then tries to\n\t// resolve \"mem0:abc\" as a local session and reports the fact ORPHANED:\n\t// \"its evidence is gone\", when its evidence was never here. That is the\n\t// same false and alarming diagnosis the origin gates exist to prevent,\n\t// reached by a different route.\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d9a0732b-f1a5-4d9c-841d-8ce1c250fba1","timestamp":"2026-10-04T06:20:52.748Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"839:func reasonForFactVerdict(verdict string) string {\n840-\tswitch verdict {\n841-\tcase verifyVerdictVerified:\n842-\t\treturn \"all locally checkable anchors resolved\"\n843-\tcase verify