{"parentUuid":"7c6d0ef5-244f-496e-a514-29d13182f89e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfgjEDWc64SnETQcRq6Ni","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's decisive. The remaining blocker is **Approvals**, not anything I can fix:\n\n| PR | findings | checks | conflicts | up-to-date | approvals |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| #306 | 0 | running | clean | yes | ✅ `ashtom` |\n| #318 | 0 | 30 pass | clean | yes | ❌ none |\n| #321 | 0 | 30 pass | clean | yes | ❌ none |\n| #331 | 0 | 30 pass | clean | yes | ❌ none |\n\nThree of the four need a human to approve before they *can* merge — and this repo's own doctrine says never self-approve. So the gate is red for a reason I'm not permitted to clear, on top of your standing \"don't merge without my approval.\"\n\nI've run out of work that's mine to do, so this needs your call:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_read_input_tokens":499255,"output_tokens":1199,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":404},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":575,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1199,"cache_read_input_tokens":499255,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":575},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d1122cf6-7152-4ecb-8765-398d67eb5081","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfgjECTrM4sZJ4CuLmh6H","type":"assistant","uuid":"26607067-d478-4107-bf5a-aa5272298f6d","timestamp":"2026-10-04T06:32:33.424Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"