{"parentUuid":"ae7aba11-aeab-497f-b0b4-6d8c955b22cb","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14971669 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ea0ae254-e4f6-4fc9-9475-c5124f7f550d","timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:57:47.026Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14971669 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"ea0ae254-e4f6-4fc9-9475-c5124f7f550d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhUM3ERMs8SX6Kdrwj9c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both gaps I'd flagged are now closed. Revised answer:\n\n## Is it solid?\n\n**The seven PRs: yes, and I've now tested every surface I said I hadn't.**\n\n| surface | result |\n|---|---|\n| MCP (37 tools) | `brain_query`, `brain_brief` work; `brain_get` carries `blind_spot` — the exact surface the finding said was unreachable |\n| semantic / code | index builds; symbol search resolves correctly; empty-result note reports **5 symbols, kinds function/type/method/field** — exactly right for that repo |\n| **distillation** | session → chunk → agent → fact, end to end. `facts=1 distilled=1`, `recall` finds it, `verify` resolves the anchor to the real local session |\n\nThat last one I'd said needed a paid agent. It didn't — `--agent command` with a stub exercises the real pipeline, and only the model call is faked.\n\nAnd `verify` gave the distilled fact a **different reason** than the imported one — *\"anchor cannot be fully verified with local granularity\"* vs *\"anchor names a session in mem0, not this repository\"*. That's the `sharedAnchorReason` fix working across origins, which I'd only tested on imports.\n\n## What remains, honestly\n\n**Scale.** ~100x worse per line than Augment at 4.8M lines. Not untried — I profiled it before (SQL 44% / git 15% / load 41%, no hotspot) and both candidate fixes measured *worse*. It's an architectural ceiling, not a bug in these PRs. For large repos it's disqualifying, and nothing here changes that.\n\n**Two integration facts worth knowing:** the semantic index hard-requires entire-graph installed, and brain expects provider schema 1.1 while graph `main` emits 1.3 — brain degrades gracefully with an explanation rather than failing.\n\n**Not merged.** Still needs your approval on #318/#321/#331 and then the merges. I won't do either without you saying so.\n\nI also caught two of my own fixture errors mid-run rather than reporting them as product bugs: brain's data dir inside the repo (kept the worktree permanently dirty, would have looked like `refresh` was broken), and a transcript in the wrong format (0 chunks, would have looked like distill was broken)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":861,"cache_read_input_tokens":589927,"output_tokens":755,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":861},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":589927,"cache_creation_input_tokens":861,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":861,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4359b49a-b4ce-4c32-81ae-8545d5516140","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhUM2fwK8o5GNWjyi7q4","type":"assistant","uuid":"7f9d5d49-ee35-4ad8-878e-53eae92e9f20","timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:57:56.501Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
