{"parentUuid":"378d8d7f-e350-46fd-84c7-1cf1c1cf3c9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhVDhKXe6g3HNmJFn2i4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The A/B is running. I'm deliberately **not** running anything else while it does — my own notes record that load pressure inflates whichever arm runs under it and can flip the sign, so competing work would confound the very measurement I'm taking.\n\nWhat's running: both binaries index the same 461K-line / 1,984-file worktree of `entiredb` (isolated, the real checkout untouched), measuring wall-clock for `setup + refresh --semantic`, resulting store size, and symbol count.\n\nThis answers the one scale question that's actually mine — **did these 54 changes regress it?** — as opposed to the architectural ceiling, which predates this stack and which I've already profiled to a dead end (SQL 44% / git 15% / load 41%, no hotspot; trigram 2.2x slower and 18x build; one-pass-DF also worse).\n\nI'll report the numbers when it lands."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_read_input_tokens":599232,"output_tokens":527,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":242},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":570},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":527,"cache_read_input_tokens":599232,"cache_creation_input_tokens":570,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":570,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"47eea2dd-15a4-45fd-b85f-ea8f1e0bd638","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfhVDgipDMeWkqNiRoxt9","type":"assistant","uuid":"a9c6e8da