{"parentUuid":"3c11ce80-02db-4f13-b8ab-e95dbbfd8c60","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhVEMddhVWJfbcY8E54z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"First arm in — and two numbers stand out:\n\n```\nmain     index+refresh: 556s   store=5087MB  0 symbols\n```\n\n**5 GB of store for 461K lines**, and **0 symbols** — the semantic index didn't build in this arm. That 0 likely means the graph provider didn't engage on this repo (schema skew, or it bailed), which would mean the 556s is measuring sessions/history/docs rather than symbol extraction.\n\nI'll diagnose the 0 once the merged arm lands — checking now would add disk contention and taint the second measurement. If both arms report 0, the comparison is still valid as a like-for-like regression check, but it isn't measuring what I set out to measure, and I'll say so rather than quietly reframe it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":599802,"output_tokens":690,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":444},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":834},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":690,"cache_read_input_tokens":599802,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":834,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"aeeef19c-2b91-4e85-a727-20738ea4d7b8","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfhVEM6tDygfP4orvJqtx","type":"assistant","uuid":"27ead136-af3c-4054-9465-3415d0b29685","timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:09:34.970Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTur