{"parentUuid":"47888d40-1ae9-42cf-bc67-194574247571","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cd507df4-105d-4339-8bf5-583ac021e6b6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jotsv899sBpo53UHhUKsb","type":"tool_result","content":"18670:// gitWorktreePreflightBudget reuses the filesystem fallback's supported-tree\n18671-// ceilings. The preflight has to finish the entire traversal before Git starts;\n18672-// reaching any ceiling is therefore a decline, never a partial success. The\n18673-// aggregate directory-path byte ceiling also bounds the component-by-component\n18674-// rooted opens, but keep an explicit step count so that relationship is not an\n18675-// implicit invariant of sweepDirectoryRoot.Open.\n18676:type gitWorktreePreflightBudget struct {\n18677-\tworktreeWalkBudget\n18678-\ttraversalSteps int\n18679-}\n18680-\n18681:func (b *gitWorktreePreflightBudget) admitTraversalStep(ctx context.Context) bool {\n18682-\tif ctx != nil && ctx.Err() != nil {\n18683-\t\treturn false\n18684-\t}\n18685-\tif b.traversalSteps >= maxWorktreeWalkDirectoryBytes {\n18686-\t\treturn false\n18687-\t}\n18688-\tb.traversalSteps++\n18689-\treturn true\n=== the ceilings it reuses ===\ninternal/sem/provider.go:17782:\tmaxGitMetadataTreeEntries   = 2_000_000\ninternal/sem/provider.go:18202:\tmaxGitReftableEntries          = 4096\ninternal/sem/provider.go:18204:\tmaxGitReftableAggregateEntries = 65_536\ninternal/sem/provider.go:18231:\tmaxGitAlternateEntries         = 4096\ninternal/sem/provider.go:19441:\tmaxWorktreeWalkRawEntries     = 1_000_000","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ee09e93e-0742-4088-9676-13633b6a0562","timestamp":"2026-10-04T16:33:46.856Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"18670:// gitWorktreePreflightBudget reuses the filesystem fallback's supported-tree\n18671-// ceilings. The preflight has to finish the entire traversal before Git starts;\n18672-// reaching any ceiling is therefore a decline, never a partial success. The\n18673-// aggregate directory-p