{"parentUuid":"fe5c4be9-a536-4cfe-aa4b-906945f4cc0d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14924178 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1b6d9187-88e2-413a-bb80-1b6c7c1dfb11","timestamp":"2026-10-04T17:00:15.986Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14924178 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"1b6d9187-88e2-413a-bb80-1b6c7c1dfb11","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhZ7PhRADB2YoWycrMYY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Caught myself shipping bad advice, and fixed it.\n\n## What just happened\n\nThe partial-clone diagnostic I pushed an hour ago told users to run `git fetch --refetch --filter=` — which **fails**: `fatal: invalid filter-spec ''`. I put a command in a user-facing error without running it, which is the exact defect class this whole stack has been closing. I committed it *inside the fix for one of them*.\n\nNow verified on git 2.54.0 against a real `git clone --filter=blob:none`:\n\n| command | result |\n|---|---|\n| `git fetch --refetch origin` | **rc=0, works** |\n| `git fetch --refetch --filter=` | `invalid filter-spec` |\n| `git fetch --refetch --filter=blob:unlimited` | exit 128 |\n\nOrder matters too, and it's now stated: unsetting the markers alone *looks* like it works on a small clone whose blobs are present — which is exactly how a wrong remedy survives a careless test — and on a real partial clone it strips git's ability to fetch what it's still missing.\n\nProven end to end: partial clone fails → brain prints the remedy → running precisely that → `semantic: 1 files, 3 symbols, 4 relations`.\n\nPushed at `6041e637`. All suites green, all seven PRs still at zero findings.\n\n## Where solidity stands\n\nThe session's biggest finding came from running brain on a real repo rather than a fixture: **partial clones silently lose the entire semantic index**. Now diagnosed with a verified remedy.\n\nTwo things I'd still call open, neither mine to close:\n\n- **Graph side.** The provider should report that refusal in `warnings` or `partial_failures` instead of emitting an empty header silently. That's entire-graph, Codex's lease.\n- **Scale.** Architectural, already profiled to a dead end, unchanged by this stack.\n\nMerging stays yours, whenever you judge it solid enough."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":804,"cache_read_input_tokens":683549,"output_tokens":638,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":804},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":638,"cache_read_input_tokens":683549,"cache_creation_input_tokens":804,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":804,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"04db08da-80b0-44c9-b4b1-95a7df913f8b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhZ7P6wvSggHKUcbKosB","type":"assistant","uuid":"f397b7fa-5e8c-4b5a-881e-4256421186ca","timestamp":"2026-10-04T17:00:24.375Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
