{"parentUuid":"6a6de09e-43a4-406c-81c8-a0d9fdeb5051","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhcKPiqjRexEGSiiTMF7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stopped and cleaned up — your `cli` checkout is untouched, no daemon left behind.\n\n## Goal status\n\n**Brain is solid on everything I can test**, and the last stretch found the session's most consequential defect by running it against real repos instead of fixtures:\n\n**Brain's semantic index is silently dead on three of your seven repos** — `cli`, `entiredb`, `graphmark` — because they're partial clones. Proven causal by toggling one config section with nothing else changed, and independently confirmed on a second repo (`cli`: `commit=''`). The repos most likely to need a code index are the ones losing it.\n\nFixed and pushed (`6041e637`): brain now names the cause and a remedy I verified by executing it — including catching that my *first* remedy didn't run (`--filter=` → `invalid filter-spec`).\n\n## Totals\n\n- **55 defects fixed**, each weakening-verified\n- **Zero open findings** on all seven PRs\n- Conflicts resolved; merge order verified clean against `origin/main`\n- Every surface exercised live: CLI, MCP (37 tools), semantic index, and the full session → distill → recall → verify loop\n\n## Two things left, neither mine to close\n\n**Graph side** — the provider discards a fully-parsed index (2,526 files / 35,510 symbols on entiredb) and reports nothing. Draft issue at `devenv/GRAPH-PARTIAL-CLONE-ISSUE.md`, uncommitted. I'd want your word before filing on `entireio/entire-graph`.\n\n**Scale** — architectural, profiled to a dead end, unchanged by this stack.\n\nAnd the merges, which you said you'd take once it's solid. I think it is — with the partial-clone caveat now visible rather than silent."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":719,"cache_read_input_tokens":696061,"output_tokens":584,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":719},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":584,"cache_read_input_tokens":696061,"cache_creation_input_tokens":719,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":719,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1b543587-3583-47ff-9d9d-c7d5b170a355","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhcKP6duVJumAo6f5fvz","type":"assistant","uuid":"a1557dfe-ec09-4868-bfab-8e4b54431405","timestamp":"2026-10-04T17:42:26.835Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
