{"parentUuid":"1c63831d-dfed-4ed3-a1b2-1367ed62ab81","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfhcwa6viyWuLyvTuHQM2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cleaned up — your checkouts are untouched (entire-api's 12 changed files are your pre-existing work), no daemon left behind.\n\n## Goal status: brain is solid\n\nThe last check was the one I'd been missing — a **positive control**. I'd only ever seen the semantic index succeed on a 5-symbol toy. On a real 163K-line repo that isn't blocked:\n\n```\nsemantic: 716 files, 12643 symbols, 56980 relations     (425s)\nsearch latency: 473ms\n```\n\nSo brain works at real scale. The failures I found were the partial-clone block specifically, not a general inability — and that distinction is what makes the finding actionable rather than damning.\n\nIt also gave my own fix its first real exercise: `the index holds 12643 symbols of kinds field, function, method, type, section, code_fence (6 of 16 kinds)` — the true total, and the truncation disclosure firing because this repo has **16** kinds. My test used 9 synthetic ones; the old code would have under-reported here.\n\n## Final tally\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| defects fixed | **55**, each weakening-verified |\n| open findings, all 7 PRs | **0** |\n| merge order | verified clean against `origin/main` |\n| surfaces run live | CLI, MCP (37 tools), semantic at scale, distill→recall→verify loop |\n\n**Biggest find:** brain's semantic index was silently dead on three of your seven repos (`cli`, `entiredb`, `graphmark`) because they're partial clones. Now diagnosed with a remedy I verified by executing it — after catching that my first remedy didn't actually run.\n\n**Open, not mine:** the graph-side half (provider discards a parsed index silently) — draft issue at `devenv/GRAPH-PARTIAL-CLONE-ISSUE.md`, awaiting your word to file. And scale, which is architectural.\n\nI'd call it solid. The merges are yours."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2495,"cache_read_input_tokens":700256,"output_tokens":638,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2495},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":638,"cache_read_input_tokens":700256,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2495,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2495,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e4f7edc3-714f-4155-b2f5-6467ec9d8bb5","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhcwZSVhZnQwY3a2bx3N","type":"assistant","uuid":"3594db3a-76d1-435e-8861-ded45693b0e1","timestamp":"2026-10-04T17:50:38.460Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
