7e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"efcf492d-fd4a-4af2-bab2-7376e417f95e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3570d256-96d1-454b-9f16-9dbd4168da13","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C51LUFM2dMoYXrNCg5AtwG","type":"tool_result","content":"entire brain recall \"retry policy\"\n```\n\nUse `recall` for saved facts and `query` for a broader search across facts, history, and docs.\n\n## Check What a Code Change Could Affect\n\nWith Entire Graph installed, inspect the impact of changing a function or type. Replace `ValidateToken` with a symbol from your code.\n\n```bash\nentire brain inspect impact --symbol ValidateToken\n```\n\nYou can also inspect changes since the last index:\n\n```bash\nentire brain inspect changes\n```\n\n## Check Whether Memory Is Current\n\nYou can see which sources are available, missing, or out of date, using:\n\n```bash\nentire brain status --verbose\n```\n\nCheck whether saved facts still point to matching sources:\n\n```bash\nentire brain verify\n```\n\nA fact entered by hand can show `unverifiable-here` because it has no source reference. Verification checks references, not whether a fact is correct.\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn.=== full verification log ===\nentire brain inspect impact FilterWarnings --repo .          FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain query \"why did we choose this retry policy\" --repo . FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain recall \"retry policy\" --repo .                  FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain overview --repo .                               FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain inspect changes --repo .                        FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain verify --repo .                                 FAIL  unknown flag: --repo","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5a39c31a-a140-4f81-b28c-0b04db318e7b","timestamp":"2026-10-04T19:57:44.708Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"entire brain recall \"retry policy\"\n```\n\nUse `recall` for saved facts and `query` for a broader search across facts, history, and docs.\n\n## Check What a Code Change Could Affect\n\nWith Entire Graph installed, inspect the impact of changing a function or type. Replace `ValidateToken` with a symbol from your code.\n\n```bash\nentire brain inspect impact --symbol ValidateToken\n```\n\nYou can also inspect changes since the last index:\n\n```bash\nentire brain inspect changes\n```\n\n## Check Whether Memory Is Current\n\nYou can see which sources are available, missing, or out of date, using:\n\n```bash\nentire brain status --verbose\n```\n\nCheck whether saved facts still point to matching sources:\n\n```bash\nentire brain verify\n```\n\nA fact entered by hand can show `unverifiable-here` because it has no source reference. Verification checks references, not whether a fact is correct.\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn.=== full verification log ===\nentire brain inspect impact FilterWarnings --repo .          FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain query \"why did we choose this retry policy\" --repo . FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain recall \"retry policy\" --repo .                  FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain overview --repo .                               FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain inspect changes --repo .                        FAIL  unknown flag: --repo\nentire brain verify --repo .                                 FAIL  unknown flag: --repo","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"03696d6d-869e-42bf-934b-65a0667d0498","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/deve