{"parentUuid":"d11e63fe-aa45-4f30-a85f-46aa602eb142","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfhs5vV8ciDbJfzv5ojET","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Yes — all resolved, on our PRs.**\n\n**55 findings dispositioned: 45 resolved, 10 refuted with evidence. Zero open at any freshness, dismissed included.**\n\nTwo things worth flagging about *how* I checked, because the first answer was wrong:\n\n**The default query lies.** `trail finding list` defaults to `--freshness current --status open` and excludes dismissed — which reported `Resolved: 0, Dismissed: 0` on trails where I'd personally dispositioned dozens. Only `--freshness any --status any --include-dismissed` gives the real picture. That's the exact trap in my notes where a confident `0` once hid 142 findings.\n\n**Scope: our six open PRs, not the repo.** Brain has **9 open PRs**; six are ours. The other three I haven't swept and am not claiming anything about.\n\nSo: everything on the work you asked me to review is clean, and ready for you.\n\n- **#306** already merged, main green\n- **#318, #320, #321, #329, #330, #331** — 0 findings, suites green, merge sequence verified clean against current main\n- Merge #329 → #330 → #331 back-to-back; the secret-leak and ollama fixes live on #331"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1355,"cache_read_input_tokens":810267,"output_tokens":399,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1355},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":399,"cache_read_input_tokens":810267,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1355,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1355,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"