{"parentUuid":"5d5e85ea-52bb-4cf8-8463-4fab107680a9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhsT9r8yiD3Z63ywNEqH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**[Brain Docs Errata](https://claude.ai/artifact/N721BVRzzbniAZWgmsKvcs)** — ten errors, each with the fix.\n\n## What's in it\n\n**Three that actually hurt:**\n\n1. **`inspect impact --symbol` errors.** Docs error, not a product bug — I checked the siblings first: `inspect context` and `inspect tests` are positional too, so adding a `--symbol` flag would make `impact` the inconsistent one. The page should change.\n\n2. **`init-agents` missing from setup.** The one I'd fix first. A wrong flag produces an error the reader sees; a missing `init-agents` produces *no* error — the agent just never uses Brain and the user concludes the product doesn't work. Brain's own setup output lists it first.\n\n3. **No partial-clone warning.** Three of seven repos here are partial clones, and on those the code index silently doesn't exist. On `entiredb` that's 35,510 symbols built and thrown away.\n\n**Four inaccuracies:** \"code index is unavailable\" understates a hard error; the `--path` three-part rule is never stated; two conflicting Graph install instructions; and one line advising care about something the CLI already enforces with an error.\n\n**Three copy errors:** a missing space, a `has`/`have` disagreement, and a comma splice joining two unrelated instructions.\n\nPlus a **verified-correct** list — nine claims I executed and confirmed, so nobody \"fixes\" working text.\n\n## One thing to note\n\nI still can't edit the docs themselves — those pages aren't in this workspace, and I searched `entire.io/`, `entire.io/docs/` and every `.mdx` in devenv. They're published from a separate repo.\n\nPoint me at it and I'll make all ten edits directly; the replacement text is already written."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6459,"cache_read_input_tokens":831882,"output_tokens":594,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6459},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":594,"cache_read_input_tokens":831882,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6459,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6459,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1efd04d6-cd66-49f1-878e-40e38cdfdb80","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhsT8rqqx9byNwgUx3Wy","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Claude Docs","attributionMcpTool":"update","type":"assistant","uuid":"c7cf2792-df96-4919-944f-2cf915e641f9","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:00:55.391Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
