{"parentUuid":"8b128488-155b-4c6c-bd10-38f828cac63b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14947719 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"acc7b77c-3a20-4851-b903-1f4524c5152f","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:14:20.694Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14947719 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"acc7b77c-3a20-4851-b903-1f4524c5152f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhtV9bgMp9GKdBCevFyX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Three doc problems moved into the product instead of a ticket. Pushed at `b5900d79`.\n\n## 1. A partial clone now indexes\n\nThis was the big one — **three of your seven repos** had no code index at all. Brain was throwing away an index it had already parsed (2,526 files, 35,510 symbols on `entiredb`) because the provider couldn't stamp a commit.\n\nBrain never needed the provider for that: `head` and `tree` come from its own `git rev-parse`, which works fine in a partial clone, and `verifySemanticWorktreeStable` had already proven the tree didn't move during the run. So the stamp is sound, not a guess — and it's disclosed as a warning rather than applied silently.\n\nVerified on a real `--filter=blob:none` clone:\n\n```\nsemantic: 1 files, 4 symbols, 7 relations\ntype Rollbacker svc/d.go:5-5\n```\n\nTwo mistakes on the way, both now pinned by tests: I stamped only the in-memory header (the persisted snapshot stayed blank and the two disagreed), and my assignment landed inside the \"already has an index\" branch — so a *first* index, exactly the failing case, skipped it.\n\n## 2. The install message no longer contradicts the docs\n\nIt named only `scripts/install.sh` — the contributor path, assuming a sibling clone. Now leads with `entire plugin install graph`, keeping the script for source checkouts.\n\n## 3. `--symbol` answers itself\n\n```\nunknown flag: --symbol; this command takes the symbol as an argument,\nnot a flag: `entire-brain inspect impact <symbol>`\n```\n\nI still didn't add the flag — `context` and `tests` are positional too, so accepting it on one would bend a consistent interface around a typo.\n\nThat hint initially vanished with no trace: `wrapJSONErrorRendering` walks every child and **replaced** each one's flag-error handler. It now chains — which was a trap for whoever added the next one, not just for me.\n\nAll suites green, `go vet` clean.\n\n## On your vision doc\n\nReading *Area: Semantic Layer* changed how I'd rank these. **\"Release (Open-source) Graph + Brain\"** is a *Now* item — and open-sourcing means external users on large repos, who clone with `--filter` as a matter of course. That bug would have met them on day one, silently. Worth knowing it's closed before that ships.\n\n**\"Brain/Graph docs\"** sits under *this week*, so the errata is on-plan — four of its ten items are now fixed in code instead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1328,"cache_read_input_tokens":889957,"output_tokens":834,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1328},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":889957,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1328,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1328,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"974647fc-e409-4795-9f95-1ac775559faf","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhtV95usU8Fay3YQU3cM","type":"assistant","uuid":"d7145d78-e6cf-4352-a5cf-d2fe71cda46b","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:14:31.949Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
