{"parentUuid":"f5201688-41ed-486e-a9a2-50eb10f624d5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhtYRfembhLkMeYvCDfr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not quite — you've got the three **substantive** ones, but two of your original ten are now obsolete and three copy errors are missing.\n\n## Still real doc problems\n\n**Your 1, 2, 5 — yes, all still need the page changed.** #2 first, for the reason you quoted: a wrong flag shows an error, a missing `init-agents` shows nothing.\n\nOn #1, note the product now *hints* (`unknown flag: --symbol; this command takes the symbol as an argument...`), but the page still teaches a command that errors. Fix it anyway.\n\n**Plus three copy errors you dropped:**\n\n| Current | Fix |\n|---|---|\n| \"For example,you can move\" | missing space |\n| \"lessons that **has** already been recorded\" | **have** |\n| \"...when no saved sessions are available **and make sure to** commit your intended changes before setup.\" | comma splice — two unrelated instructions; split them |\n\n## No longer doc problems — I fixed them in the product\n\n**#3 partial clone** — obsolete. Brain now indexes partial clones. Don't add the \"Before You Start\" warning I drafted; it would document a limitation that no longer exists.\n\n**#6 install conflict** — obsolete. The error now leads with `entire plugin install graph`, matching the page.\n\n## Judgement calls, your call\n\n**#4** \"code index is unavailable\" is soft but not false. **#7** advising one-flag-at-a-time when the CLI already enforces it — harmless, just weaker than stating the guarantee.\n\nLet me correct the artifact so it doesn't send anyone to write obsolete warnings:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1531,"cache_read_input_tokens":891285,"output_tokens":2360,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1247},"server_tool_us