{"parentUuid":"ef5c79a2-daab-4eab-a8a8-a5be97891e3b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e7d5ff4e-b60f-475f-83f8-4b2d43603eb4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QkSLgYH8WxQ4Rb7TiqMZyc","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"verdict\":\"allow\",\"rev\":18,\"data\":{\"rev\":18,\"xml\":\"<doc node='38888e03-206a' rev='18' sinceRev='2'><gap blocks='1'/><paragraph id='m25h57z16zs.0' rev='12' h='e38d7ec3' heading='1'><text id='.1'>Brain Docs </text></paragraph><gone id='.18' rev='13' was='Every error found in Overview an'/><gone id='.194' rev='13'/><gone id='.206' rev='15' was='7 Use Cases Advises what the CLI'/><blockquote id='.6020' rev='18' h='a81aaca7'><paragraph id='.6021' h='34a221f7'><text id='.6022'><bold>Update — items 3 and 6 are now fixed in the product and need no doc change.</bold></text></paragraph><paragraph id='.6097' h='8b6571b1'><text id='.6098'><bold>3 (partial clone)</bold></text><text id='.6115'> — Brain now indexes partial clones. Brain supplies the commit the provider refuses to stamp, verified against a tree already proven stable across the index run. </text><text id='.6277'><bold>Do not add the \\\"Before You Start\\\" warning drafted below</bold></text><text id='.6332'> — it would document a limitation that no longer exists.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.6388' h='23764b0e'><text id='.6389'><bold>6 (install conflict)</bold></text><text id='.6409'> — the error now leads with </text><text id='.6437'><code>entire plugin install graph</code></text><text id='.6464'>, matching the page. Nothing to align.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.6502' h='d493fb97'><text id='.6503'><bold>1 (</bold></text><text id='.6506'><bold><code>--symbol</code></bold></text><text id='.6514'><bold>)</bold></text><text id='.6515'> — still a doc fix, but the CLI now answers it: </text><text id='.6563'><code>unknown flag: --symbol; this command takes the symbol as an argument, not a flag</code></text><text id='.6643'>. The page should still be corrected.</text></paragraph><paragraph id='.6680' h='2276444a'><text id='.6681'><bold>Still to fix in the docs: 1, 2, 5 and the copy errors in 8–10.</bold></text><text id='.6743'> 2 remains the one to do first.</text></paragraph></blockquote><gap blocks='15'/><paragraph id='.2155' rev='16' h='e3b0c442' heading='2'/><gone id='.2204' rev='17' was='Not mentioned anywhere, and not '/><gone id='.2339' rev='17'/><gone id='.2670' rev='17'/><gone id='.2701' rev='17'/><gone id='.2895' rev='17'/><paragraph id='.3142' rev='8' h='e3b0c442' heading='2'/><gone id='.3188' rev='9' was='Overview says: \\\"Without Graph, B'/><gone id='.3302' rev='9'/><gone id='.3355' rev='9'/><gone id='.3431' rev='9'/><gap blocks='4'/><paragraph id='.3948' rev='10' h='e3b0c442' heading='2'/><gone id='.5326' rev='4' was='All executed against the merged '/><gone id='.5365' rev='4'/><gone id='.4736' rev='5' was='8–10. Copy errors (Overview)'/><gone id='.4765' rev='5'/><gone id='.5293' rev='6'/><gone id='.3989' rev='11' was='The page says:'/><gone id='.4004' rev='11'/><gone id='.4032' rev='11'/><gone id='.4108' rev='11'/><gone id='.4174' rev='11'/><gone id='.4373' rev='11'/><gone id='.4414' rev='11'/><gone id='.4484' rev='11'/><gone id='.4505' rev='11'/><gone id='.4584' rev='11'/></doc>\",\"complete\":true},\"frame\":{\"slug\":\"aae6fe1f-d894-4ad5-b74c-08741ccb3644\",\"url\":\"https://claude.ai/code/artifact/aae6fe1f-d894-4ad5-b74c-08741ccb3644\",\"artifactUrl\":\"https://claude.ai/code/artifact/aae6fe1f-d894-4ad5-b74c-08741ccb3644\"}}"}]}]},"uuid":"679421bb-8d9c-4b85-974a-326573799242","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:15:53.088Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"verdict\":\"allow\",\"rev\":18,\"data\":{\"rev\":18,\"xml\":\"<doc node='38888e03-206a' rev='18' sinceRev='2'><gap blocks='1'/><paragraph id='m25h57z16zs.0' rev='12' h='e38d7ec3' heading='1'><text id='.1'>Brain Docs </text></paragraph><gone id='.18' rev='13' was='Every error found in Overview an'/><gone id='.194' rev