{"parentUuid":"42bd96d0-0820-4dc4-8c59-17c33a100558","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14968886 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f4e40298-87c9-4a5e-b7c2-9ded0437e2a0","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:25:08.084Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14968886 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"f4e40298-87c9-4a5e-b7c2-9ded0437e2a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhuJsKxz8idgha6khwGJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Handled everything around your three. Pushed at `ecc832c8`.\n\n## What the product now does so the doc gaps can't bite\n\n**#2 (`init-agents` missing) — the dangerous one, now visible.** Following the docs' exact path (`setup` → `status`, no `init-agents`) prints:\n\n```\nagents    x not wired — run `entire-brain init-agents` so your agent uses this brain\n            missing: .entire/agent-guide.md, AGENTS.md or CLAUDE.md\n```\n\nFirst line of the Onboarding block, because it decides whether any other line matters. Clears once `init-agents` runs. Read-only — it reports the absence, it doesn't write into your repo behind a status command.\n\n**#1 (`--symbol`) — the CLI answers it:** `unknown flag: --symbol; this command takes the symbol as an argument, not a flag`. Still fix the page, but nobody's stuck now.\n\n**#5 (`--path`)** — already names the required shape in its error: `not a valid taxonomy path (category.subcategory.type)`.\n\n**Plus, from earlier:** partial clones index (that whole doc item is obsolete), and the install message now leads with `entire plugin install graph`.\n\n## Two wrong turns, both caught by running it\n\nI put the warning in `renderBrainOnboardingStatus` — **not the renderer `status` uses.** There are two, and the live one is in `status_render.go`. Then it still didn't fire: the check read `opts.Env.RepoRoot`, which is empty on the status path. `report.Repo.Root` is the resolved one.\n\nReverting to the empty root drops the warning to **0 occurrences** on a demonstrably unwired repo — that's how I confirmed it rather than assuming.\n\nAll suites green, `go vet` clean.\n\n**Left for you:** the three doc edits. The product no longer depends on them landing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":922225,"output_tokens":617,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1078},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":922225,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1078,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1078,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"84f9ca1a-f633-421b-9553-31fdd971b623","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhuJrgX8Jo2DUS2TFhF9","type":"assistant","uuid":"b35dffc3-9170-439b-8ee8-e76b529086b9","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:25:16.214Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
