{"parentUuid":"eba4f468-1e3f-4655-9b60-a8e3ed8306d3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14999504 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c248d048-1502-4b11-990f-5991c71c376a","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:30:49.881Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14999504 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"c248d048-1502-4b11-990f-5991c71c376a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfhuk4vv7wtRrf8xaTrzk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Seven PRs, in merge order:\n\n| PR | State | Size | What it adds |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **#306** | ✅ merged | 12f, +3060 | Import memory from another tool (mem0) |\n| **#318** | open | 9f, +940 | Empty results name the branch holding facts |\n| **#320** | open | 2f, +56 | `remember --json` returns what was actually persisted |\n| **#321** | open | 6f, +293 | Configurable distill timeout; names the nested-repo trap |\n| **#329** | open | 20f, +1758 | Retrieval output an agent can accept, drops disclosed |\n| **#330** | open | 26f, +1457 | Stops colliding with concurrent git; honours local models |\n| **#331** | open | 67f, +4662 | Makes agents actually use Brain; wires the pre-edit hook |\n\n**Merge order matters:** #318, #320, #321 are independent; then **#329 → #330 → #331** stacked, #331 last.\n\n## Where the weight is\n\n**#331 is the keystone** (67 files). It's the root cause of \"agents don't use Brain\" — the shipped guide told them they could skip it, and CI enforced that wording. The pre-edit hook was completely inert (`$CLAUDE_FILE_PATH` doesn't exist). It also carries everything from today: partial clones indexing, the unwired-agents warning, the `.brainignore` secret-leak fix, the ollama default, and the atomic settings write.\n\n**#329 and #330 are infrastructure** — nothing above them matters if the tools error or lie.\n\n**#306, #318, #320, #321 are self-contained** and could merge in any order among themselves.\n\n## Status\n\n**0 open findings on all seven.** Merge sequence verified clean against current main — builds, vets, 0 test failures. Everything exercised by running the binary, not just the suite.\n\nThree still need your approval (GitHub blocks me approving my own PRs). #306 went through because `ashtom` had approved it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":923983,"output_tokens":667,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":834},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":923983,"cache_creation_input_tokens":834,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":834,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"29d41046-219d-47fd-a96c-d453e8b5cb55","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfhuk4Hy1tMBTbH1ya8DE","type":"assistant","uuid":"451dd7d0-1a23-4db3-b38e-395b8f55515b","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:30:59.394Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
