{"parentUuid":"c256b23d-2e77-4c34-8fe2-69af586ed5de","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14996897 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"80cd6699-e936-4c94-a9f3-fba75c658670","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:34:01.693Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14996897 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"80cd6699-e936-4c94-a9f3-fba75c658670","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhuzCrJgWKG3MCifnrSk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed: `hooks wired: ['PreToolUse']` — only one of three.\n\n## Free value first: finish what's already built\n\nBrain ships three hook verbs; `init-agents` wires **one**. The other two work and nothing installs them:\n\n- **`hook post-failure`** → `PostToolUse`. Surfaces gotchas and closed-negatives when a command fails. Right now a test fails and the agent re-derives something the brain already knows.\n- **`hook session-end`** → `Stop`/`SessionEnd`. Distills the session that just ran. Without it, facts only appear when someone remembers to run `distill`, which is why fresh brains sit at `0/N distilled`.\n\nThat's the same class as the bug I fixed today — built, reported as installed, never actually invoked. Low risk, immediate payoff.\n\n## The idea I'd actually push: auto-brief on `UserPromptSubmit`\n\nThe measured wall this session wasn't capability, it was **usage** — no-guide arms used the tools 0/10. The guide fixed that, but it still requires the agent to *choose* to run `brain brief`.\n\nA `UserPromptSubmit` hook removes the choice: the brief is already in context when the turn starts. Non-compliance stops being possible.\n\nThe cost is real and I'd gate it — only for substantive prompts, budgeted, skippable. But it converts \"agents should use Brain\" into \"agents cannot not use Brain\", which is the whole thesis of #331 taken one step further.\n\n## Three smaller ones\n\n- **Statusline badge** — freshness, unwired agents, and *branch mismatch* (you have facts, just not on this branch). You already run a graph badge, so the pattern exists.\n- **`/why <symbol>`** — one keystroke for \"why is this like this\": `brain query` + entity history, no prompt engineering.\n- **Distill via subagent** instead of shelling out to `claude`/`codex` — in-process, controllable budget, and it sidesteps the ollama/`--model` mess I hit today.\n\nIf you want one, I'd take **wiring the two existing hooks** — it's finishing delivered work rather than adding surface, and I can do it inside #331 today."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1301,"cache_read_input_tokens":928058,"output_tokens":717,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1301},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":717,"cache_read_input_tokens":928058,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1301,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1301,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7e8dea52-6096-4487-99f0-25171848fc14","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfhuzC8uBNhK2NuiYdUjD","type":"assistant","uuid":"be958f07-50d1-49a1-bcd9-b4eec239eea1","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:34:13.144Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
