{"parentUuid":"9e75c51e-6f34-4ae4-84d1-08385610eddd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5c5a12e9-b219-4b59-9c91-bf4367c8ecdf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HaMA4DkSG6UXojNnziJ2Pp","type":"tool_result","content":"DONE\n=== captured ===\n--- shape-mcp_entire_brain_brain_search.json\n{\n  \"tool\": \"mcp__entire-brain__brain_search\",\n  \"eventKeys\": [\n    \"query\",\n    \"tool\",\n    \"tool_use_id\"\n  ],\n  \"resultKeys\": [\n    \"ref\",\n    \"result\",\n    \"text\"\n  ],\n  \"resultTypes\": {\n    \"ref\": \"number\",\n    \"result\": \"array\",\n    \"text\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"innerKeys\": [\n    \"0\"\n  ],\n  \"sample\": \"{\\\"ref\\\":1,\\\"result\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"branch\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"main\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"likely_edit_files\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"internal/cli/skill_synthesis.go\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"docs/pattern_consolidation_plan.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"internal/cli/mcp.go\\\\\\\"\\\\n  ],\\\\n  \\\\\\\"query\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"zzqqxx nothing\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"doc\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"doc:7aa4dbc3d96d\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"seed/docs/docs/reference.md\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"line\\\\\\\": 118,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"**Prerequisites.** One command does not mean no dependencies — it means you no\\\\\\\\nlonger have to arrange directories. These are still required, and `install.sh`\\\\\\\\nchecks all of them before it builds anything, reporting every missing one in a\\\\\\\\nsingle pass with the fix for each:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n- the Entire CLI, on `PATH` as `entire`\\\\\\\\n- Git\\\\\\\\n- a Go toolchain, 1.27 or newer, for `entire-brain`\\\\\\\\n- a cgo-capable C compiler for `entire-graph`, which uses tree-sitter native\\\\\\\\n  parser bindings — `xcode-select --install` on macOS, `build-essential` on\\\\\\\\n  Debian/Ubuntu. `entire-brain` itself is a pure-Go build and does not need cgo.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNothing about a *repository* is a prerequisite of this install. What a repository\\\\\\\\nneeds before `entire brain setup` — and what it does not — is\\\\\\\\n[step 3a](#3a-what-setup-needs-first-and-what-it-does-not).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**What it does to your machine.** Four things, and nothing else:\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n1. builds `\n--- shape-ToolSearch.json\n{\n  \"tool\": \"ToolSearch\",\n  \"eventKeys\": [\n    \"query\",\n    \"max_results\",\n    \"tool\",\n    \"tool_use_id\"\n  ],\n  \"resultKeys\": [\n    \"ref\",\n    \"result\",\n    \"text\",\n    \"isReadOnly\"\n  ],\n  \"resultTypes\": {\n    \"ref\": \"number\",\n    \"result\": \"object\",\n    \"text\": \"string\",\n    \"isReadOnly\": \"boolean\"\n  },\n  \"innerKeys\": [\n    \"matches\",\n    \"query\",\n    \"total_deferred_tools\"\n  ],\n  \"sample\": \"{\\\"ref\\\":1,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"matches\\\":[\\\"mcp__entire-brain__brain_search\\\"],\\\"query\\\":\\\"select:mcp__entire-brain__brain_search\\\",\\\"total_deferred_tools\\\":89},\\\"text\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"isReadOnly\\\":true}\"\n}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3063dfd0-e815-447c-8da9-29ed72e229a6","timestamp":"2026-10-04T21:48:35.724Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"DONE\n=== captured ===\n--- shape-mcp_entire_brain_brain_search.json\n{\n  \"tool\": \"mcp__entire-brain__brain_search\",\n  \"eventKeys\": [\n    \"query\",\n    \"tool\",\n    \"tool_use_id\"\n  ],\n  \"resultKeys\": [\n    \"ref\",\n    \"result\",\n    \"text\"\n  ],\n  \"resultTypes\": {\n    \"ref\": \"number\",\n    \"result\": \"array\",\n    \"text\": \"string\"\n  },\n  \"innerKeys\": [\n    \"0\"\n  ],\n  \"sample\": \"{\\\"ref\\\":1,\\\"result\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"branch\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"main\\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\\"likely_edit_files\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    \\\\\\\"internal/cli/skill_synthesis.go\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"docs/pattern