{"parentUuid":"c637b274-c495-4828-9cf6-6fc5e13409ef","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fd25f374-f99e-4e2a-9ad4-41cb9376e77f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016Xe5o29N7iMzu9te8xiZa9","type":"tool_result","content":"=== does the installed brain have init-agents? ===\nunknown command \"init-agents\" for \"entire-brain\"\n\n=== which binary is 'entire brain' actually running? ===\nlrwxr-xr-x  1 suhaan  staff  49 Sep 19 18:19 /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brain -> /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-installed/entire-brain\n--- brain-installed provenance ---\n52a4bf81 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into verify-merge\n\n=== verbs the installed brain DOES have ===\nentire-brain is an external-command plugin for the Entire CLI.\n\nIt builds a local, inspectable repository brain from retained sessions, seed\ncontext, docs, history, semantic records, and durable facts, then exposes\nretrieval, verification, evaluation, and MCP surfaces for agents.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain [flags]\n  entire-brain [command]\n\nCreate the brain:\n  add              Clone a repository, fetch its Entire history, and build its brain\n  distill          Distill captured sessions into durable facts (agent-required)\n  path             Print the persistent brain path for a repo path or URL\n  patterns         Inspect and rebuild repeated-work patterns derived from session history\n  refresh          Create or refresh the repository brain\n  remember         Author a durable fact about this repository\n  status           Summarize the brain: sources, facts, semantic coverage/freshness/blind spots, and live workspace state\n  watch            Keep the brain fresh automatically (deterministic refresh is free; agent steps are gated)\n  workspace        Manage local multi-repo brain workspaces\n\nExplore the brain:\n  brief            Build a bounded task packet from brain context and live state\n  dash             Browse the brain in an interactive dashboard (status, facts, sessions, history, semantic)\n  entities         Query the persisted entity -> checkpoint index (which checkpoints changed a symbol)\n  get              Fetch one item in full by id (fact:… | review:… | history:… | conversation:… | conversation-session:… | doc:… | pattern:… | theme:…)\n  guide            Print the recommended coding-agent brain command set\n  inspect          Run specialist brain inspection commands\n  mcp              Serve local brain tools over MCP stdio\n  multi-get        Fetch multiple items by id\n  overview         Summarize what the project is: stack, boundaries, commands, and recent decisions\n  query            Hybrid (lexical+vector, RRF) search across the brain\n  recall           Retrieve durable facts matching a query for the current branch\n  search           Lexical keyword search across facts, history, and docs (BM25 for history and docs; token-overlap for facts)\n  show             Show one semantic brain record\n  verify           Verify durable fact anchors against local retained sources\n  viz              Explore the brain as a visual graph in your browser (local, offline)\n  vsearch          Vector (semantic) search across facts and docs (history and conversation join with a Gemma-class embedder on the brain_cgo build)\n\nMaintain & share:","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3328fc80-0b98-4639-bc20-c1abac53eddf","timestamp":"2026-10-04T22:03:32.773Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== does the installed brain have init-agents? ===\nunknown command \"init-agents\" for \"entire-brain\"\n\n=== which binary is 'entire brain' actually running? ===\nlrwxr-xr-x  1 suhaan  staff  49 Sep 19 18:19 /Users/suhaan/.local/share/entire/plugins/bin/entire-brain -> /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-installed/entire-brain\n--- brain-installed provenance ---\n52a4bf81 Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into verify-merge\n\n=== verbs the installed brain DOES have ===\nentire-brain is an external-command plugin for the Entire CLI.\n\nIt builds a local, inspectable repository brain from retained sessions, seed\ncontext, docs, history, semantic records, and durable facts, then exposes\nretrieval, verification, evaluation, and MCP surfaces for agents.\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain [flags]\n  entire-brain [command]\n\nCreate the brain:\n  add              Clone a repository, fetch its Entire history, and build its brain\n  distill          Distill captured sessions into durable facts (agent-required)\n  path             Print the persistent brain path for a repo path or URL\n  patterns         Inspect and rebuild repeated-work patterns derived from session history\n  refresh          Create or refresh the repository brain\n  remember         Author a durable fact about this repository\n  status           Summarize the brain: sources, facts, semantic coverage/freshness/blind spots, and live workspace state\n  watch            Keep the brain fresh automatically (deterministic refresh is free; agent steps are gated)\n  workspace        Manage local multi-repo brain workspaces\n\nExplore the brain:\n  brief            Build a bounded task packet from brain context and live state\n  dash             Browse the brain in an interactive dashboard (status, facts, sessions, history, semantic)\n  entities         Query the persisted entity -> checkpoint index (which checkpoints changed a symbol)\n  get              Fetch one item in full by id (fact:… | review:… | history:… | conversation:… | conversation-session:… | doc:… | pattern:… | theme:…)\n  guide            Print the recommended coding-agent brain command set\n  inspect          Run specialist brain inspection commands\n  mcp              Serve local brain tools over MCP stdio\n  multi-get        Fetch multiple items by id\n  overview         Summarize what the project is: stack, boundaries, commands, and recent decisions\n  query            Hybrid (lexical+vector, RRF) search across the brain\n  recall           Retrieve durable facts matching a query for the current branch\n  search           Lexical keyword search across facts, history, and docs (BM25 for history and docs; token-overlap for facts)\n  show             Show one semantic brain record\n  verify           Verify durable fact anchors against local retained sources\n  viz              Explore the brain as a visual graph in your browser (local, offline)\n  vsearch          Vector (semantic) search across facts and docs (history and conversation join with a Gemma-class embedder on the brain_cgo build)\n\nMaintain & share:","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"30cf9b5f-8369-4c41-aeb7-c5e763d018c1","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":243},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entiredb","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entire.io","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c637b274-c495-4828-9cf6-6fc5e13409ef","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug"