{"parentUuid":"4a52ffc0-6b77-4a05-804e-38ebbfab582d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfhzZTJ6S1y7hugJpGS9Z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Verified directly, not from the agent's report:\n\n## All six PRs are now at 0 findings\n\n| PR | trail | findings | action |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **331** | 247 | **2 → 0** | wait_gate (round 1 done) |\n| 318 / 320 / 321 / 329 / 330 | 238/240/241/242/246 | 0 | ready_for_human |\n\nThe agent merged main forward and pushed two fixes to #331:\n\n```\n1df3ba2d  test(agentsetup): do not assert POSIX mode bits on Windows\n253681bf  fix(semantic): verify HEAD across the index run before claiming it was\na08e2ecc  Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into fix/agent-guide-...\n```\n\n**CI on #331: 21 pass, 8 pending, 1 skipping, 0 failures.** It's in flight, not broken — which is exactly why the agent handed back without a report. It's still alive at 107 tool calls and will report through handback once the gate settles. I'm deliberately not spawning a second one; that would collide on the same branch.\n\nSo once CI lands, the only thing blocking all six is **Approvals** — which is yours. I won't self-approve, and the skill forbids it outright.\n\nTwo small things I hit while checking, worth a line each:\n\n- `loop.py locks` doesn't accept `--repo`, though the skill documents it as `loop.py locks --repo <r>`. Harmless, but the doc is wrong.\n- That first POSIX-mode-bits fix is the same class as something already in your memory — a guard asserting Unix-shaped paths/permissions that CI catches and macOS never would.\n\nI'll report the agent's own findings-split and refutation rate when it hands back; I don't have those yet and won't invent them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1612,"cache_read_input_tokens":398393,"output_tokens":973,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":382},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1612},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":973,"cache_read_input_tokens":398393,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1612,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0b234c3d-bcd4-4d9a-837e-8bfc012d3062","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfhzZSqKuNnF4BqGnizrR","type":"assistant","uuid":"e536fbaa-eef9-4e7b-a4fb-288c10b40c36","timestamp":"2026-10-04T22:34:14.931Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
