{"parentUuid":"86d8c3b6-8857-4e09-b0eb-29f2caabbc59","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14922122 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"656bc0f8-a49c-412b-a7ad-0a52e688bc05","timestamp":"2026-10-05T01:24:37.537Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14922122 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"656bc0f8-a49c-412b-a7ad-0a52e688bc05","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfiDa6xXckymzb4zxZYzz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent resumed on round 2.\n\n**What it's doing:** merging `origin/main` into the four behind branches — #318, #321, #329 (35 behind) and #320 (56 behind) — then clearing whatever the re-review posts. Not merging anything into main, not approving. #331 and #330 are left alone; they're already current.\n\nI told it to run `go build ./...` **and** `go vet ./...` after every merge regardless of conflicts, because the zero-conflict merge is the one that's silently broken this build three times — main adds call sites while the branch changes a signature, git sees nothing, the compiler does.\n\n**Round 1, independently verified before I authorized round 2** — I didn't take the agent's word for it:\n\n- Zero open findings on all six trails, checked with the current CLI, splits matching its report exactly (247: 8 resolved / 4 dismissed, 238: 2, 240: 0, 241: 2, 242: 3, 246: 3+1).\n- `verifySemanticHeadStable` is called from **production** at `semantic.go:751` — inside the stamped-header branch and before the disclosure at `:758` — not just defined. That was the real risk: a correct helper nothing invokes, which is why its second test asserts the call site rather than the function.\n- Both new tests pass. Refutation rate 50% on #331 (1 confirmed, 1 refuted), which is a healthy number — a round that confirms everything is the suspicious one.\n- CI: 30 pass, 0 fail on all six. The single red check everywhere is `Entire Gates`, red on Approvals alone.\n\nTwo things from its report worth keeping:\n\n- **The installed `/Users/suhaan/.local/bin/entire` is the stale build** — I confirmed it independently (`Entire CLI dev` vs the agent's `0.10.4-nightly…3299a0f9d`). Resolve/dismiss through it 404s silently. Worth rebuilding at some point; the agent's build at `cli-trailloop-build/` is being used meanwhile.\n- The CI red on #331 was never a product bug — a test asserting POSIX `0600` on Windows, where Go's `types_windows.go` can only produce 0444 or 0666, so it failed on correct code. One package failing also starved the coverage job into a confusing second error.\n\nI'll report round 2 when it hands back, and I'll verify it the same way before passing it on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1351,"cache_read_input_tokens":421649,"output_tokens":786,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1351,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":786,"cache_read_input_tokens":421649,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1351,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1351},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a50d918e-9e7e-4e33-936a-db8054c4316b","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfiDa6C9Az5diDt64mgm6","type":"assistant","uuid":"32d07af3-f0e1-47a8-8bff-1782779ab253","timestamp":"2026-10-05T01:24:47.280Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
