{"parentUuid":"f2eda82f-cf4a-447c-8073-1190ee9e4dbb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"89f1a111-684a-4896-a471-e1f984b45b5e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KxybhZQgJevaTaxG8Maimw","type":"tool_result","content":"synced\n\n✔ Validation passed\n 20 pass\n 0 fail\nRan 20 tests across 1 file. [0.29s]\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"78ea8613-bdcc-4c30-88fd-c54ae2071422","timestamp":"2026-10-05T01:48:52.709Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"synced\n\n✔ Validation passed\n 20 pass\n 0 fail\nRan 20 tests across 1 file. [0.29s]","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":85,"oldLines":7,"newStart":85,"newLines":21,"lines":["    Reading `result.result` as the payload parses the *wrapper*, finds no `results` field,","    and scores every empty answer as a hit — the exact failure this mod exists to surface."," ","-2. **Brain payloads get truncated.** One real `entire brain query` here is 39 KB over 103","+2. **Brain truncates its own replies and declares it.** A reply that does not fit a byte","+   budget drops TAIL ROWS, not characters, so the JSON stays valid and nothing looks wrong:","+","+   ```json","+   \"response_truncated\": true,","+   \"response_truncation\": { \"budget_bytes\": 32768,","+     \"dropped_from\": [ { \"path\": \"results\", \"returned\": 15, \"total\": 20 } ] }","+   ```","+","+   Counting the rows that arrived reports 15 where brain found 20, understating the","+   contribution this pane exists to show. The pane reads `dropped_from` and renders","+   `15 of 20 results` — matched by `path`, because a total borrowed from another field","+   would be a number brain never reported.","+","+3. **Bash payloads get truncated too, differently.** One real `entire brain query` here is 39 KB over 103","    lines; the hook saw 80. Truncated JSON doesn't parse, and falling back to a line count","    turns every truncated answer into a hit. So the mod reads `persistedOutputPath` when","    Claude Code kept the full output, and otherwise classifies from the array's opening"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory/README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"25ef840b-a347-4e59-94c6-0daefe32d663","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":245},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-graph","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entiredb","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entire.io","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f2eda82f-cf4a-447c-8073-1190ee9e4dbb","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
