{"parentUuid":"aeb95236-ab48-4309-8ca5-a4ded8096182","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14907685 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c5cf805a-85a9-4a6c-8804-42ede1fae515","timestamp":"2026-10-05T01:48:52.742Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14907685 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"c5cf805a-85a9-4a6c-8804-42ede1fae515","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfiFRNAZFjL4cznMsxvvJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Closed the gap I'd flagged, and it turned out to be a different — better — bug than the one I was looking for.\n\n**What I was wrong about:** I assumed a large MCP result gets spilled to a file like Bash's `persistedOutputPath`. It doesn't. The envelope is identical regardless of size.\n\n**What's actually there:** brain truncates its *own* reply to a byte budget by dropping tail rows, and records it:\n\n```json\n\"response_truncated\": true,\n\"response_truncation\": { \"budget_bytes\": 32768,\n  \"dropped_from\": [{ \"path\": \"results\", \"returned\": 15, \"total\": 20 }] }\n```\n\nBecause it drops rows rather than characters, the JSON stays valid and nothing looks broken. The pane would have said **\"15 results\"** for a search where brain actually found **20** — silently understating brain's contribution, which is precisely the opposite of what this pane is for. It now reads `dropped_from` and renders `15 of 20 results`.\n\n**20 tests, 17 guards weakening-verified.** The second one is why I keep bothering:\n\n| weakening | tests red |\n|---|---|\n| declared total ignored | 1 |\n| total applied to the wrong field | **0 → 1** |\n\nThat second weakening fired nothing at first, because my fixture's only `dropped_from` entry happened to name the field being counted — so removing the field check changed nothing. A payload truncated on `results` while reporting `facts` would have borrowed the 20 and reported a count brain never gave. Added a cross-field fixture; it fires now.\n\nSynced to the live mod, validating clean. Still holding on the trail agent — no poll since I said I'd stop, and no handback yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":436685,"output_tokens":553,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":796},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":553,"cache_read_input_tokens":436685,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":796,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0cc2163b-5c26-46bf-bab3-e5148435aa0f","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfiFRMeJ7Z2F7WjhsLuaF","type":"assistant","uuid":"441d58cf-2a85-4fe0-a0c6-0c74bb8277e5","timestamp":"2026-10-05T01:49:00.608Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
