{"parentUuid":"7e21b380-103f-4c73-b941-e06d0ce5b32b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14888890 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5ffeb61c-436a-4883-a9a2-42ffe3d8bf9f","timestamp":"2026-10-05T02:16:49.231Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14888890 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"5ffeb61c-436a-4883-a9a2-42ffe3d8bf9f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfiHYx5fG4ueh5F6iyEed","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Round 2 is done and verified. **All six PRs: 0 open findings, CI 30 pass / 0 fail, blocked on your approval alone.**\n\n## The two findings that matter more than the result\n\n**A gate can read zero because no review ever ran.** After the sync, #318's findings sub-gate said `No agent review has run for the current head` — a zero meaning *absence of review*, not a clean review. An empty `chore:` push made the review run, and it posted a medium finding within minutes. Then the inverse trap fired on the same PR: the new gate read `Findings: passed` **while that finding was open**, because the review posted after the check completed. Both gate readings wrong, in opposite directions, on one PR, inside 20 minutes. Only `trail finding list` was right. Without that retrigger we'd have reported a clean #318 that had never been reviewed.\n\n**A worktree can be stale against its own PR head.** #318's local worktree was **76 commits behind `origin/fix/blind-spot-other-branches`** (0 ahead). Merging main from that tree and pushing would have silently reverted the PR's own work — no conflict, green build. `git merge --ff-only origin/<branch>` first caught it.\n\nBoth are now in memory, extending the existing trail-pitfalls note from two silent-zero modes to four.\n\n## The refutation\n\nThe one new finding was dismissed, and I checked it independently before accepting: the finding claimed `facts_manifest.go:46` \"differs from `loadFacts` (facts.go:151) **which uses the same pattern**\" — self-contradictory, and the lines are in fact identical. The agent went further and measured it with a `chmod 0o000` trial: the symlink guard three lines earlier *is* an Lstat of the same leaf, so it fails too; nothing proceeds. Its proposed remedy would have re-split the two read paths #318 exists to unify. Refutation rate 100% this round, 50% over both — the right direction, and it was evidenced rather than asserted.\n\n## One correction to the agent's report\n\nIt says \"none BEHIND\". **#330 is 35 commits behind main** — because I told it to leave #330 and #331 alone, and only #331 was already current. GitHub masks `BEHIND` under `UNSTABLE`, which is how it slipped past both of us. If you want #330 mergeable it needs the same sync; say the word and I'll resume the agent for it.\n\nEverything else checks out: no PR lost work (each still carries its full diff), all locks released, worktrees clean, nothing merged into main, nothing approved."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":925,"cache_read_input_tokens":455234,"output_tokens":837,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":925},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":837,"cache_read_input_tokens":455234,"cache_creation_input_tokens":925,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":925,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"93c200a7-d5e4-4d9b-b334-0f46834804c0","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfiHYwbuAT7dfe5grpEJc","type":"assistant","uuid":"c52deb77-34f0-4b24-ba0d-e002639ad5a6","timestamp":"2026-10-05T02:16:59.361Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dyna