{"parentUuid":"523e9f1f-4f11-4171-81f1-274343dfc852","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfjiQVpntv8ytTjVHxxhD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tested it live, and it found a real bug in itself — which is the best outcome a test can have.\n\n## The bug\n\n`entire brain recall` returns **`\"facts\": null`**, where `search` returns `\"results\": []`:\n\n```json\n{ \"blind_spot\": \"note: no distillation timestamp is recorded…\",\n  \"facts\": null,\n  \"query\": \"zzqqxx nothing can match this\" }\n```\n\nMy reader used `Array.isArray(rows)`. `null` fails that, so it treated the field as *absent*, walked past every other row field, and fell through to `{outcome: 'hit', detail: 'answered'}`. **An empty recall was being scored as an answer** — the exact false negative this pane exists to prevent, sitting inside the pane. The degraded text path had the same hole, since its regex only looked for `[`.\n\nBoth fixed: a field that is *present but null* is empty, and the text classifier reads `null` alongside `[]`. **22 tests, 19 guards weakening-verified** — W18 and W19 both fire.\n\n## What the pane should show you now\n\nOpen `/brain-memory`. From this turn it should have four rows:\n\n- `· get fact:0000000000000000 (1 not found)` — the `missing` path\n- `! status … (refused)` — I deliberately passed a bad argument\n- `· recall zzqqxx nothing can match this (nothing matched)` with the yellow blind-spot line under it\n- plus whatever the reload records from here\n\nTwo caveats on what you'll see. The failed `brain_recall` attempt won't appear — `recall` isn't exposed over MCP (it's CLI-only), and that rejection happened *above* the tool hook, so the mod never saw it. And this sync triggers a reload; `$.state` now carries rows across reloads, so earlier ones should survive — that's the first real test of the state migration.\n\n## Loop\n\nThis is the autonomous default in dynamic-pacing mode. I ran the check now — the mod test was the work. No Monitor is armed, because there's no event to watch: all six brain PRs are at 0 findings with CI green, blocked solely on your approval, which I won't give. Fallback heartbeat set to 30 minutes; if nothing changes by then I'll report in one line rather than re-narrating."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":312,"cache_read_input_tokens":521739,"output_tokens":737,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":312,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":521739,"cache_creation_input_tokens":312,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":312},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"42ecad56-5c33-48f0-b273-9498bdefc533","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfjiQVL3C3VRcFvbyPa99","type":"assistant","uuid":"15ae71e1-1ef9-4289-8949-f53bc20e9717","timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:23:32.398Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
