{"parentUuid":"299c7925-cde3-4b50-9801-2942c275d0cf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3f3a5b79-2bb7-4c28-9cd3-915a2be704cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013zFfJhDQYDgLPxGiT8HWz6","type":"tool_result","content":"=== does 'entire enable' have a user/global scope? ===\nEnable Entire with session tracking for your AI agent workflows.\n\nIf Entire is not yet configured, this runs the full configuration flow.\nIf Entire is already configured but disabled, this re-enables it.\n\nIf the current directory is not a git repository, Entire can initialize one\nfor you and (optionally) create a matching GitHub repository via the gh CLI.\n\nUsage:\n  entire enable [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --absolute-git-hook-path               Embed full binary path in git hooks (for GUI git clients that don't source shell profiles)\n      --agent string                         Agent to set up hooks for (e.g., claude-code, codex, copilot-cli, cursor, factoryai-droid, gemini, opencode, pi; external agents on $PATH are also available). Enables non-interactive mode.\n      --agent-help-skill entire agent-help   Install the stable Entire agent-help skill (points agents at entire agent-help) for selected agent(s)\n      --checkpoint-backend string            Checkpoint storage backend: refs (one git ref per checkpoint; recommended) or branch (shared entire/checkpoints/v1 branch)\n      --checkpoint-remote string             Checkpoint remote in provider:owner/repo format (e.g., github:org/checkpoints-repo)\n  -f, --force                                Force reinstall hooks (removes existing Entire hooks first)\n  -h, --help                                 help for enable\n      --import-history                       During first-time setup, import the selected agents' existing session history (last 30 days) without prompting\n      --init-repo                            If not a git repo, initialize one non-interactively\n      --initial-commit-message string        Commit message for the initial commit when bootstrapping a new repo\n      --local                                Write settings to .entire/settings.local.json instead of .entire/settings.json\n      --no-github                            Initialize local git repo only; skip creating a GitHub remote\n      --no-init-repo                         If not a git repo, exit instead of prompting to initialize one\n\n=== what gates capture per repo? ===\n{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"telemetry\": true\n}\n\n=== is devenv itself enabled? ===\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 501  staff  72 Sep 27 14:27 .entire/settings.json","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e46d6f2a-7e1b-4e91-990e-003168b73fca","timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:26:24.827Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== does 'entire enable' have a user/global scope? ===\nEnable Entire with session tracking for your AI agent workflows.\n\nIf Entire is not yet configured, this runs the full configuration flow.\nIf Entire is already configured but disabled, this re-enables it.\n\nIf the current directory is not a git repository, Entire can initialize one\nfor you and (optionally) create a matching GitHub repository via the gh CLI.\n\nUsage:\n  entire enable [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --absolute-git-hook-path               Embed full binary path in git hooks (for GUI git clients that don't source shell profiles)\n      --agent string                         Agent to set up hooks for (e.g., claude-code, codex, copilot-cli, cursor, factoryai-droid, gemini, opencode, pi; external agents on $PATH are also available). Enables non-interactive mode.\n      --agent-help-skill entire agent-help   Install the stable Entire agent-help skill (points agents at entire agent-help) for selected agent(s)\n      --checkpoint-backend string            Checkpoint storage backend: refs (one git ref per checkpoint; recommended) or branch (shared entire/checkpoints/v1 branch)\n      --checkpoint-remote string             Checkpoint remote in provider:owner/repo format (e.g., github:org/checkpoints-repo)\n  -f, --force                                Force reinstall hooks (removes existing Entire hooks first)\n  -h, --help                                 help for enable\n      --import-history                       During first-time setup, import the selected agents' existing session history (last 30 days) without prompting\n      --init-repo                            If not a git repo, initialize one non-interactively\n      --initial-commit-message string        Commit message for the initial commit when bootstrapping a new repo\n      --local                                Write settings to .entire/settings.local.json instead of .entire/settings.json\n      --no-github                            Initialize local git repo only; skip creating a GitHub remote\n      --no-init-repo                         If not a git repo, exit instead of prompting to initialize one\n\n=== what gates capture per repo? ===\n{\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"telemetry\": true\n}\n\n=== is devenv itself enabled? ===\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 501  staff  72 Sep 27 14:27 .entire/settings.json","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"classifierBoundary":true,"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"fcc7052d-4aff-416f-bb93-6e19274f3093","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":244},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"unknown"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"299c