{"parentUuid":"087fb7ff-9f65-4e66-930a-14ca75ac6be5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3f3a5b79-2bb7-4c28-9cd3-915a2be704cf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018c6Y8bM1P7wRXJYstUoTJw","type":"tool_result","content":"=== session adopt — the documented path for exactly this ===\nAdopt an active session from another worktree into the current repository.\n\nThis is useful when an agent starts in one repository or worktree, then moves\nand makes changes in another. Adoption moves the live session state into the\ncurrent repo and seeds it with the current repo's uncommitted file changes so\nthe next commit can be linked normally.\n\nWhen the source and target share a Git session store, adoption moves the same\nsession state file to the current worktree and requires --force or --yes.\n\nUsage:\n  entire session adopt [session-id] [flags]\n\nExamples:\n  entire session adopt 019ed5fe-ec49-7a72-89fd-f38e323f5448 --from ../cli\n  entire session adopt --from /path/to/source/worktree\n  entire session adopt --from ../source-worktree --yes\n\nFlags:\n      --force         replace an existing local state file for the same session\n      --from string   source worktree that already tracks the session\n  -h, --help          help for adopt\n\n=== ENTIRE_REPO_ROOT: does it outrank cwd? ===\n  /Users/suhaan/devenv/cli/cmd/entire/cli/plugin.go:183:\t\textras = append(extras, \"ENTIRE_REPO_ROOT=\"+repoRoot)\n  /Users/suhaan/devenv/cli/cmd/entire/cli/setup.go:2729:// The protocol promises every subcommand ENTIRE_REPO_ROOT,\n  /Users/suhaan/devenv/cli/cmd/entire/cli/setup.go:2752:\t\treturn fmt.Sprintf(\"cd %s; $env:ENTIRE_REPO_ROOT = %s; $env:ENTIRE_PROTOCOL_VERSION = '%d'; entire-agent-%s uninstall-hooks\",\n  /Users/suhaan/devenv/cli/cmd/entire/cli/setup.go:2759:\treturn fmt.Sprintf(\"cd %s && ENTIRE_REPO_ROOT=%s ENTIRE_PROTOCOL_VERSION=%d entire-agent-%s uninstall-hooks\",","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"e0c70c7d-db84-48bc-b440-924e3a779898","timestam