{"parentUuid":"d2869eb3-af69-424e-b587-f036c61e0565","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfjjBpNGv5TjqpnR5nVYq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1359,"cache_read_input_tokens":564482,"output_tokens":1120,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":678},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1359,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1120,"cache_read_input_tokens":564482,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1359,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1359},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":9673,"serverClassifierRequest":"87d7552b-1069-4827-b733-36e181746ce3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfjjBotzgf6dTjSM69xgs","type":"assistant","uuid":"2e4df398-98a8-4ba1-9f20-c6dd76860e33","timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:33:52.705Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"2e4df398-98a8-4ba1-9f20-c6dd76860e33","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfjjBpNGv5TjqpnR5nVYq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found it — and it explains more than the `gh` failure.\n\n**GitHub is reachable; DNS is wedged.**\n\n```\ncurl --resolve api.github.com:443:140.82.112.6  →  HTTP 200 in 27ms\nping 140.82.112.6                               →  0% packet loss\ncurl https://api.github.com                     →  \"Could not resolve host\"\ncurl https://www.anthropic.com                  →  \"Could not resolve host\"\ndig github.com                                  →  140.82.113.3   (works)\n```\n\n`dig` queries a DNS server directly; everything else (`gh`, `curl`, node) goes through macOS's resolver daemon. That daemon is the thing that's broken — which is why it hits *every* host, not just GitHub.\n\n**Your token is fine.** `gh` reported it invalid only because it couldn't reach the server to check it. Don't re-auth.\n\n**Fix — run this yourself, it needs sudo:**\n\n```\n! sudo killall -HUP mDNSResponder\n```\n\nThen `gh pr view 331 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json state` should work again, and I'll confirm the merge status you asked for.\n\nThis also explains the MCP servers that dropped mid-session — context7 timing out, the claude.ai connectors disconnecting and reconnecting. Same root cause, not separate faults."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1359,"cache_read_input_tokens":564482,"output_tokens":1120,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":678},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1359,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1120,"cache_read_input_tokens":564482,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1359,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1359},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"87d7552b-1069-4827-b733-36e181746ce3","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfjjBotzgf6dTjSM69xgs","type":"assistant","uuid":"abec0c4a-3ce1-415c-9696-3f741475af89","timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:33:58.650Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
