{"parentUuid":"aa929a17-b6f7-4458-bbfd-eee32dec4280","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfjjJ3LYdDu9R9S4n6yBr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Blocked — the sandbox-bypass flag is denied by policy here, and I won't route around that. So **I can't check the merge status from inside this session.**\n\nTo get the answer, run this in a normal terminal outside Claude Code (not `!` here — that uses the same sandboxed shell that's failing):\n\n```\ngh pr view 331 --repo entireio/entire-brain --json state,mergedAt\n```\n\nTwo things to be clear about:\n\n- **Nothing is wrong with your machine, your DNS, or your GitHub token.** My earlier `sudo killall mDNSResponder` suggestion was wrong, and I'm glad it failed rather than you running it. The symptoms were my sandbox losing name resolution and directory access partway through this session. Don't reboot, don't re-auth.\n- **The data I reported earlier was real.** All the gh queries that produced the finding counts, CI numbers and behind-by counts ran before the sandbox changed. Last verified: all six PRs at 0 open findings, CI 30 pass / 0 fail, blocked on Approvals, **not merged**.\n\nThe bullet list stands as written. The open items are all yours now:\n\n1. **Approve and merge the six** — the only thing blocking them.\n2. **Three doc fixes**: `--symbol` → positional, add `init-agents` to Set Up Your Repository, state the three-part `--path` rule. Hold the partial-clone and install-mismatch notes until #331 lands, or they'll document bugs that are already fixed.\n3. **File the lazy-session-creation request** — say the word and I'll draft it, though I can't open it until network returns.\n\nAnd one correction worth carrying forward from today: there's no usage number. Brain in devenv went from unusable-and-unwired to working-and-mandatory, which is a real change, but whether agents actually consult it more is unmeasured. The plan to measure it is written and unrun."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1721,"cache_read_input_tokens":568343,"output_tokens":1109,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":490},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1721,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1109,"cache_read_input_tokens":568343,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1721},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"f54a28fa-7ddf-4e6e-b228-30d7b86ae48d","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfjjJ2tFg8dHNSeadMjEa","type":"assistant","uuid":"4eadd634-1d87-4b8d-a01e-58ba445a3bb0","timestamp":"2026-10-05T20:35:18.626Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
