{"parentUuid":"acb38e6f-25eb-4060-892b-b8f94a2c9cd2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfk5QBsk5davt41u2mDyj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TUdtoPrKUeyFw3xDzNsW6C","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/dynamic-petting-globe.md","limit":25},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5089,"cache_read_input_tokens":600501,"output_tokens":586,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":488},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5089},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":586,"cache_read_input_tokens":600501,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5089,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5089,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01TUdtoPrKUeyFw3xDzNsW6C":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/dynamic-petting-globe.md","limit":25}},"serverClassifierRequest":"aac30ecf-292c-48b5-933f-c5111780891a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfk5QBWv6DrTbz35Txkt9","type":"assistant","uuid":"f38d2fa3-7e5f-4620-9bae-75b45f4dcabb","timestamp":"2026-10-06T00:58:50.957Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"f38d2fa3-7e5f-4620-9bae-75b45f4dcabb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"e7c90eee-8619-470e-b4f1-6a320f51d5ac","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TUdtoPrKUeyFw3xDzNsW6C","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Fix agent usage of Brain + Graph, and verify it in a clean environment\n2\t\n3\t## Context\n4\t\n5\tPRs #329–#331 (unmerged) fixed a text defect that plausibly suppressed tool usage: brain's\n6\tshipped agent guide told agents they could skip the tools, and CI enforced that wording in both\n7\tdirections. **Whether fixing it actually raises usage is unmeasured.**\n8\t\n9\tThe one experiment run so far is invalid, and it is worth being precise about why: the guide text\n10\twas injected into each agent's *prompt*. That tests whether the wording works once it is already\n11\tin context — the thing nobody doubted. The real-world failure is that the guide *file* never\n12\tchanges behaviour. Both arms used the tools 100% of the time, so there was no headroom to detect\n13\tan increase, and n was 2 per arm.\n14\t\n15\tThis plan replaces that with a clean-environment measurement using real `claude -p` sessions, a\n16\tpre-registered success bar, and a fix/re-measure loop. Three exploration passes established the\n17\tmechanics below; everything cited is `file:line` from source.\n18\t\n19\t### What is now established\n20\t\n21\t**Guide delivery (entire-brain).** `init-agents` writes `.entire/agent-guide.md`, root `AGENTS.md`,\n22\troot `CLAUDE.md` (carrying `@.entire/agent-guide.md`), and — new in #331 — a `PreToolUse` entry in\n23\t`.claude/settings.json` (`internal/agentsetup/files.go:19,221,249`; `claudehooks.go:46`). `setup`\n24\twrites **none** of them (`setup.go` has no reference to any of those names), which confirms the\n25\treported \"AGENTS.md never appeared\" as intended behaviour, not a bug. There are almost no gates;"}]},"uuid":"5b60a8db-814e-4dcb-9535-19a4eac2b598","timestamp":"2026-10-06T00:58:50.970Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/dynamic-petting-globe.md","content":"# Fix agent usage of Brain + Graph, and verify it in a clean environment\n\n## Context\n\nPRs #329–#331 (unmerged) fixed a text defect that plausibly suppressed tool usage: brain's\nshipped agent guide told agents they could skip the tools, and CI enforced that wording in both\ndirections. **Whether fixing it actually raises usage is unmeasured.**\n\nThe one experiment run so far is invalid, and it is worth being precise about why: the guide text\nwas injected into each agent's *prompt*. That tests whether the wording works once it is already\nin context — the thing nobody doubted. The real-world failure is that the guide *file* never\nchanges behaviour. Both arms used the tools 100% of the time, so there was no headroom to detect\nan increase, and n was 2 per arm.\n\nThis plan replaces that with a clean-environment measurement using real `claude -p` sessions, a\npre-registered success bar, and a fix/re-measure loop. Three exploration passes established the\nmechanics below; everything cited is `file:line` from source.\n\n### What is now established\n\n**Guide delivery (entire-brain).** `init-agents` writes `.entire/agent-guide.md`, root `AGENTS.md`,\nroot `CLAUDE.md` (carrying `@.entire/agent-guide.md`), and — new in #331 — a `PreToolUse` entry in\n`.claude/settings.json` (`internal/agentsetup/files.go:19,221,249`; `claudehooks.go:46`). `setup`\nwrites **none** of them (`setup.go` has no reference to any of those names), which confirms the\nreported \"AGENTS.md never appeared\" as intended behaviour, not a bug. There are almost no gates;","numLines":25,"startLine":1,"totalLines":224}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f38d2fa3-7e5f-4620-9bae-75b45f4dcabb","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
