(seed.go + semantic.go), and is defaultRefreshAgent codex-first there?\n\n4. \"setup reaches seed.go:271 with worktree=false.\" Re-verify the chain independently. Note watch.go:609 watchDeterministicRefreshOptions.\n\n5. Is extending `gitPathspecExclusions` (semantic.go:2408) actually safe, or does it change which files a `git diff` reports for change detection — causing brain to miss real edits?\n\n6. What does the plan MISS? Look for: other callers of the refusal, env/config that already disables the gate, an existing `--worktree`-defaulting path that makes change 1 unnecessary, or a simpler fix the plan overlooked (e.g. setup could pass worktree:true in watchDeterministicRefreshOptions — is that better or worse than touching the ignore list?).\n\nUse `entire graph search --repo . --profile full --head --query \"...\"` before grepping. Use rtk. Do NOT run the test suite; do not edit anything.\n\nOUTPUT: caveman-ultra compressed. Per claim: CONFIRMED/REFUTED + file:line + one line why. Then \"FATAL FLAWS\" (things that make the plan wrong) and \"MISSING\" (things it should cover). No praise, no summary paragraph, no preamble."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6679,"cache_read_input_tokens":624882,"output_tokens":1445,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":180},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6679},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1445,"cache_read_input_tokens":624882,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6679,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6679,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013WVfob