{"parentUuid":"6b0cb5cd-5af4-4224-b37c-7320568154af","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfk5xZjmzGSERXzYJpuj7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017gE3PYqZhNMjibUv1ojWX9","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/dynamic-petting-globe.md","old_string":"The reporter also asked for a CLI choice. Worth doing, but **after** B1–B4 land, because it is the\ninvasive part. When done, copy the only interactive prompt in the CLI verbatim —\n`promptSeedTimeoutAction` (`seed.go:1792-1809`): guard on `opts.noInteractive || !stdinIsTerminal()`\n(`seed.go:1811`) and return the fallback; prompt to **stderr**, read stdin, **any error falls back**.\nNo prompt library exists here — `bubbletea`/`lipgloss` are dashboard-only. A prompt that is not\nTTY-gated hangs every piped install forever.","new_string":"The reporter also asked for a CLI choice. Worth doing, but **after** B1–B4 land, because it is the\ninvasive part — and because B1 alone may satisfy the request: a user in Claude Code who gets\nClaude Code has nothing left to choose.\n\nWhen done, copy the **only** interactive prompt in the CLI verbatim — `promptSeedTimeoutAction`\n(`seed.go:1792-1806`, confirmed by direct read; one exploration pass wrongly reported the CLI has\nno prompts at all). Its shape: guard on `opts.noInteractive || !stdinIsTerminal()`\n(`seed.go:1811`) and return the fallback; prompt to **stderr**; `fmt.Fscanln(os.Stdin, &response)`;\n**any error falls back**; `default:` is the safe branch. No prompt library exists here —\n`bubbletea`/`lipgloss` are dashboard-only. A prompt that is not TTY-gated hangs every piped\ninstall forever."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_read_input_tokens":650494,"output_tokens":671,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":412},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":671,"cache_read_input_tokens":650494,"cache_creation_input_tokens":412,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":412,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017gE3PYqZhNMjibUv1ojWX9":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/dynamic-petting-globe.md","old_string":"The reporter also asked for a CLI choice. Worth doing, but **after** B1–B4 land, because it is the\ninvasive part. When done, copy the only interactive prompt in the CLI verbatim —\n`promptSeedTimeoutAction` (`seed.go:1792-1809`): guard on `opts.noInteractive || !stdinIsTerminal()`\n(`seed.go:1811`) and return the fallback; prompt to **stderr**, read stdin, **any error falls back**.\nNo prompt library exists here — `bubbletea`/`lipgloss` are dashboard-only. A prompt that is not\nTTY-gated hangs every piped install forever.","new_string":"The reporter also asked for a CLI choice. Worth doing, but **after** B1–B4 land, because it is the\ninvasive part — and because B1 alone may satisfy the request: a user in Claude Code who gets\nClaude Code has nothing left to choose.\n\nWhen done, copy the **only** interactive prompt in the CLI verbatim — `promptSeedTimeoutAction`\n(`seed.go:1792-1806`, confirmed by direct read; one exploration pass wrongly reported the CLI has\nno prompts at all). Its shape: guard on `opts.noInteractive || !stdinIsTerminal()`\n(`seed.go:1811`) and return the fallback; prompt to **stderr**; `fmt.Fscanln(os.Stdin, &response)`;\n**any error falls back**; `default:` is the safe branch. No prompt library exists here —\n`bubbletea`/`lipgloss` are dashboard-only. A prompt that is not TTY-gated hangs every piped\ninstall forever."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"508cba4c-9e90-41a9-abde-f1629537265c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfk5xZNx7bHiSxJiXNggm","type":"assistant","uuid":"9adebb8f-26fb-487a-ab17-5ccd761b397b","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:06:06.937Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-v1-guide","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
