{"parentUuid":"d30e6ecb-fe2c-4ebf-a1ca-ae1b40c914e3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14936402 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e42b1290-937c-468d-b7bf-bf636ad9b9c9","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:10:04.165Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14936402 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"e42b1290-937c-468d-b7bf-bf636ad9b9c9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfk6GeF9g8Juebo4t35eX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation is running on an Opus agent in an isolated worktree.\n\n## Where this landed\n\n**Branch:** `fix/install-ux-dirty-gate-and-agent-default` at `/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux`, off `origin/main` @ `6c8ebdab`. Separate PR, not stacked on #331 — that one's green and awaiting your approval, and touching it would reopen agent review on clean work.\n\n**The plan changed materially during review, twice:**\n\n1. **My first seam was wrong.** I'd planned to add `AGENTS.md`/`CLAUDE.md` to the hardcoded ignore at `semantic.go:2473`. That list isn't the dirty gate — it's the **indexing filter**, used at 17 sites including `filterSemanticSnapshot`, the snapshot stream, the file walks and coverage. That fix would have **deleted those files from the indexed corpus**: a regression disguised as a fix. Corrected to a gate-only ignore that leaves indexing untouched.\n\n2. **`.entire/*` was already exempt**, so the real gap was only three paths — and there are **two** refusals (seed *and* semantic), so a dirty install fails both components.\n\n**Two agents contradicted each other** on whether the CLI has any interactive prompt. I checked myself: `promptSeedTimeoutAction` exists and reads stdin at `seed.go:1798`. One agent's grep was simply wrong — worth knowing, since that function is the template for the deferred prompt.\n\n**Scope trimmed by evidence:** `ollamaModelMissingWarning` has **zero hits on main**, so wiring it up can't land here — it stacks on the feature branch. I cut it rather than port it.\n\n## What I'm not claiming\n\nThe adversarial reviewer I launched hasn't reported yet. I found the big flaw myself and fixed it, but if that review surfaces more I'll fold it in before this is PR-ready — I'd rather tell you that than imply the plan is bulletproof.\n\nNothing will be pushed, opened as a PR, merged or approved. I'll report the implementation with its weakening table — each guard broken, the test shown red, the failing assertion quoted — which is both my standard and, as it turns out, what CONTRIBUTING.md item 3 already requires of every PR in this repo."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2908,"cache_read_input_tokens":664693,"output_tokens":774,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2908},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":774,"cache_read_input_tokens":664693,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2908,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2908,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1db0ddc1-d5f0-4b2c-8b88-e82f232b5222","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfk6GdspnD4bmdjV5QtUR","type":"assistant","uuid":"b872c21e-944f-4d8c-937d-87c36c1a593d","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:10:15.253Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
