) → none.**","+New order: **detected harness *if its binary is also available* → PATH probe (unchanged order) → none.**"," ","+⚠️ **The availability check is not optional.** Returning `claude-code` on env alone would make","+`distill.go` build argv starting with `claude` with no fallback — turning a working codex run into","+a hard exec failure whenever the `claude` binary is absent from the child PATH. Detected-but-","+unavailable must fall through, and a test must pin it: `CLAUDECODE` set, `claude` unavailable,","+codex available → picks codex.","+","+⚠️ **B1 does not reach the watch daemon**, which is the one unattended path that spends tokens on","+a timer. `daemonEnv` builds an *explicit* env map (plugin dirs + PATH only), so `CLAUDECODE` is not","+inherited and the daemon still resolves codex-first. (`setupChildEnv` uses `os.Environ()` and does","+inherit — an inconsistency in its own right.) Either plumb the resolved agent into the daemon env,","+or report it explicitly as a known limitation. Shipping silently would miss the path where the","+defect costs most.","+"," Style precedent for env reads: `agent_policy.go:14-25` (`brainNoEgressMode`, `envBool`). Keep the"," existing name mapping — the function returns `\"claude-code\"` while probing the binary `\"claude\"`."," "]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"044ff884-d957-4a3e-9165-e152865b4e2e","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
