ence (\"idk","+what model\") only halfway: after them, a Claude Code user gets the Claude CLI — on whatever model","+that CLI happens to default to, still unstated.","+","+Fully answering the request needs either a brain-side `--model` default/passthrough for the","+distill step, or at minimum **printing the model alongside the agent** so \"idk what model\" stops","+being true. Needs a product decision; not folded into this PR.","+"," ### Deferred: the interactive prompt"," "," The reporter also asked for a CLI choice. Worth doing, but **after** B1–B4 land, because it is the"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ff51a9e0-d50d-4501-9a46-8d19739659e9","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
