{"parentUuid":"d0a1ade7-fcab-42c6-8267-b48c9e085199","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_018VPiDYapX8s9s87i3z7Bsr","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"52f146e7-88f5-4e0c-b767-cfffc8d41da7","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:12:51.819Z","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"52f146e7-88f5-4e0c-b767-cfffc8d41da7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfk6U5S2KUz8cvM2ZZFX4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The adversarial review was worth running — it found things I'd have shipped. Corrections are sent to the implementation agent and written into the plan.\n\n## Three defects that would have shipped\n\n**1. B1 would have introduced a hard regression.** \"Prefer the detected harness\" can return `claude-code` on env alone, and `distill.go` then builds argv starting with `claude` with **no fallback**. Any Claude Code session where that binary isn't on the child PATH would turn a *working* codex run into an exec failure. Fixed: prefer the detected harness only if its binary is also available, with a test pinning the fall-through.\n\n**2. My acceptance test was a false pass.** I wrote \"`entire brain setup` must succeed; it currently fails.\" It doesn't fail — `watchDeterministicRefreshComponents` passes `bestEffort=true`, so seed and semantic failures are reported but not fatal, and setup already exits 0 degraded on a dirty tree. **That test would have passed before and after the fix**, proving nothing. This is the exact failure mode in my own notes — a check that can't fail reports success. Now asserts on component outcomes via `entire brain refresh`, which does exit non-zero.\n\n**3. B1 never reaches the watch daemon** — the one unattended path that spends tokens on a timer. `daemonEnv` builds an explicit env map, so `CLAUDECODE` isn't inherited and the daemon keeps resolving codex-first. Either plumb it through or report it as a known limit; silently shipping a fix that misses the path where it matters most is worse than not shipping it.\n\nAlso dropped `.codex/hooks.json` — nothing in this repo writes it.\n\n## What the review got wrong\n\nIt claimed my ignore-list seam was a no-op for `.claude/settings.json`. That's true of the *segment* list — but I'd already moved to `.patterns`, which routes through root-anchored full-path matching. It reviewed the version from before that correction. Its reasoning was right; its target was stale.\n\nIt also quoted line numbers from `brain-installed` (commit `52a4bf81`), not `origin/main` (`6c8ebdab`). Mine stand.\n\n## The thing you should decide\n\n**The reporter asked for Sonnet or Opus — those are *models*. Everything we planned picks a *CLI*.** `--agent claude-code` chooses which binary runs; the model is a separate axis via `--model`/`injectAgentModel`.\n\nSo after this PR, a Claude Code user gets the Claude CLI — on whatever model it defaults to, still unstated. \"idk what model\" remains literally true. Closing that needs either a brain-side model default for distill, or at minimum printing the model next to the agent. That's a product call, so I've logged it as an open gap rather than quietly widening scope."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":732,"cache_read_input_tokens":678886,"output_tokens":918,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":732},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":918,"cache_read_input_tokens":678886,"cache_creation_input_tokens":732,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":732,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5b05e76a-02a9-41a3-9e1f-e0b47dbd1764","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfk6U59AVKFwqMN9tycR9","type":"assistant","uuid":"34cc61f0-2c14-4d20-aa6b-0d1d06bb508f","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:12:51.817Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4b