{"parentUuid":"799ede08-58b1-46e8-91cf-a5587a4700b8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14908361 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"932cb896-1ac8-4c9e-a3d0-98c4de281a23","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:45:22.587Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14908361 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"932cb896-1ac8-4c9e-a3d0-98c4de281a23","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfk8xo45V5jYgLbi57wk8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation is done and I've verified it independently. One correction is in flight.\n\n## What's built\n\n**Branch `fix/install-ux-dirty-gate-and-agent-default` @ `bffc8108`**, off `main`, 1 commit, **not pushed**. 9 files, +938/−23.\n\n**Verified myself, not taken on trust:**\n\n- **The indexing filter is genuinely untouched** — no diff to `brainIgnore.Ignored` or `gitPathspecExclusions` versus main. That was the regression risk, and it's closed.\n- `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...`, `gofmt -l -s` — all clean.\n- New tests pass.\n- **I broke the gate exemption myself and watched three guards go red**, including `AGENTS.md is not exempt from the GATE` and `dirty paths = [AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md internal/auth/token.go], want exactly [internal/auth/token.go]` — that last one is the guard stopping the fix from becoming \"ignore everything\".\n\nThe agent reported **16 weakenings, 16 red, zero no-ops**, and caught one patcher whose anchor had drifted after gofmt — re-anchored rather than reported as \"guard unnecessary\", which is the right instinct.\n\nIt also found something I'd missed: `docs/getting-started.md` **documented this failure as expected behaviour** (\"`entire enable` → two red x\"). The docs had normalised the bug.\n\n## My error, now being corrected\n\nI told it to drop `.codex/hooks.json` because nothing in *this repo* writes it. Wrong — the `cli` repo writes it via `entire enable --agent codex`. Same product, same install, same user. We'd have shipped a fix that still left **Codex users broken**, in a PR whose other half is about not disadvantaging Codex users.\n\nIts \"unverified\" note flagged this; the repo's own `.brainignore` lines 12-16 settle it. The gate list now aligns with that maintainer-drawn stanza instead of my guess.\n\n## Two things still open for you\n\n**The known limitation, reported rather than buried:** `daemonEnv` builds an explicit env map, so `CLAUDECODE` doesn't reach the watch daemon. Partially mitigated — a daemon installed by `setup` from inside Claude Code inherits the resolved agent via the watch plan — but one installed from another shell still resolves codex-first. Not plumbed; out of scope.\n\n**The gap that needs your call:** the reporter asked for *Sonnet or Opus* — those are **models**. Everything here picks a **CLI**. After this lands, a Claude Code user gets the Claude CLI on whatever model it defaults to, still unstated. \"idk what model\" stays true. Closing it needs a model default or passthrough for distill — a product decision, so I've logged it rather than widened scope.\n\nOne test failure exists and the agent proved it pre-existing by reverting to pristine main and running 5×: 4 fail, 1 pass, byte counts varying 37–41M against a 33.5M ceiling. A load-sensitive race, nothing on our path. I did not re-run that myself."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2345,"cache_read_input_tokens":693013,"output_tokens":1037,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2345},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1037,"cache_read_input_tokens":693013,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2345,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2345,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3cead6a9-085d-452a-9c4d-917d561a69c9","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfk8xnJBfzkeEta4MpoPo","type":"assistant","uuid":"63c2393c-301d-43