e). It explicitly says \"nothing in entire-brain writes it\" is the wrong test for membership, so the next reader can't repeat the error.\n  \n  I verified the cli writer before citing it rather than taking it on trust: `/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli/cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/hook_root.go:240` builds `filepath.Join(canonicalRoot, \".codex\", HooksFileName)`.\n  \n  3. docs/getting-started.md:287-289 — now names `.codex/hooks.json` for Codex alongside `.claude/settings.json` for Claude Code.\n  \n  ## NEW TEST\n  `TestWorktreeGateIgnoresCodexInstallFiles` (install_ux_test.go:66). Tree dirty with `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.codex/hooks.json`, `.codex/config.toml`, `.codex/skills/review.md`, `.claude/skills/review.md` → gate must read clean. Covers the two directory patterns too, which exercise `brainIgnorePatternMatches`' trailing-slash prefix branch.\n  \n  ## WEAKENING EVIDENCE\n  Dropped `\".codex/hooks.json\",` from the list (replaced by a comment line, so it compiles). Sentinel grep confirmed applied; `go build ./...` clean.\n  \n  ```\n  --- FAIL: TestWorktreeGateIgnoresCodexInstallFiles (0.00s)\n      install_ux_test.go:87: a Codex-shaped install was gated as dirty; the same bug, for the other agent\n  FAIL\tgithub.com/entireio/entire-brain/internal/cli\t0.575s\n  ```\n  Restored, `diff -q` against the pre-weakening copy confirmed byte-identical, green again.\n  \n  ## INDEXING FILTER STILL UNTOUCHED\n  Checked, not assumed. `git diff origin/main -- internal/cli/semantic.go` = 185 insertions / **5 deletions**, and all five deletions are on the gate path:\n  ```\n  -\tdirty, err := worktreeDirtyWithIgnore(ctx, opts.Runner, repoDir, ignore)\n  -\t\treturn errors.New(dirtyWorktreeErrorCode + \": refusing to index uncommitted content without --worktree\")\n  -\tignore, err := loadBrainIgnore(repoDir)\n  -\t\treturn false, err\n  -\treturn strings.TrimSpace(string(filterWorktreeStatus(stdout, ignore))) != \"\", nil\n  ```\n  No diff line touches `brainIgnore.Ignored`, `gitPathspecExclusions`, or the hardcoded segment list.\n  \n  ## BUILD / VET / TESTS\n  - `go build ./...` clean, `go vet ./...` clean, `gofmt -l -s internal/cli/` empty.\n  - Sweep `Worktree|Dirty|Agent|Refresh|Seed|Semantic|Setup|Watch|Distill|Status|FilterWorktree|InitAgents|Ignore` → **1024 passed, 5 skipped, 1 failed**.\n  - The one failure is the same pre-existing `TestOllamaDistillAgentEnvelopeAllowanceIsCeilinged` flake already proven on pristine main (4/5 fail there, byte count differs every run). Unrelated to this change.\n  - No push, no PR, no merge, no approvals, no AI attribution footer.\n  \n</agent-message>"}
