{"parentUuid":"ae522aed-a45e-48cc-8ef3-69efc8d0a459","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14902878 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ca628e28-5964-45eb-a010-d2fbcc4960ad","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:51:48.190Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14902878 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"ca628e28-5964-45eb-a010-d2fbcc4960ad","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfk9TDo8KUfquUuoq1p6p","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Verified independently. The correction landed and the guard holds.\n\n## Done: `fix/install-ux-dirty-gate-and-agent-default` @ `c24cf48b`\n\nOff `main`, one commit, **not pushed, no PR, nothing approved or merged.**\n\n**What I checked myself rather than accepting:**\n\n- **Gate list is the maintainers' own line**, not my guess — the five runtime-state entries are byte-for-byte `.brainignore` lines 12–16, plus `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `.brainignore`.\n- **Indexing filter still untouched**: zero diff lines touch `brainIgnore.Ignored`, `gitPathspecExclusions` or the segment list. That was the one way this fix could have become a regression.\n- `go build` / `go vet` clean.\n- **Broke the Codex entry myself and watched it go red**: `a Codex-shaped install was gated as dirty; the same bug, for the other agent`. Restored, green, worktree clean.\n\n**17 weakenings, 17 red, zero no-ops** across the whole change. The agent also caught a patcher whose anchor had drifted after gofmt and re-anchored it instead of concluding the guard was unnecessary — which is the difference between a mutation sweep that means something and one that doesn't.\n\n## Three things worth your attention\n\n**My error cost a round-trip, and the agent's honesty caught it.** I ruled `.codex/hooks.json` out because nothing in *this repo* writes it. The writer is `cli/cmd/entire/cli/agent/codex/hook_root.go:240` — same product. Had the agent not flagged it as unverified, we'd have shipped a Codex-user bug inside a PR about not disadvantaging Codex users. It also rewrote the misleading comment so the next reader can't repeat my mistake.\n\n**The docs had normalised the bug.** `docs/getting-started.md` described the failure as expected behaviour — \"`entire enable` → two red x\". Now corrected, and it names both `.claude/settings.json` and `.codex/hooks.json`.\n\n**Still open, and it's yours:** the reporter asked for **Sonnet or Opus** — models. This PR picks a **CLI**. After it lands, a Claude Code user gets the Claude CLI on whatever model it defaults to, unstated. \"idk what model\" remains literally true. Closing it needs a model default or passthrough for distill.\n\nAlso unresolved: `daemonEnv` doesn't pass `CLAUDECODE`, so a watch daemon installed from a non-Claude-Code shell still resolves codex-first. Reported, not buried.\n\nOne test fails — `TestOllamaDistillAgentEnvelopeAllowanceIsCeilinged`, proven pre-existing on pristine main (4/5 runs fail, byte counts vary 37–41M against a 33.5M ceiling). I didn't re-run that verification myself."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":912,"cache_read_input_tokens":699924,"output_tokens":976,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":912},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":976,"cache_read_input_tokens":699924,"cache_creation_input_tokens":912,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":912,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0ad64d44-f3ec-4267-847c-7deed2395df6","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfk9TCzGDQwTdL3UtYLdi","type":"assistant","uuid":"78e3288c-5637-4946-9a99-20e99af5324c","timestamp":"2026-10-06T01:52:10.166Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-