{"parentUuid":"db19fe45-7982-4df7-a840-e3e141aaf893","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14979996 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"6d621f40-1b69-4727-af48-df1e89dbb683","timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:00:08.611Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14979996 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"6d621f40-1b69-4727-af48-df1e89dbb683","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfmaSnubBJswgERNFgd9j","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress while the agent finishes the last piece.\n\n## Both defects now reproduced live — which nobody had done\n\nThe agent's end-to-end test uses a fake `CommandRunner`, so the actual reported bug had never been run for real. It has now, from a clean repo in two commands:\n\n```\nentire graph init-agents   →  .entire/, AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md\nentire brain refresh       →  exit=1\n                              refresh: seed baseline failed\n                              dirty_worktree: refusing to seed uncommitted content without --worktree\n```\n\nAnd defect B, confirmed on your machine without spending a token: `codex` and `claude` are both on PATH, main's order is codex-first, and this session is Claude Code (`CLAUDECODE=1`). So `entire brain distill` here picks **codex** silently. Exactly what was reported.\n\nA useful detail fell out: graph's `init-agents` writes **no** `.claude/settings.json` — it has no hook installer. So the real blockers are `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md`, since `.entire/` was already exempt. That's precisely what the fix targets.\n\n## One claim I passed on was wrong\n\nI relayed that `TestOllamaDistillAgentEnvelopeAllowanceIsCeilinged` fails 4-of-5 on pristine main. I've now run it myself: **3 of 3 pass**. It's load-sensitive — the agent measured it while several agents were saturating the CPU. \"Pre-existing flake\" still holds, but the specific failure rate I quoted was an artifact of load, and I shouldn't have passed it on unverified.\n\n## Ready for the after-check\n\nWrote a verification script that rebuilds the repro from scratch and runs the fixed binary — with a **negative control**: a dirty *source* file must still be refused. Without that, a passing after-run would be indistinguishable from the fix having become \"ignore everything\", which is the main way this change could be quietly wrong.\n\nThe agent is mid-edit on the model-visibility delta (`announceResolvedAgent` already takes `model`; 5 files dirty, not yet amended), so I'm not building from that tree. The moment it lands I run before/after plus the control and report the real numbers."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1727,"cache_read_input_tokens":720227,"output_tokens":737,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1727},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":737,"cache_read_input_tokens":720227,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1727,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1727,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4bd42805-1b91-4e07-90fa-9ade597e726a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfmaSn3jzuqicyE9f283K","type":"assistant","uuid":"6311048e-9cd3-4dd2-9aec-aa0ad89c0439","timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:00:18.668Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
