","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bc4cc6e4-3ebb-4a45-88a2-dcc272a1c72a","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"ccca56b0-29c6-4d94-b4fa-dc24e555977d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14971192 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"76110e92-45dc-4a11-ab89-faf459ec1af4","timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:10:25.872Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14971192 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"76110e92-45dc-4a11-ab89-faf459ec1af4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfmbEHxauN4vaqRv2oEEh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is verified end-to-end on the real thing. **`exit=0`**, both components build:\n\n```\nBEFORE (main @6c8ebdab):  exit=1   seed baseline failed\n                                   dirty_worktree: refusing to seed uncommitted content\n\nAFTER  (branch @3cc936ad): exit=0   seed baseline: 1 document, 1 entrypoint done\n                                   semantic index: 2 symbols, 2 relations, 2 files done\n                                   dirty_worktree mentions: 0\n\nNEGATIVE CONTROL (dirty source file): still refused, exit=1, dirty_worktree: 1\n```\n\nThat last line is the one that matters — the fix exempts Entire's own config and nothing else.\n\n## Two corrections to things I told you\n\n**The leftover `exit=1` in my first after-run was my harness, not the product.** I'd redirected `XDG_DATA_HOME` to isolate brain's data, which also hid the plugin registry, so the binary couldn't find `entire graph`. Linking the real registry back in gave a clean `exit=0`. I nearly reported a product failure that I had caused.\n\n**And the flake rate I passed on was wrong** — I said 4-of-5 fail on main; running it myself, 3 of 3 pass. It's load-sensitive, measured while several agents saturated the CPU. Pre-existing still holds; the number didn't.\n\n## What the agent found that I'd have missed\n\nIt corrected **its own** earlier report: the daemon hole wasn't a missing plan entry. It was the **upsert** — `recordSetupWatchPlan` did a whole-row replacement, so a later run with a blank agent *erased* what an earlier run recorded, and a blank agent isn't neutral because `daemonEnv` has no `CLAUDECODE` and re-resolves codex-first. Fixed as fill-the-blank, never-clobber.\n\nIt also declined half of what I asked. I said \"don't overwrite an explicit user choice\"; it pointed out that a previously *auto-resolved* value is also non-blank, so that rule would latch a stale vendor forever once that CLI is uninstalled — a worse bug. Distinguishing the two needs a persisted `agent_explicit` field, which it judged out of scope and said so instead of faking it.\n\n## Final state\n\n**`fix/install-ux-dirty-gate-and-agent-default` @ `3cc936ad`** — one commit, **not pushed, no PR, nothing approved or merged.**\n\n- **24 weakenings, 24 red, zero no-ops.** I independently reproduced two of them.\n- Indexing filter untouched — re-verified after every round.\n- `build`, `vet`, `gofmt` clean; ~2,600 tests pass across two sweeps.\n- No model id hardcoded: unpinned now says *\"model: the agent's own default — pin one with `--model`\"*, so \"idk what model\" is no longer true, without baking in an id that ages.\n\nStill unverified, honestly: no live daemon install, and distill's `--model` is covered by a unit test rather than a command-level run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1546,"cache_read_input_tokens":729291,"output_tokens":1019,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1546},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1019,"cache_read_input_tokens":729291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1546,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1546,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e76045b9-3215-4842-8c64-00bae3ccb835","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfmbEHCBi3Yim9wTHpFXj","type":"assistant","uuid":"c86ff791-11ce-4326-b662-f99745742de0","timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:10:39.650Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"c86ff791-11ce-4326-b662-f99745742de0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"goal_status","met":true,"condition":"fix it","reason":"Live before/after verification demonstrates both reported defects are fixed: BEFORE (main @6c8ebdab) exit=1 with 'dirty_worktree: refusing to seed uncommitted content' after graph init-agents writes AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md; AFTER (branch @3cc936ad) exit=0 with 'seed baseline: 1 document done' and 'semantic index: 2 symbols done' with zero dirty_worktree mentions. Negative control confirms the gate still refuses actual dirty source files (exit=1, dirty_worktree: 1), proving the fix did not become 'ignore everything'. 24 guard weakenings all red, indexing filter untouched across all rounds, build/vet/gofmt clean, ~2,600 tests pass. Model visibility fixed: unpinned now explicitly states 'model: the agent's own default — pin one with --model' instead of silence. Branch @3cc936ad ready but not pushed, per instructions.","iterations":1,"durationMs":820807,"tokens":35703},"type":"attachment","uuid":"268e1e11-6e72-4fe0-8e5f-a1c551dc9405","timestamp":"2026-10-06T20:10:58.381Z","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
