actually see is unchanged — #308 \n  study5-graph-beats-grep                      \"THE LICENSED CLAIM (2026-09-29): preregistered n=200, 5 fresh repos — graph shows target de","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"dbbd7e9b-501e-479e-b72b-f8b26deb710b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":246},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"unknown"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"unknown"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/cli","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"68e9ed5e-4793-44c2-a7bc-7f4b3d879c7f","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"f1ee7fac-556b-46e9-b0b3-2b067a7f1da1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14998076 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"653d828d-7ad5-4278-acc6-555e677933a3","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:32:19.885Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14998076 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"653d828d-7ad5-4278-acc6-555e677933a3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfmhUXRnNV1DhbZL4qqaU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pulled the actual record — I had no memory of last week in this conversation.\n\n## Last week (Mon 28 Sep – Sun 5 Oct)\n\n**Nearly all of it was entire-graph: 378 commits.** Plus 69 on graphmark (the benchmark harness) and 2 on brain. Breakdown: 176 fixes, 91 tests, 51 bench, 16 perf.\n\n**Proved graph beats grep at finding code — the licensed claim**\n- Pre-registered study, n=200, 5 fresh repos: graph found the target in **79 cases vs grep's 52** at equal budget, p=0.0045.\n- Earlier runs were weaker and honest about it: study 3 found **no** gain for the semantic channel at equal budget; study 4 was n=80 and didn't meet its bar.\n- That's three studies where two said \"not proven\" before one said \"proven\". The claim is narrow on purpose — locating code, not finishing tasks.\n\n**Found real bugs in graph**\n- Go router `Group()` loops forever on rebound variables — since v0.1.0. Repos we'd \"screened out\" were actually hitting this bug.\n- Agent output depended on **wall-clock time** — timing digits counted against a byte budget, so output wasn't reproducible. That invalidated one whole study.\n- Locate accuracy was losing to grep because the scoring maths used the wrong sample.\n- `git grep` could hang for minutes on certain queries.\n- Reusing a cached preindex was **4–5× slower**, not faster — the opposite of its purpose.\n\n**Got #315 to a launch candidate** — the combined stack, all CI green, waiting on review.\n\n**Wrote down lessons that keep paying off**\n- My own verification commands silently did nothing three times in one session — every time producing a comfortable false pass.\n- A launch guard that only ever met fakes, never the real CLI.\n- \"I haven't seen it\" quietly becoming \"it can't happen\".\n- Bugs that live in the *order* of two calls, where no test can reach them.\n\nThose four are exactly what caught today's mistakes, so the notes are earning their keep.\n\n**One failure, this Sunday:** the subagent-injection gate **failed** — 34% against a 40% bar. The bottleneck turned out to be the query, not retrieval.\n\n## Caveat\n\nThis is reconstructed from git history and the notes I wrote at the time — not from memory of the conversations. Commit counts are mechanical; the narrative is from the notes. If something big happened last week that produced no commits and no note, it won't appear here."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1694,"cache_read_input_tokens":735015,"output_tokens":844,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1694},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":844,"cache_read_input_tokens":735015,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1694,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1694,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"7edee8ad-a9a3-4878-9903-b55a991c3c56","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfmhUX7SLhfNWt8NM4tmU","type":"assistant","uuid":"ef8d4412-d833-487f-85fe-6605753f9175","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:32:33.472Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
