{"parentUuid":"7cbee480-ab5e-47c5-891d-3241dedacb3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfmhYR2viQjo91YfhCK2X","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconstructed from local refs — fetched Oct 4 21:25, so anything after that is invisible to me.\n\n## Brain PRs, last week (28 Sep – 6 Oct)\n\n**Merged into main — only 3:**\n- **#316** `perf/verify-once-per-generation` — 28 Sep\n- **#317** `fix/ollama-envelope-limit` — 29 Sep\n- **#306** `feat/facts-import` — 4 Oct (that's the one I merged during this session)\n\n16 commits total landed on main all week. For a repo with 378 commits of activity next door in graph, that's a very thin merge rate.\n\n**Open / active branches:**\n\n| last commit | branch | what it is |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4 Oct | `fix/agent-guide-directive-and-discovery` | #331 |\n| 4 Oct | `fix/blind-spot-other-branches` | #318 |\n| 4 Oct | `fix/retrieval-output-correctness` | #329 |\n| 4 Oct | `fix/setup-traps` | #321 |\n| 4 Oct | `codex/brain-remember-result-current-20260928` | #320 |\n| 3 Oct | `fix/multiagent-safety-indexing-windows` | #330 |\n| 4 Oct | `feat/linear-issue-memory` | someone else's |\n| 5 Oct | `alex/cor-2000-contributing-docs` | Alex |\n| 5 Oct | `alex/cor-2001-hide-dev-commands` | Alex — *\"surface facts import in operations\"* |\n\nAlso a stale `pull/319/merge` ref from 28 Sep.\n\n## The pattern worth noticing\n\n**Six of the nine active branches are the ones we cleared today** — all at zero findings, CI green, blocked on approval alone. They've been sitting since 4 Oct.\n\nSo brain's bottleneck last week wasn't writing code. Three PRs merged while six finished ones queued. That matches the note already in my memory — brain has had far more open PRs than review capacity for a while, and today's work added six more to a queue rather than draining it.\n\nAlex's `cor-2001` branch is touching facts-import surfacing on 5 Oct, i.e. building on #306 right after it merged.\n\n**Caveat:** this is local git only. My last fetch was Oct 4 21:25, so any PR opened, merged or closed after that — including anything today — won't show. The PR *numbers* for the open branches are from this session's earlier queries, not from these refs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1074,"cache_read_input_tokens":738828,"output_tokens":832,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1074},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":832,"cache_read_input_tokens":738828,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1074,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1074,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8b27d7d8-1639-4d4d-9d96-b85960872704","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfmhYQf7AS2StUgzRye53","type":"assistant","uuid":"47721769-5bdc-4e45-aa2e-824f6f48682d","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:33:25.113Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-brain","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
