{"parentUuid":"09c09a34-ed22-4036-834f-0f32eff853ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfmhi5Q1sth8PPRVAvG6c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4642,"cache_read_input_tokens":741580,"output_tokens":2558,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1757},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4642},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2558,"cache_read_input_tokens":741580,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4642,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":26165,"serverClassifierRequest":"c8f492db-bcaa-4453-8058-7564b9f1f67a","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfmhi4uzCS3xb2oWDcSUh","type":"assistant","uuid":"3aa0f746-ae4f-4795-99bd-9abcf1e93232","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:35:51.877Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-brain","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"3aa0f746-ae4f-4795-99bd-9abcf1e93232","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfmhi5Q1sth8PPRVAvG6c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Honest correction first: **the token alone won't fully fix this.** My sandbox has two separate problems — no keychain *and* no DNS. A token solves the first. `gh` and `git` still can't resolve `github.com`, so they'd fail even with it.\n\nHere's what each option actually buys you.\n\n## Option A — one `git fetch` (free, 10 seconds, no token)\n\nIn a **real Terminal window** (not `!` here — that's the same broken shell):\n\n```\ngit -C ~/devenv/entire-brain fetch origin\n```\n\nOnce the objects are local, everything I need is offline: I can see exactly what merged, whether #332 overlaps our #331 work, rebase my branch onto real main, and re-run build + vet + the live before/after.\n\n**This is the one that unblocks the actual work.** I'd start here.\n\n## Option B — the token (for reading GitHub's API)\n\nOnly if you also want PR metadata — review state, who merged what, descriptions.\n\n1. github.com → Settings → Developer settings → **Fine-grained** personal access token\n2. Repository access: **only** `entireio/entire-brain` (add `entire-graph` if you want)\n3. Permissions: **Contents: Read**, **Pull requests: Read**, Metadata: Read. Nothing else, nothing writable.\n4. Expiry: **7 days**\n5. Add to `~/.claude/settings.json`:\n\n```json\n\"env\": { \"GH_TOKEN\": \"github_pat_...\" }\n```\n\nNo restart needed — settings `env` reaches my shell on the next command (that's how `CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_DIRS` got there earlier).\n\nI'd reach the API with `curl --resolve api.github.com:443:140.82.112.6`, which I've already proven works from here — HTTP 200 in 27ms.\n\n**Be aware:** that token sits in plaintext on disk and is readable by anything running as you. Read-only, single-repo, short expiry is why I'm specifying it that way. Rotate it when we're done. `gh` itself still won't work — broken DNS — so this is curl-only.\n\n## My recommendation\n\n**Do A. Skip B unless you want the PR metadata.** The fetch costs nothing, leaks nothing, and unblocks the rebase — which is the thing that actually matters, since my branch is sitting on a main that's at least five PRs stale and #332 looks like it touched the same guide and hook code as my Fix B."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4642,"cache_read_input_tokens":741580,"output_tokens":2558,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1757},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4642},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2558,"cache_read_input_tokens":741580,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4642,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c8f492db-bcaa-4453-8058-7564b9f1f67a","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfmhi4uzCS3xb2oWDcSUh","type":"assistant","uuid":"6a4739a6-0422-4cd9-8cf1-7ce35c7af90d","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:36:02.403Z","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-brain","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.290","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
