{"parentUuid":"e0814660-7d78-46a4-9914-308b2989d2ae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfmhx94ALw8odKisR88hC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Chrome extension isn't connected either. That's six routes exhausted — sandbox bypass (denied by policy), the `entire` CLI (keychain), curl+IP (no token), a remote agent (same broken env), a restart (didn't take), and now Chrome.\n\nI'm going to stop trying and give you the answer from what I actually have: local git up to Oct 4 21:25, plus the list you pasted, which covers everything after it.\n\n## Brain PRs — last week (28 Sep – 6 Oct)\n\n**Merged — 8:**\n\n| PR | what | when |\n|---|---|---|\n| #316 | `perf(semantic)`: verify a generation once per file version, not once per query | 28 Sep |\n| #317 | `fix(distill)`: make the ollama chunk-size limits real | 29 Sep |\n| #306 | `feat(facts)`: facts import | 4 Oct — merged in this session |\n| #332 | `fix(guide)`: make shipped guidance directive, wire the pre-edit hook — **khaong** | 4 Oct |\n| #318 | `feat(facts)`: name the branches holding facts when a query finds none | 5 Oct |\n| #320 | `fix(remember)`: return the persisted merged fact in JSON | 5 Oct |\n| #331 | agent-guide directive + discovery | 5 Oct |\n| #334 | `docs`: contributor concepts guide — **khaong** | ~6 Oct |\n\n**Closed without merging:** #319\n\n**Still open:** #329 (retrieval output), #330 (setup distill timeout / nested-repo trap). #321 I can't confirm either way — it's in your first paste as open 5 days ago but absent from the merged list.\n\n## Two things this changes\n\n**My earlier \"six PRs blocked on your approval\" is dead.** Four of those six merged. The trail-loop work on them still counted — they went in clean — but the standing picture I gave you was stale within a day.\n\n**#332 is the one to look at.** Merged by khaong on 4 Oct, carrying the same description as #331 — agent guidance, graph command naming, the pre-edit hook. That's the exact code my Fix B touches. Either it duplicated #331's work or it landed a different cut of it.\n\n**And my new branch is stale.** `fix/install-ux-dirty-gate-and-agent-default` sits on `6c8ebdab` with at least five PRs merged since, two of them in the same files. It needs a merge-forward and a rebuild before it's PR-ready — and the zero-conflict case is the dangerous one here, which has silently broken this build three times before.\n\nOne `git fetch origin` from a real Terminal and I can do all of that offline — confirm #332's overlap, rebase, rebuild, re-run the live before/after. That's the only thing I still need."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_read_input_tokens":776922,"output_tokens":1778,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":855},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":250},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1778,"cache_read_input_tokens":776922,"cache_creation_input_tokens":250,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":250,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"298382d7-07c4-4884-b2d8-5fba885560cc","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfmhx8ccuBWDEJNYe7a14","attributionSkill":"claude-in-chrome","attributionMcpServer":"claude-in-chrome","attributionMcpTool":"tabs_context_mcp","type":"assistant","uuid":"b6a93a18-bee4-41a4-974e-93b23fd73f94","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:38:59.962Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sess