{"parentUuid":"8f478c1f-ce74-460f-a52f-6f8ef87de011","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfmi8nwkpws12A2gr7Nz7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Trails need the server and the token's in the unreachable keychain. The local side is nearly empty — **2 session records and 1 checkpoint** for the whole week.\n\nThat emptiness is itself the answer to something: it's the capture bug we diagnosed today. Last week's brain work was orchestrated from `devenv/`, which recorded nothing, so there are no trails to read. That's exactly why I enabled capture there.\n\nHere's your summary, from local git plus your paste.\n\n## Brain — last week (28 Sep – 6 Oct)\n\n**8 PRs merged. 16 commits on main all week.**\n\n- **#316** — verify a semantic generation once per file version, not once per query *(a speed fix)*\n- **#317** — make the ollama chunk-size limits real, and correct advice that broke them\n- **#332** — make shipped guidance directive, name only commands graph exposes, wire the pre-edit hook *(khaong)*\n- **#306** — facts import *(merged in this session)*\n- **#318** — name the branches holding facts when a query finds none *(the blind-spot fix)*\n- **#320** — return the persisted merged fact in JSON\n- **#331** — agent-guide directive and discovery\n- **#334** — contributor concepts guide *(khaong)*\n\n**1 closed without merging:** #319\n**Still open:** #329 (retrieval output), #330 (setup distill timeout + nested-repo trap). #321 unconfirmed.\n\n## What that week was really about\n\nNearly every merged PR is the same theme: **making brain tell the truth about itself.** Name the branches when facts look empty. Return what was actually persisted. Make the guidance directive instead of optional. Correct advice that broke the thing it advised.\n\nThat's the same defect class I spent today on — empty answers that look like success, and tools that don't say what they chose. The week and the day were the same problem.\n\n## The honest gaps\n\n- **I couldn't verify any of this live.** No DNS, no keychain, no `gh`, no trails, no browser. Local git is authoritative only to Oct 4 21:25; everything after that is from your paste.\n- **Brain merged 8 PRs while entire-graph did 378 commits.** Brain's bottleneck is review, not code — which matches the note already in my memory.\n- **Today's six PRs added to that queue**, and four have since merged.\n\nThree things still need you: a `git fetch` from a real Terminal so I can rebase the install-UX branch off stale main, a look at whether **#332 duplicated #331**, and a decision on #329/#330."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1254,"cache_read_input_tokens":780476,"output_tokens":1377,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":544},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1254},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1377,"cache_read_input_tokens":780476,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1254,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1254,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"1ea5d581-0fc5-4f23-bf76-4949c43c6de1","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfmi8nZBHYM4aTredA8gN","type":"assistant","uuid":"8965cdb6-e580-4d02-86a5-c2ea33c98f8c","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:41:22.937Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-brain","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"