{"parentUuid":"46bd9eae-e49d-430a-bc2a-84b40b26336e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfmimxKqbdXBbUmqbcdYL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't lift it myself — that's the one thing the control exists to prevent. I tried the sandbox-bypass flag earlier and the harness refused it, and that refusal explicitly covers re-attempting it by another route or in a later turn. Me routing around it on request is exactly the case it's built to stop, so I'm not going to.\n\nWhat I can tell you is precisely where the lever is:\n\n**It's your settings, not mine.** The refusal named the path: a Bash permission rule in `~/.claude/settings.json`. Your config currently has `autoMode.soft_deny: [\"$defaults\", ...]`, and `$defaults` is what's catching the safety-bypass flag. `/config` is the supported way to change that. I'd rather you make that edit than have me quietly widen my own permissions — but if you tell me explicitly to edit it, I'll do it and say exactly what I changed.\n\n**Worth knowing before you do:** un-sandboxing gets me DNS and the keychain, which unblocks everything — `gh`, `git fetch`, the rebase, trails. It also removes the thing that's been stopping me from touching anything outside the working directory all session. Your call, and it's a reasonable one given the sandbox is misbehaving rather than doing useful work here.\n\n**The cheaper option is still one line and gets you today's answers:**\n\n```json\n\"env\": { \"GH_TOKEN\": \"github_pat_...\" }\n```\n\nThat plus `--resolve` — which I've measured at HTTP 200 in 165ms — lets me confirm every PR's state and pull #332's diff to settle whether it duplicated #331. It won't fix `git fetch`, so the rebase still waits.\n\nSo: **token** for the answers now, **un-sandbox** for the whole thing. Tell me which and I'll go."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":760453,"cache_read_input_tokens":26450,"output_tokens":2138,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1557},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":760453},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2138,"cache_read_input_tokens":26450,"cache_creation_input_tokens":760453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":760453,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"9d3fef71-134f-4cf3-a6a1-4611531730f9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfmimv1SSaXxYh3G9ykFt","type":"assistant","uuid":"652b3f59-5722-4244-98c1-213e2fb1584e","timestamp":"2026-10-06T21:50:00.740Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-brain","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
