e does not say what it does (`add`, `path`, `dash`, `viz`, `patterns`, `entities`, `inspect`)? Propose better names where the current one misleads, and note which renames would break existing scripts/docs.\n5. Output volume generally. Measure or estimate the bytes a normal `setup` and `refresh` print. Is the progress output proportionate? Which lines are noise?\n6. Dead or unreachable surface. Any command, flag, or code path with no caller, no docs, or no test? (One known example: `ollamaModelMissingWarning` has zero non-test callers on the feature branch.) Find others — dead surface is surface a user can still trip over.\n\nUse `entire graph search --repo . --profile full --head --query \"...\"` first; grep/`--help` as fallback. Use rtk. No full test suites. Do not modify anything.\n\nOUTPUT: caveman-ultra compressed. A table per section: item | verdict | file:line | recommendation. Then \"TOP 5 SIMPLIFICATIONS BY IMPACT\" with one line each, where impact = what a new user stops having to understand. Mark unconfirmed items \"unverified\". No preamble, no prose."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1663,"cache_read_input_tokens":820975,"output_tokens":1155,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1663},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1155,"cache_read_input_tokens":820975,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1663,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Q2wkWPMtXHrALL5THpkdVg":{"description":"Audit command surface for simplifi