{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-06T22:29:12.303Z","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>acaa8203cf7130b65</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2/tasks/acaa8203cf7130b65.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Output volume measurement\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Table A (plain/piped; setup also streams nested `refresh:` lines on stderr)\n\n| print site | file:line | text (60ch) | s/n |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| setup preflight | setup.go:634 (txt 838-857) | `setup: background watcher: this run will install &lt;label&gt; at &lt;unit path&gt; -- a persistent launchd service...` | SIGNAL (consent; but 1st-run summary repeats it at setup_render.go:197) |\n| instant Begin | setup.go:644 | `setup: instant core (deterministic, no agent tokens)` | NOISE |\n| instant per-component Update x11 | setup.go:655 | `setup: instant core: session export` / seed baseline / doc index / ... | NOISE (repeats summary tick row) |\n| instant ready | setup.go:~690 | `setup: instant core ready in 12.3s -- built sessions, seed,... ; the brain is queryable now done` | NOISE (dup of \"Brain ready in\") |\n| component fail (+hint) | setup.go:279,281 | `&lt;label&gt; failed (&lt;detail&gt;) -- continuing; run 'brain doctor'` / `hint:` | SIGNAL (failure only; also repeated in summary at setup_render.go:156-162) |\n| nested refresh x~11 tasks (2 lines each plain) | refresh.go:162,168,172,214,321,364,409,428,441,467,500,545,561,577 | `refresh: locate brain` / `refresh: locate brain: &lt;key&gt; done` / `refresh: export sessions: 3/9 checkpoints, 2 sessions` / `refresh: seed baseline: 12 documents, 4 entrypoints...` / `refresh: history vectors: 412 embedded...` / `refresh: reclassify facts` + `done` / `refresh: pattern layer` + `done` | NOISE |\n| nested refresh final | refresh.go:602 | `refreshed brain: /Users/.../brain/&lt;key&gt;` | NOISE inside setup (stdout, then setup summary repeats `brain` path); SIGNAL standalone |\n| degraded/warning | refresh.go:193,310,486,588 | `refresh: &lt;label&gt; degraded: ...` / `warning: ...` | SIGNAL (rare) |\n| backfill spend | setup.go:974 | `setup: fact backfill will SPEND TOKENS now: agent claude over N session(s)... skipped` (Skip appends \"skipped\") | SIGNAL (cost) but odd \"skipped\" suffix = misleading |\n| backfill begin | setup.go:1003 | `setup: fact backfill` | NOISE |\n| backfill started | setup.go:1004 | `setup: fact backfill started in the background: N session(s)..., pid` | NOISE (summary says \"running in the background\") |\n| backfill cap | setup.go:1011 | `fact backfill capped at X of Y ... re-run setup` | SIGNAL |\n| backfill skips (re-run) | setup.go:924-960 | `fact backfill: already complete (N/N)` / `already running (pid..)` / `no agent CLI on PATH` / `no captured sessions yet` | SIGNAL if no CLI/no sessions, else NOISE |\n| workspace begin | setup.go:719 | `setup: workspace registration` | NOISE |\n| workspace done | setup.go:720 | `setup: workspace \"x\" now tracks &lt;repo-key&gt; done` | NOISE |\n| workspace re-run | setup.go:717 | `setup: workspace \"x\" already has this repo skipped` | NOISE |\n| daemon begin | setup.go:900 | `setup: background watcher` | NOISE |\n| daemon installed | setup.go:913 | `setup: background watcher installed (io.entire.brain-watch.1a2b3c4d) done` | NOISE (hashed label = internal id) |\n| daemon re-run | setup.go:890 | `setup: background watcher already running (&lt;label&gt;) skipped` | NOISE |\n| hook | setup.go:1560-1570 | `setup: session-end hook already wired (&lt;source&gt;) skipped` | SIGNAL only if not wired; else NOISE |\n| summary headline | setup_render.go:128 | `Brain ready in 31.4s` | SIGNAL |\n| summary repo | setup_render.go:145 | `  repo  /path  (&lt;RepoKey&gt;)` | NOISE (key internal) |\n| summary brain | setup_render.go:146 | `  brain &lt;brain path&gt;` | NOISE |\n| summary instant | setup_render.go:151 | `  instant ok sessions ok seed ok docs ok semantic ok history ... ok entities ok memory (12s)` | NOISE (internal ids, no action) |\n| summary facts | setup_render.go:171 | `  facts [bar] 0/42 sessions distilled` | SIGNAL |\n| summary backfill | setup_render.go:173 | `  backfill ok running in the background (pid.., N of M queued) (0.2s)` | SIGNAL (dup of earlier lines) |\n| summary workspace | setup_render.go:178 | `  workspace ok &lt;name&gt; (0.0s)` | NOISE |\n| summary daemon | setup_render.go:179 | `  daemon ok installed (io.entire.brain-watch.xxxx) (0.3s)` | MIXED |\n| persistent-service line | setup_render.go:197 | `    persistent service, starts again at every login: &lt;unit path&gt;` | SIGNAL (dup of preflight) |\n| watch coverage | setup_render.go:206 | `    watching 3 workspaces (a, b, c) every 5m` | NOISE |\n| warnings | setup_render.go:212 | `    ! &lt;warning&gt;` | SIGNAL |\n| Next block | setup_render.go:216-248 | `Next` + overview / brief \"&lt;task&gt;\" / status / setup --uninstall-daemon | SIGNAL (3-4 rows) |\n| refresh stderr tasks (standalone) | refresh.go (as above) | `refresh: &lt;label&gt;` + `refresh: &lt;label&gt; done` per stage; `refresh: &lt;label&gt; skipped` on no-op | NOISE |\n| refresh success | refresh.go:602 | `refreshed brain: &lt;path&gt;` | SIGNAL |\n| refresh worktree note | refresh.go:599 | `refreshWorktreeSemanticSkipNote` | SIGNAL (only --worktree) |\n| refresh auto status (default `statusAfter:true`) | refresh.go:107,607 -&gt; status_render.go:501-560 | `Brain  &lt;key&gt;` / identity line / blank / `Onboarding` / facts bar / daemon / watch coverage / `instant ok sessions ok seed ...` / blank / health line / `status --verbose` hint | MIXED: facts+health SIGNAL; header, identity, instant row, coverage NOISE |\n\nTable B (est; plain, 2&gt;&amp;1 merged; avg ~75B/line, long paths)\n\n| scenario | est lines | est bytes |\n|---|---|---|\n| (a) first `setup`, fresh repo | ~65 (preflight 1, instant 13, nested refresh ~24, refreshed 1, backfill 3, ws 2, daemon 2, hook 1, summary ~17) | ~5.0 KB |\n| (b) re-run `setup` | ~50 (nested refresh ~24 mostly skips, 1-line skips for backfill/ws/daemon/hook, same ~17 summary) | ~3.8 KB |\n| (c) no-op `refresh` | ~30 (~18 stderr stage lines + 1 success + ~11 status) | ~2.2 KB |\n| (d) full `refresh --force` | ~50-65 (+export/semantic/vector progress ticks, coalesced ~1/s, + 11 status) | ~3.5-4.5 KB |\n\nTTY vs piped\n\n| item | file:line | behaviour |\n|---|---|---|\n| gate | progress.go:255, tui/render.go:34 (`Caps.TTY`) | TTY = one in-place spinner line (`\\r\\033[2K` repaint, 10Hz, bar, tick row); only ONE permanent line per task (`mark label done`/`skipped`) |\n| piped | progress.go:231-250, 372-396 | `&lt;prefix&gt;: &lt;text&gt;` per Begin + per coalesced Update flush + Finish, so ~2x lines per task. On TTY, vanish: every Begin line, every intermediate Update line (the 11 `instant core: &lt;component&gt;` lines, export/semantic counters), all `setup:`/`refresh:` prefixes, bar, colour |\n| TTY-only extras | progress.go:247-262 | spinner/marks/bar, truncated to terminal width |\n| summary / Next / status | setup_render.go, status_render.go | same text on both, only colour/glyph/bar differ |\n| nesting | setup.go:1254, watch.go:599-600, progress.go:12-30 | setup's instant phase passes real stdout/stderr to the nested refresh, so it prints refresh's stage lines under setup's own (TTY: only innermost paints) |\n| --json | setup.go:538 | progress -&gt; io.Discard; one JSON doc |\n\nInternal identifiers printed\n- Summary `instant` row and `status` Onboarding row print raw ids: `sessions seed docs semantic history history-vectors branches facts patterns memory entities` (setup_render.go:268, status_render.go:~560). Label map `setupComponentLabels` (setup.go:93) is used only for failure lines, so the same component has two names in one run.\n- `repo ... (&lt;RepoKey&gt;)` (setup_render.go:145) and `locate brain: &lt;key&gt;` (refresh.go:168).\n- Hashed daemon label `io.entire.brain-watch.1a2b3c4d` (setup.go:913, 890; setup_render.go:179).\n- `refresh:` stage names (`reclassify facts`, `pattern layer`, `branch overlays`, `history vectors`, `conversation vectors`) and counts (`412 embedded, 17 pruned (3050 total)`, `40781 symbols, 131529 relations`).\n- Messages `skipped` appended to non-skips (`fact backfill will SPEND TOKENS now ... skipped`; `daemon already running ... skipped`).\n\nCut (3 bullets)\n- Setup: delete nested refresh stderr lines and the `setup: instant core: &lt;x&gt;` / `ready in` / backfill-begin / workspace / daemon begin/done lines (~35-45 of ~65). Keep one preflight/consent line, any failure+hint, the SPEND TOKENS line, the summary, Next. Pass `io.Discard` as the nested refresh's stderr/stdout (setup.go:1254-1257) when not `--json`, and drop its `refreshed brain:` line.\n- Summary: remove `instant` tick row, `repo (key)`, `brain` path (keep one), per-row timings, coverage line, duplicate persistent-service text; show facts + daemon + Next only. Use user labels (`setupComponentLabel`) wherever a component appears.\n- Refresh: default `statusAfter` false (refresh.go:108); print one `refreshed brain` line (+ degraded/warn) and collapse the per-stage pairs to skipped/done only when slow or failed; if status stays, drop the `Brain`/identity/instant/coverage lines.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>124495</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>19</tool_uses><duration_ms>108796</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
