line: 12 documents, 4 entrypoints...` / `refresh: history vectors: 412 embedded...` / `refresh: reclassify facts` + `done` / `refresh: pattern layer` + `done` | NOISE |\n| nested refresh final | refresh.go:602 | `refreshed brain: /Users/.../brain/&lt;key&gt;` | NOISE inside setup (stdout, then setup summary repeats `brain` path); SIGNAL standalone |\n| degraded/warning | refresh.go:193,310,486,588 | `refresh: &lt;label&gt; degraded: ...` / `warning: ...` | SIGNAL (rare) |\n| backfill spend | setup.go:974 | `setup: fact backfill will SPEND TOKENS now: agent claude over N session(s)... skipped` (Skip appends \"skipped\") | SIGNAL (cost) but odd \"skipped\" suffix = misleading |\n| backfill begin | setup.go:1003 | `setup: fact backfill` | NOISE |\n| backfill started | setup.go:1004 | `setup: fact backfill started in the background: N session(s)..., pid` | NOISE (summary says \"running in the background\") |\n| backfill cap | setup.go:1011 | `fact backfill capped at X of Y ... re-run setup` | SIGNAL |\n| backfill skips (re-run) | setup.go:924-960 | `fact backfill: already complete (N/N)` / `already running (pid..)` / `no agent CLI on PATH` / `no captured sessions yet` | SIGNAL if no CLI/no sessions, else NOISE |\n| workspace begin | setup.go:719 | `setup: workspace registration` | NOISE |\n| workspace done | setup.go:720 | `setup: workspace \"x\" now tracks &lt;repo-key&gt; done` | NOISE |\n| workspace re-run | setup.go:717 | `setup: workspace \"x\" already has this repo skipped` | NOISE |\n| daemon begin | setup.go:900 | `setup: background watcher` | NOISE |\n| daemon installed | setup.go:913 | `setup: background watcher installed (io.entire.brain-watch.1a2b3c4d) done` | NOISE (hashed label = internal id) |\n| daemon re-run | setup.go:890 | `setup: background watcher already running (&lt;label&gt;) skipped` | NOISE |\n| hook | setup.go:1560-1570 | `setup: session-end hook already wired (&lt;source&gt;) skipped` | SIGNAL only if not wired; else NOISE |\n| summary headline | setup_render.go:128 | `Brain ready in 31.4s` | SIGNAL |\n| summary repo | setup_render.go:145 | `  repo  /path  (&lt;RepoKey&gt;)` | NOISE (key internal) |\n| summary brain | setup_render.go:146 | `  brain &lt;brain path&gt;` | NOISE |\n| summary instant | setup_render.go:151 | `  instant ok sessions ok seed ok docs ok semantic ok history ... ok entities ok memory (12s)` | NOISE (internal ids, no action) |\n| summary facts | setup_render.go:171 | `  facts [bar] 0/42 sessions distilled` | SIGNAL |\n| summary backfill | setup_render.go:173 | `  backfill ok running in the background (pid.., N of M queued) (0.2s)` | SIGNAL (dup of earlier lines) |\n| summary workspace | setup_render.go:178 | `  workspace ok &lt;name&gt; (0.0s)` | NOISE |\n| summary daemon | setup_render.go:179 | `  daemon ok installed (io.entire.brain-watch.xxxx) (0.3s)` | MIXED |\n| persistent-service line | setup_render.go:197 | `    persistent service, starts again at every login: &lt;unit path&gt;` | SIGNAL (dup of preflight) |\n| watch coverage | setup_render.go:206 | `    watching 3 workspaces (a, b, c) every 5m` | NOISE |\n| warnings | setup_render.go:212 | `    ! &lt;warning&gt;` | SIGNAL |\n| Next block | setup_render.go:216-248 | `Next` + overview / brief \"&lt;task&gt;\" / status / setup --uninstall-daemon | SIGNAL (3-4 rows) |\n| refresh stderr tasks (standalone) | refresh.go (as above) | `refresh: &lt;label&gt;` + `refresh: &lt;label&gt; done` per stage; `refresh: &lt;label&gt; skipped` on no-op | NOISE |\n| refresh success | refresh.go:602 | `refreshed brain: &lt;path&gt;` | SIGNAL |\n| refresh worktree note | refresh.go:599 | `refreshWorktreeSemanticSkipNote` | SIGNAL (only --worktree) |\n| refresh auto status (default `statusAfter:true`) | refresh.go:107,607 -&gt; status_render.go:501-560 | `Brain  &lt;key&gt;` / identity line / blank / `Onboarding` / facts bar / daemon / watch coverage / `instant ok sessions ok seed ...` / blank / health line / `status --verbose` hint | MIXED: fact