{"parentUuid":"dc143e2d-e245-4986-bc9f-34ce9bd3d5c2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14932452 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"dd62f5f1-3b5d-49fe-ab45-5fc790c7c3d8","timestamp":"2026-10-06T22:37:40.997Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14932452 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"dd62f5f1-3b5d-49fe-ab45-5fc790c7c3d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfmnTaa73jP7ixBaZnH9z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan's in place, 30 defects catalogued, and here's your hands-on sheet.\n\n## First — I broke something and fixed it\n\nRunning my own harness **overwrote your real launchd daemon plist**, repointing it at a temp directory that then got deleted. I repaired it (it points at the real install again) and hardened the script with `--no-daemon`.\n\nThat's now **UX-01, the top P0**: the daemon isn't isolated by `XDG_*`, so *anyone trying brain in a scratch repo breaks their actual install*. A real user would hit that and have no idea why.\n\n## Three things that correct what I told you\n\n- **`entire brain index` does not exist** — confirmed `unknown command \"index\"`. Yet **10 error messages tell you to run it**. It's the first thing a degraded user reaches for.\n- **`refresh --worktree` explicitly disables semantic.** The remedy I suggested for your repo would have rebuilt seed only and left semantic failed. Good thing you stopped me.\n- **`.brainignore` is the real escape hatch — named in 0 error strings and 0 README lines.** It's already loaded by the gate and would have cleared your 250-file repo instantly.\n\nAnd my own branch `3cc936ad` **does not fix your case**: it exempts only Entire-authored files, so real work still fails both gates, and it ships the wrong hint untouched.\n\n## Run it yourself\n\n```sh\ncd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog\nsh scripts/try-first-run.sh dirty    # uncommitted real work — your case\nsh scripts/try-first-run.sh clean    # the happy path\n```\n\nThrowaway repo, isolated state, nothing you care about touched. It walks: `setup` → `status` → `brief` → `overview` → `query` → the dead `index` verb → `doctor` (count the lines, then count the ones you can act on) → whether an agent would even know the brain exists.\n\nI already ran `dirty` — it reproduced your exact failure in under a second.\n\n## The numbers\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| defects catalogued | **30** (8 P0, 13 P1, 9 P2) |\n| verbs / invocable commands | **46 / ~127** |\n| ways to ask one question | **7** |\n| `doctor` on a *healthy* brain | 40 lines, 6.4 KB, 1 of 6 non-ok lines names a fix |\n| doctor checks that are constant `\"ok\"` | **3** — they can never fail |\n| first `setup` output | ~65 lines, ~24 of them leaked from the inner refresh |\n\nBacklog: `docs/install-ux-backlog.md` on branch `docs/install-ux-backlog`. Nothing committed or pushed yet — say the word and I'll start at UX-01."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5313,"cache_read_input_tokens":876810,"output_tokens":920,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5313},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":920,"cache_read_input_tokens":876810,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5313,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5313,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"4210131d-9a5f-40db-bc9b-64021ce13b43","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfmnTaBYR4MuNC9E4Gi1M","type":"assistant","uuid":"2dd68b3e-5ac2-47a0-beaa-7404c771ab91","timestamp":"2026-10-06T22:37:53.105Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.292","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-pett