{"parentUuid":"7ff51b43-4873-4d20-87e6-e39e37e9e3e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw6ZbmLrUSXmJUDbMDWy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The branch is unblocked and shippable.\n\n## Done this turn\n\n**`fix/install-ux-dirty-gate-and-agent-default` @ `6f344b61`** — 0 behind main, clean tree, my fix commit intact.\n\n- Merged **76 commits** of main forward. **Zero conflicts** — which is the dangerous case here, so: `go build` clean, `go vet` clean, all 24 guards still pass.\n- Rebuilt and confirmed the merged binary carries **both** feature sets: my `init-agents` fixes *and* main's new `brain connect`.\n- Re-ran the live acceptance on a throwaway repo with `--no-daemon`:\n\n```\nAFTER            exit=0   dirty_worktree: 0   semantic index: 2 symbols, 2 relations, 2 files done\nNEGATIVE CONTROL exit=1   dirty_worktree: 1   (a real source edit is still refused)\n```\n\nNothing pushed, no PR, nothing approved — your standing rule.\n\n## On your goals\n\n**Shared hosted brain is already built.** `brain connect` is on main (`hosted_sync.go`), and `hostedFactsSyncAndPull` publishes your branch's facts then merges the settled head back *with server-stamped authors, so teammates' facts become visible locally*. It even falls back to pull-only if your publish grant is missing. **brainstore** is the service side — `factmerge` was exported for it in #338, client in #339.\n\nYou don't have it: you're running 0.1.0, where `connect` is an unknown command. That's a distribution gap, not a missing feature.\n\n## Still running\n\nAn agent is re-validating all 30 backlog rows against `e6bb5c42`. I'm not quoting that list until it comes back — at least two rows (#333 hiding dev commands, #337 brief ordering + recall guidance) have shipped since I wrote it, and handing you a stale list is the exact mistake I made with the PR states this morning.\n\nNext when it lands: mark the dead rows, then start on what survives. The one thing I'd like your call on is whether to reinstall brain from main on this machine — it would give you `connect`, `stop`/`start` and the hidden-command cleanup, but it swaps the binary you've been using."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1267,"cache_read_input_tokens":916801,"output_tokens":743,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1267,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":743,"cache_read_input_tokens":916801,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1267,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1267},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"344c5b26-c774-4cf0-b211-5e6a81d8aaac","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw6ZbCcJFGNWLtVefUbt","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b7f4d1c-9c41-490d-a993-f7ff77821877","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:40:37.298Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
