{"parentUuid":"d57f8f13-8b21-4aa8-9e94-f074de342ebd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw6rPGyWCXXm8LtphFdP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That's the bug, and it's precise. **`CHANGELOG.md` is out of order:**\n\n```\n## [Unreleased]\n## [0.1.0] - 2026-09-19   ← newest date, lowest number\n## [0.3.0] - 2026-09-13\n## [0.2.0] - 2026-09-12\n```\n\nSomeone added a `0.1.0` section *on top* after 0.3.0 shipped. The workflow takes the first version heading it finds, so **every nightly since has been stamped `v0.1.0`** while the real latest tag is `v0.3.1`. That's why your binary says 0.1.0 — it's three minor versions behind reality, caused by a changelog ordering mistake."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1035,"cache_read_input_tokens":922216,"output_tokens":1061,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":529},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1035,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1061,"cache_read_input_tokens":922216,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1035},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"6d4a6ef6-dcad-4977-8ae6-ae0a57b9fe0f","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfw6rNkyD6Gmt4phyxzmt","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"b5b90952-8f85-4b47-9571-9ab994baeb77","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:44:25.222Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/deven