{"parentUuid":"a4f3ce99-5a6d-4bbe-8a71-8aa33aabd243","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14992780 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bd760bd9-a369-4f10-b73d-28d2868aa375","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:44:44.747Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14992780 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"bd760bd9-a369-4f10-b73d-28d2868aa375","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw6tdyaQFsroJ75DYNpq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the real picture, and it's exactly what you're asking for.\n\n## The release gap\n\n**20 days, 253 commits, 24 merged PRs since `v0.1.0` — and `[Unreleased]` is empty.**\n\nNightlies have been cut daily (`v0.1.0-nightly.202610080631.fac3c90e`), so the code ships, but anyone on the *released* artifact is 24 PRs behind. That's why your install lacks `connect`: 0.1.0 predates it by three weeks.\n\n**And I was wrong a moment ago** — `0.1.0` isn't a bug. The changelog states the public line deliberately restarted there after the private `0.2.0`/`0.3.0`, and the workflow reads it correctly. Nothing to fix in the versioning; what's missing is a release.\n\n## What's accumulated, unreleased\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **#307, #308** | MCP over HTTP (authenticated); REST API + Python/TS clients |\n| **#309, #310** | webhooks on brain change; PDF/Word/Excel/PowerPoint ingestion |\n| **#338, #339** | **brainstore / hosted sync — your shared-brain goal** |\n| **#333, #334, #337** | hide dev commands; `stop`/`start`; brief ordering + recall guidance |\n| **#311–#318, #320** | facts across repos, branch-naming on empty results, ollama limits |\n\nThat is a genuinely large release — it's most of your four goals already built.\n\n## How I'd sequence it\n\nYour call was \"release once my goals are fully done\", and three of the four are closer than they looked:\n\n1. **Shared hosted brain** — built (#338/#339), needs a real two-person test.\n2. **First-run flow** — the branch is merged-forward and verified; backlog re-validation lands shortly.\n3. **Docs/simplification** — #333 did part; the rest is backlog rows.\n4. **Efficiency** — the only one with nothing measured yet.\n\nSo the honest order is: finish 1–3, measure 4, write `[Unreleased]` from the 24 PRs, then cut **0.2.0**.\n\nI'd start by drafting the `[Unreleased]` section now rather than at the end — 253 commits are much harder to summarise cold in three weeks' time, and it doubles as the release-readiness checklist.\n\nThe re-validation agent is still running; I'll fold its verdicts in when it lands. Want me to start the changelog draft while we wait?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1453,"cache_read_input_tokens":924778,"output_tokens":815,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1453,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":815,"cache_read_input_tokens":924778,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1453},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d20adc95-c4ec-489e-9032-f8ed44310623","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw6tdTpSV9zLGmiqP1Zn","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"2d97f699-d7a0-449d-b7ab-ee2687b86cf4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:44:59.315Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-install-ux","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
