{"parentUuid":"0fa3916a-f71b-4b5b-8855-553ade7636c9","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14985945 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1ae627d2-f14f-431a-b994-864cef2e32c4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T20:52:41.822Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14985945 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-brain","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"1ae627d2-f14f-431a-b994-864cef2e32c4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw7VogT8kCUV8FX7xnNg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both confirmed. I have to correct something I told you, and one of these is serious.\n\n## I was wrong: #330 and #331 are not on main\n\n```\n#318  base=main                              ✅ on main\n#320  base=main                              ✅ on main\n#330  base=fix/retrieval-output-correctness  ❌ NOT on main\n#331  base=fix/multiagent-safety-indexing-windows  ❌ NOT on main\n```\n\nThey merged **into each other's branches**, not into main. `gh pr list` says `MERGED`, which is true and misleading — I read the state and never checked the base. So \"4 of 6 merged\" was wrong: **only #318 and #320 landed.** #330 and #331 are real, finished fixes sitting on unmerged branches — and landing them is almost certainly cheaper than rewriting the backlog rows they already solve.\n\n## Your shared-brain feature cannot work today\n\n`brain connect` shells out to **`entire repo whereami`**, which doesn't exist — `entire repo` offers `clone create delete get list mirror visibility`. Confirmed live: it prints root usage.\n\nWorse, `hosted_sync.go:51-53` returns `nil` with **no stderr line** when that lookup fails, while every sibling gate prints one. So the team-memory loop silently never engages. And the session-end hook calls it for two branches with a 30s timeout each — **up to 60s of shelling out to a missing command per session end**, with no negative cache. The code even flags it: *\"cache a negative result if that ever gets expensive.\"*\n\nThat's goal #4 shipped but inert.\n\n## The backlog after re-validation\n\n**1 fixed, 4 partial, 25 still open** — and the honest read is that 50 commits moved ~1.5 rows:\n\n- **#318 killed UX-11** (empty fact queries now name the branches that hold facts). Genuinely fixed.\n- **#333 reorganised help without shrinking it** — registered verbs went **44 → 46** (+`connect`/`stop`/`start`). My \"46\" was a registration count; 44 are visible.\n- **#337 made UX-10 worse** — added a sixth CLI-only mandate to a guide an MCP agent can't follow.\n- **The new hosted-sync surface shipped 5 fresh first-run defects**, 3 confirmed live.\n\nTwo of my own rows had bad sub-claims: setup *does* print a \"Next\" block (UX-07), and there are **two** unfailable doctor checks, not three — `write_lock` can actually fail.\n\n## What I'd do now\n\n1. **Land #330 and #331 onto main** — they fix UX-03/04/06, the dirty-tree blockers. Cheapest real progress available.\n2. **Fix `brain connect`** — ND-1/2/3 are a blocker, a silent failure, and a 60s-per-session stall, all in code written for first-time users.\n3. **Then** the release. Shipping 0.2.0 with an inert `connect` would hand every new user your headline feature, broken.\n\nThe `[Unreleased]` draft is written and will need that correction — it currently describes hosted memory as working."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":562,"cache_read_input_tokens":940768,"output_tokens":1026,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":562,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1026,"cache_read_input_tokens":940768,"cache_creation_input_tokens":562,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":562},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce2060fa-6c29-4178-9f34-6f83988c1626","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw7VoDQyoJ1eCTdoGfGe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"7a977502-8cdf