{"parentUuid":"31c331b4-877e-43a8-884d-4dd50b280291","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw8RbGq7JPtivTyATN62","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PLEfCK4FMQCtNYUbSSxdT1","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog\npython3 - <<'PY'\np='docs/install-ux-backlog.md'; s=open(p).read()\nold = \"Baseline: `origin/main` @ `6c8ebdab`. Reproduce any row with `scripts/try-first-run.sh`.\"\nnew = \"\"\"Baseline: re-validated against `origin/main` @ `e6bb5c42` on 2026-10-11.\nReproduce any row with `scripts/try-first-run.sh`.\n\n**Re-validation result: 1 fixed, 4 partial, 25 still open.** Fifty commits moved roughly one\nand a half rows. Three corrections worth carrying:\n\n- **#330 and #331 are NOT on main.** They merged into each other's branches. The open PR\n  **#329** is the ship vehicle: it carries #330, which carries #331, targets `main`, and merges\n  with **zero conflicts** today. One approval closes UX-03, UX-04 and UX-06.\n- **#333 reorganised help without shrinking it** — registered verbs went 44 → 46 (`connect`,\n  `stop`, `start` added; `bench` hidden). The earlier \"46\" was a registration count; 44 are\n  visible. Collapsing the seven retrieval verbs is still undone.\n- **#337 made UX-10 worse**, adding a sixth CLI-only mandate to a guide an MCP-only agent\n  cannot follow.\n\nTwo of my own sub-claims were wrong and are corrected in place: `setup` **does** print a \"Next\"\nblock (UX-07), and there are **two** unfailable `doctor` checks, not three — `write_lock` can\ngenuinely fail.\n\n### Fixed\n- **UX-11** — by #318. An empty fact query now names the branches that do hold facts\n  (`blind_spot.go:113-171`, wired at `retrieve_cmd.go:280,300,372`), ending \"— retry with\n  `--branch`\". Do not re-fix. The `get`/`multi-get` half of UX-12 went with it.\n\n### New defects, all in the hosted-sync surface shipped by #338/#339\n- **ND-1** `brain connect` shells out to `entire repo whereami`, which exists nowhere in the\n  host CLI — not on main, not on a branch. It is tagged COR-2029, i.e. unshipped. A first run\n  cannot succeed, and the error names the missing command.\n- **ND-2** the auto-connect path returns silently on that failure, alone among its sibling\n  gates, so the team-memory loop never engages and never says so.\n- **ND-3** the session-end hook runs it for two branches at 30s each with no negative cache —\n  up to 60s per session end, against a command that cannot exist.\n- **ND-4** *(unverified, does not bite today)* a CLI update banner could be mistaken for the\n  token's last line.\n- **ND-5** `blind_spot.go:260` hardcodes `entire brain connect`, a fresh instance of UX-21,\n  added after that row was filed.\n\nND-1/2/3 are being fixed on `fix/hosted-connect-fails-loudly`.\"\"\"\nassert old in s, \"anchor missing\"\nopen(p,'w').write(s.replace(old,new,1))\nprint(\"  backlog re-validated\")\nPY\ngit diff --stat docs/install-ux-backlog.md | sed 's/^/  /'","description":"Update the backlog with re-validation results"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2487,"cache_read_input_tokens":956112,"output_tokens":1247,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2487},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1247,"cache_read_input_tokens":956112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2487,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2487,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01PLEfCK4FMQCtNYUbSSxdT1":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/br