{"parentUuid":"a4b20171-5f44-4366-8983-800ce0006043","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog/docs/install-ux-backlog.md","snippet":""},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8683b851-0162-475b-a603-1c2150b338be","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:05:06.272Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog/docs/install-ux-backlog.md changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. The changes are not shown here; use Read if you need the current content.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"8683b851-0162-475b-a603-1c2150b338be","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14994605 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cc1078ed-cecb-4f3b-809a-42726b6882c3","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:05:06.272Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14994605 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
{"parentUuid":"cc1078ed-cecb-4f3b-809a-42726b6882c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw8Sgoz1yt4xSBtWVWgE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing will merge until you say we're done. Here's where things stand.\n\n## Running now\n\nTwo fix agents, each isolated in its own worktree:\n\n- **`fix/hosted-connect-fails-loudly`** — the three confirmed `connect` defects: silent failure, the error naming a command that doesn't exist, and the 60s-per-session-end stall.\n- **`fix/runnable-advice`** — three rows that share one disease, *a string telling the user something untrue*: `entire brain index` (12 sites, verb doesn't exist), `.brainignore` named nowhere, and the guide denying a tool the same build registers.\n\nThat second batch also adds the guard that stops the class recurring — a test extracting every backticked `entire brain <verb>` from source and asserting it resolves. **That pattern already exists and works**: `benchmarks_doc_test.go` does it for the benchmarks page, and caught two broken commands in its own first draft. The error strings just never got the same treatment.\n\n## Corrected in the backlog\n\n**#329 is the ship vehicle, and I had it wrong.** #331 → `fix/multiagent-safety-indexing-windows` → #330 → `fix/retrieval-output-correctness` → **#329, open against main, zero conflicts.** One approval closes UX-03, UX-04 and UX-06 — the dirty-tree blockers. That's the cheapest real progress available when you're ready.\n\nAlso corrected: two of my own sub-claims were wrong — `setup` *does* print a \"Next\" block, and there are two unfailable `doctor` checks, not three.\n\n## The honest scoreboard\n\n**1 fixed, 4 partial, 25 open.** Fifty commits moved about one and a half rows, and the new hosted-sync surface added five fresh first-run defects — three confirmed live. So the gap isn't closing on its own; it's roughly breaking even.\n\nRelease readiness is gated on exactly that: the changelog now says in writing that hosted memory **must not ship in 0.2.0 as written**, because shipping your headline feature inert is worse than not shipping it.\n\nI'll report both agents with their weakening evidence when they land, then keep working the list."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_read_input_tokens":958599,"output_tokens":712,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1474},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":712,"cache_read_input_tokens":958599,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1474,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"c96344ab-15fc-4bc3-8651-09d0fbc75174","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cfw8SgCGmy73oVLXSv5qh","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"a8d219d4-d58c-48e7-b4ed-36b49063afd1","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:05:16.499Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
