{"parentUuid":"c2c5774e-212d-431f-838c-c2f386b08726","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cfw99h7jNJN8mv5dcVyC4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012JCC8zGgW3MZKqqjHGnkBp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-not-on-api-main.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold='description: \"The brain subsystem is NOT on entire-api main — zero brain files; it lives only in the unmerged 10-part stack #744-#752 + #242, ~599 commits behind, so brain server defects are not live risks\"'\nnew='description: \"The brain subsystem is NOT on entire-api main — zero brain files; it lives only in the unmerged 10-part stack #744-#752 + #242, now 1824 commits + 97 migrations behind, so the shared-hosted-brain goal has no server\"'\nassert old in s, 'description anchor missing'\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nassert s.rstrip().endswith('[[brain-ci-gate-split-trust]].'), 'tail anchor missing'\ns=s.rstrip()+'''\n\n## Re-measured 2026-10-11 — the drift is now the blocker\n\nStill **0** brain files and **0** brain routes on `entire-api` origin/main (`86e264892`).\nThe stack has not been touched since **2026-08-22** and has drifted badly:\n\n- **main is 1,824 commits ahead** of `#744` (which is itself only 3 commits ahead of its fork point).\n- **97 migration files** landed on main in that window — which is precisely why\n  `migration-check` fails on **every** PR from #745 onward.\n- Code CI: **#744 is green** (10 pass, `test-perf` skipped); its only red is **Entire Gates**, the\n  trail gate, i.e. review — not the build. **#745–#749 are genuinely red**\n  (`migration-check`, `test`, and on #745/#747 also `build-vet-lint`).\n  **#750 is CONFLICTING**; **#751, #752, #242 have no CI run at all.**\n- Nine further fix PRs (#917-#928) hang off intermediate levels of the stack.\n\n**Consequence for the \"shared hosted brain / see teammates' facts\" goal:** the CLIENT half is on\n`entire-brain` main (`connect_cmd.go`, `hosted_sync.go`, `hosted_token.go`, `hosted_binding.go`,\n`publish.go`), but there is **no server to talk to**. Shipping that goal is not CLI polish — it is\nreviving a ~10,000-line, 10-PR stack across a 1,824-commit / 97-migration gap. Price that honestly\nbefore promising it; the rebase, not the review, is the long pole.\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('updated:', p)\nPY\ngrep -c . /Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-not-on-api-main.md","description":"Update brain server memory with current drift measurement"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1371,"cache_read_input_tokens":128846,"output_tokens":1242,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":222},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1371},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1242,"cache_read_input_tokens":128846,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1371,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_012JCC8zGgW3MZKqqjHGnkBp":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-not-on-api-main.md'\ns=open(p).read()\nold='description: \"The brain subsystem is NOT on entire-api main — zero brain files; it lives only in the unmerged 10-part stack #744-#752 + #242, ~599 commits behind, so brain server defects are not live risks\"'\nnew='description: \"The brain subsystem is NOT on entire-api main — zero brain files; it lives only in the unmerged 10-part stack #744-#752 + #242, now 1824 commits + 97 migrations behind, so the shared-hosted-brain goal has no server\"'\nassert old in s, 'description anchor missing'\ns=s.replace(old,new)\nassert s.rstrip().endswith('[[brain-ci-gate-split-trust]].'), 'tail anchor missing'\ns=s.rstrip()+'''\n\n## Re-measured 2026-10-11 — the drift is now the blocker\n\nStill **0** brain files and **0** brain routes on `entire-api` origin/main (`86e264892`).\nThe stack has not been touched since **2026-08-22** and has drifted badly:\n\n- **main is 1,824 commits ahead** of `#744` (which is itself only 3 commits ahead of its fork point).\n- **97 migration files** landed on main in that window — which is precisely why\n  `migration-check` fails on **every** PR from #745 onward.\n- Code CI: **#744 is green** (10 pass, `test-perf` skipped); its only red is **Entire Gates**, the\n  trail gate, i.e. review — not the build. **#745–#749 are genuinely red**\n  (`migration-check`, `test`, and on #745/#747 also `build-vet-lint`).\n  **#750 is CONFLICTING**; **#751, #752, #242 have no CI run at all.**\n- Nine further fix PRs (#917-#928) hang off intermediate levels of the stack.\n\n**Consequence for the \"shared hosted brain / see teammates' facts\" goal:** the CLIENT half is on\n`entire-brain` main (`connect_cmd.go`, `hosted_sync.go`, `hosted_token.go`, `hosted_binding.go`,\n`publish.go`), but there is **no server to talk to**. Shipping that goal is not CLI polish — it is\nreviving a ~10,000-line, 10-PR stack across a 1,824-commit / 97-migration gap. Price that honestly\nbefore promising it; the rebase, not the review, is the long pole.\n'''\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint('updated:', p)\nPY\ngrep -c . /Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-not-on-api-main.md","description":"Update brain server memory with current drift measurement"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"aa5b628b-1da5-457a-9cae-5abdf3aa6427","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cfw99gkA26apqgHoQHZxx","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"ff2a5fe9