{"parentUuid":"9478d2a6-7f16-4329-8c51-029b1f292cf2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b1331e42-5b90-45b6-9c58-e0c78213a423","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CXyES4mA4fR6kjWyQDAKmG","type":"tool_result","content":"=== BOB's own facts BEFORE importing alice\nfact:636005ba1f56d847409ed447 decision [architecture.client.decision]\n  BOB FACT: the retry budget is 3 attempts with jitter.\n\n=== BOB imports alice's bundle with --overwrite\nimported bundle entries: 18\nsha256: a63e9337ee157b155a8f22e1368161bde657e9938dea3f7e0eefe4b514557f17\nrestored layers: semantic, seed, docs, facts\n\n=== Does BOB still have HIS OWN fact?  (merge vs replace)\nno facts for \"retry budget\" on main\nnote: no distillation timestamp is recorded; run `entire brain refresh`, then `distill`\n\n=== Does BOB have ALICE's fact?\nfact:4936f57af2a0691cec0e5ffc decision [architecture.storage.decision]\n  ALICE FACT: we chose BadgerDB over SQLite for the object store.\n\n=== full fact inventory on bob\nReview, promote, and garbage-collect durable facts\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain facts [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  eval         Measure retrieval quality (tokens, precision, useful-items-per-1k) over held-out tasks\n  eval-compare Paired A/B comparison of two eval runs with a t-test and Holm correction\n  eval-gen     Generate a silver-labeled eval task set from the brain's own sessions\n  gc           Prune retracted and old superseded facts; report orphans\n  map          Render the synthesized fact outline (summaries + structure) with progressive disclosure\n  outline      Generate the synthesized hierarchical fact outline (agent rollup summaries)\n  promote      Carry a branch's active facts into another branch\n  proposals    Review the hosted cross-member conflict queue (opt-in)\n  reclassify   Backfill the deterministic KIND onto facts missing one (no agent)\n  retract      Mark a fact as retracted (no longer true); pruned later by gc\n  review       Resolve queued low-confidence merge/supersede proposals\n  status       Summarize durable fact readiness without refreshing or writing\n  sync         Read-merge-CAS this branch's local facts into the shared fact-set head\n  tree         Show facts as a navigable hierarchy with progressive disclosure\n\nROOT=/var/folders/wb/5flrfjsj0px0nc4tvnbkxrhc0000gn/T/tmp.GraSfhGecc","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"093bf571-917d-4eea-baee-0d97f8819cb6","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:19:46.542Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== BOB's own facts BEFORE importing alice\nfact:636005ba1f56d847409ed447 decision [architecture.client.decision]\n  BOB FACT: the retry budget is 3 attempts with jitter.\n\n=== BOB imports alice's bundle with --overwrite\nimported bundle entries: 18\nsha256: a63e9337ee157b155a8f22e1368161bde657e9938dea3f7e0eefe4b514557f17\nrestored layers: semantic, seed, docs, facts\n\n=== Does BOB still have HIS OWN fact?  (merge vs replace)\nno facts for \"retry budget\" on main\nnote: no distillation timestamp is recorded; run `entire brain refresh`, then `distill`\n\n=== Does BOB have ALICE's fact?\nfact:4936f57af2a0691cec0e5ffc decision [architecture.storage.decision]\n  ALICE FACT: we chose BadgerDB over SQLite for the object store.\n\n=== full fact inventory on bob\nReview, promote, and garbage-collect durable facts\n\nUsage:\n  entire-brain facts [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  eval         Measure retrieval quality (tokens, precision, useful-items-per-1k) over held-out tasks\n  eval-compare Paired A/B comparison of two eval runs with a t-test and Holm correction\n  eval-gen     Generate a silver-labeled eval task set from the brain's own sessions\n  gc           Prune retracted and old superseded facts; report orphans\n  map          Render the synthesized fact outline (summaries + structure) with progressive disclosure\n  outline      Generate the synthesized hierarchical fact outline (agent rollup summaries)\n  promote      Carry a branch's active facts into another bran