cond angle).\n\nCorrects two claims that were wrong:\n\n  UX-07  said setup \"prints no next step\". It does print a Next block\n         (overview / brief / status). The real defect is narrower and\n         still true: Next never names init-agents.\n  try-first-run.sh asserted \"brain's per-repo store still lands in the\n         temp dir\". False — verified by `entire brain path`. The comment\n         now records the measurement and the partial fix (link only\n         plugins/bin), including that the fix does not stop the memory\n         worker leaking into the real store.\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1\ngit status --porcelain | head","description":"Commit backlog rows and harness correction"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"0d6b139c-a806-40e8-a5b8-cffdc321063c","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cfw9pqtRRyvEzbjyHUAGS","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5[1m]","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b037602-2c4e-49e1-b25e-561dc173fa43","timestamp":"2026-10-11T21:23:24.837Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/brain-ux-backlog","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
