{"parentUuid":"5479b57d-0c43-4fc6-96b4-49ffde9d84c5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfwACYF9C51kkZhCBTnMT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Paused.\n\n**State right now:**\n\n- **Three agents still running** in the background (setup/status output truth, setup-wires-agents, doctor+dead-surface). They'll keep going and report; say the word if you want them stopped.\n- **One just finished** — `fix/runnable-advice` @ `f18b1e4e`, 14 files, +509/−29, local only. UX-02/05/09 closed with 6 weakenings all verified red. It flagged one pre-existing failure it reproduced on pristine `e6bb5c42` (`TestOllamaDistillAgentEnvelopeAllowanceIsCeilinged`) — not caused by its change.\n- **Nothing pushed, nothing merged, no PRs opened.**\n\n**Mid-flight on `/brainusage`:** the extractor works and is fast (1.5s over 1,326 transcript files, 255 real events). I'd just fixed it to use a verb allowlist — the first version was matching the `devenv/entire-brain` *directory* and reporting verbs like `echo` and `git`. It now also pairs results back to calls so it can show answered vs empty. Not yet rendered — no bar chart or heatmap drawn.\n\nTwo things I found while you were away that you'll want to weigh in on:\n\n1. **Goal 4 has no server.** `entire-api` main has zero brain files and zero brain routes. The hosted half is a 10-PR stack that's **1,824 commits and 97 migrations stale**; #744 is code-green but #745+ are genuinely red. Bundles *do* work as an interim path (verified two-machine), but import **replaces** rather than merges — the receiver silently loses their own facts, and `recall` then blames distillation.\n2. **#329 and #321 are both fully green and mergeable** whenever you approve — not touched.\n\nGo ahead."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8223,"cache_read_input_tokens":204964,"output_tokens":881,"ou