{"parentUuid":"d4d7b8ee-21f4-4844-b14d-abe902d39ac6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b0f4209b-da86-4b3e-a0bc-6ee57a9af6f8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MkwoAxckMSJU5e2RaqftZF","type":"tool_result","content":"README updated\n=== final: both suites ===\nOK\n 26 pass\n 0 fail\nRan 26 tests across 1 file. [16.08s]\n  ❯ ./register.js state reads: brain-memory.calls, brain-memory.turn, brain-memory.usage\n\n✘ Validation failed","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"bbc3ceec-5125-45b0-b4ea-28de8ef4bbf4","timestamp":"2026-10-11T22:03:00.342Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"README updated\n=== final: both suites ===\nOK\n 26 pass\n 0 fail\nRan 26 tests across 1 file. [16.08s]\n  ❯ ./register.js state reads: brain-memory.calls, brain-memory.turn, brain-memory.usage\n\n✘ Validation failed","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory/README.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":37,"oldLines":6,"newStart":37,"newLines":67,"lines":[" (`entire brain …`, `entire-brain …`). The mod only observes — a tool result reaches"," Claude exactly as the tool returned it, pinned by a test."," ","+## `/brainusage` — is the habit forming?","+","+The pane above answers \"what did brain give me just now\". It cannot answer \"is the","+agent reaching for brain at all, and is it getting anything back\", because `$.state`","+resets on `/clear` and `/resume`. That question needs history, and the only record of","+it is the transcript corpus.","+","+```","+/brainusage          the last month (the default)","+/brainusage 7        narrow the window","+```","+","+```","+Brain usage  last 31d  255 calls  236 answered  9 empty (4%)  10 failed","+","+·▁▃··▁▁▁▃▅▅▁▇▁▁▁▁▁▁·▁▁██▂▂···▁▅","+2026-09-11  →  2026-10-11   24 of 31 days active","+","+month ──────────────────────────────────","+Mon    ·· ██ ██ ██","+Tue    ·· ██ ██ ██","+...","+quiet ·· ██ ██ ██ ██ ██ busy (max 43/day)","+","+day by day, newest first ────────────────","+10-11 ███████████████ 20 · 3 empty","+10-04 ████████████████████████████████ 43 · 1 empty","+","+what it was asked for ───────────────────","+refresh      ██████████████████ 25","+remember     █████████████████ 23","+```","+","+One glyph per day, then the same month as a calendar, then the days that had traffic,","+then which verbs were actually used. The ramp runs cool → warm as usage rises, because","+reaching for brain is the good case here. A day with nothing is a dim dot, never a","+colour: a zero given a colour reads as a value, which is the mistake this mod is about.","+","+`scripts/collect-usage.py` does the scanning in a child process (the corpus here is","+2.0 GB across 2,996 files; the month window is ~1.5 s). Two things it gets right only","+because they were found by running it:","+","+- **`entire-brain` is also a directory.** `cd ~/devenv/entire-brain` followed by a","+  newline puts the next shell word exactly where a verb goes, so a naive match reports","+  `echo` and `git` as brain usage. A verb allowlist catches most of it, but not when","+  that word *is* a verb (`status=$(git status)`), so the match also refuses a preceding","+  `/`. It took three attempts to write a test that actually held — the first two passed","+  with the guard removed.","+- **A file's mtime bounds the scan, but not its contents.** A file last written before","+  the window cannot hold events inside it, so mtime is a sound filter — but a file","+  written today may carry months, so every matching line is date-checked on its own.","+","+```","+python3 scripts/collect-usage.py 31 > /tmp/u.json   # the data","+node scripts/preview.mjs /tmp/u.json                # the pane, rendered outside Claude Code","+python3 scripts/test_collect_usage.py               # the collector's own guards","+```","+","+`preview.mjs` imports `hooks/register.js` unmodified, so it cannot drift from what the","+pane really draws.","+"," ## Install"," "," Already wired via `env.CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_DIRS` in `~/.claude/settings.json`. To remove it,"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory/README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"773a4a60-b257-437d-9cf6-ba56badb0e79","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory","root":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":252},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/devenv","visibility":"private"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entireio/entire-brain","visibility":"public"},{"host":"github.com","remote":"entirehq/entire-api","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d4d7b8ee-21f4-4844-b14d-abe902d39ac6","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"session_id":"1eac9040-9610-45f1-aa43-df0931455a37","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/.claude/mods/brain-memory","sessionId":"6ca2c8fb-c97b-4bf3-a992-0e3c6d1967e2","version":"2.1.296","gitBranch":"main","slug":"dynamic-petting-globe"}
